window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df12"]={"id": "df12", "title": "ELBO：变分下界与逐项 KL", "focus": "从变分推断推导扩散 ELBO，把它分解为逐时间步的 KL；推导高斯后验闭式、方差下界、重参数化与训练目标简化。", "claims": ["\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right]", "q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)", "\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t"], "topics": ["变分下界的推导", "ELBO 的 KL 分解", "逐时间步的 KL", "后验 q(x_{t-1}|x_t,x_0)", "高斯后验的闭式", "方差下界", "重参数化", "训练目标的简化", "与得分匹配的关系", "反例：忽略时间权重导致目标偏差", "离散时间 ELBO", "连续时间 ELBO", "代码：ELBO 的数值计算", "代码：KL 分解的验证", "与 DDPM 章的接口", "本章推导链：ELBO = 逐项 KL"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df12--h-变分下界的推导\">变分下界的推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-变分下界的推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节承接全书统一记号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为观测样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 为固定扩散步数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 为前向马尔可夫链的隐变量，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>。前向核与边缘分布记为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\ \\beta_t I\\right),\\qquad\nq(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\ (1-\\bar\\alpha_t) I\\right),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 单位阵。反向生成模型记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为可微参数。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0):=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 为前向联合分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T}):=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为反向联合分布。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅有：变分分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span>（已由前向链给出，无需新定义）、对数似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>、以及证据下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)$</span>。为书写简洁，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\cdot]:=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}[\\cdot]$</span>，即对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 条件下前向链全部隐变量的期望。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 绝对连续性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 均为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上 Lebesgue 测度的绝对连续分布，密度处处为正。这保证 Radon–Nikodym 导数（即密度比）几乎处处有定义，且 KL 散度有限或为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\big|\\log p_\\theta(x_T)\\big|\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span> 且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\big|\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big|\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\big|\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big|\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设在高斯核下自动成立：高斯对数密度是二次型，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下各变量为高斯或其线性变换，二次型期望有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 后验良定义.</strong> 条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由 Bayes 公式给出，且其密度关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续。由前向链的马尔可夫性与高斯性，该后验为高斯，故 (A1)(A2) 同时覆盖它。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 可微性与交换.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto \\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-可积的支配函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x_{0:T})$</span> 使得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的每个局部邻域内所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big|\\nabla_\\theta \\log p_{\\theta'}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big|\\le g_t(x_{0:T})$</span>。此假设用于在第 7 节讨论重参数化时交换期望与梯度；本节主定理的证明本身不需要 (A4)，仅在第 6 小节给出推论时引用。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 非退化方差.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I$</span> 正定。此假设保证后验协方差矩阵可逆，闭式解中出现的矩阵逆有意义。</p>\n<p>下面给出本节的核心定义与主定理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-定义-证据下界\">定义：证据下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-定义-证据下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)\n:=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p>它与相邻概念的区别须说清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 本身；它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的函数（逐样本），而非对数据分布的泛函；它依赖变分分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 由前向链固定、不参与优化。这与变分自编码器中同时优化编码器与解码器的情形不同：此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 无参数，ELBO 仅是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数。此外，ELBO 是联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 之间 KL 的负值加上常数，这一点在下一节展开，本节只做推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-主定理-变分下界不等式\">主定理：变分下界不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-主定理-变分下界不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（ELBO 不等式）.</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3)、(A5) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ \\ge\\ \\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 关键步骤是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的期望，再用 Jensen 不等式。逐步写出：</p>\n<p>第一步，边缘化恒等式。由全概率公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的联合分解，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x_0)=\\int p_\\theta(x_{0:T})\\,\\mathrm dx_{1:T}.$$</div>\n在 (A1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续，积分有意义。</p>\n<p>第二步，引入正密度比。由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 几乎处处，故可写\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x_0)=\\int q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\,\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\,\\mathrm dx_{1:T}\n=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\right].$$</div>\n此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是概率密度，积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；被积函数非负，交换“积分”与“乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>”是平凡的，无需 Fubini。</p>\n<p>第三步，取对数并用 Jensen。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上严格凹，故对非负随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\log Z]\\le\\log\\mathbb E[Z]$</span>（允许两端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>）。取\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z:=\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)},\\qquad \\mathbb E_q[Z]=p_\\theta(x_0),$$</div>\n得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\log Z]\\ \\le\\ \\log p_\\theta(x_0).$$</div>\nJensen 不等式的适用条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z&gt;0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[Z]&lt;\\infty$</span>；前者由 (A1)，后者由第二步的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[Z]=p_\\theta(x_0)&lt;\\infty$</span>（概率密度积分有限）。</p>\n<p>第四步，展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z$</span>。由联合分解，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log Z=\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)-\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n再用前向链的马尔可夫分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，并注意对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的关系由 Bayes 公式给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_0)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n将此代入并整理，得到逐项形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log Z=\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}+\\log\\frac{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}{q(x_0)}.$$</div>\n最后一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)-\\log q(x_0)$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处的密度值（在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件下为常数），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 边缘密度的期望对数，它一般不为零。为使等式干净，我们采用标准写法：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 直接写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\cdot q(x_T\\mid x_0)/q(x_0)$</span> 并不方便；更直接的做法是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 逐项配对，利用\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\Big/ q(x_0),$$</div>\n其中右端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 视为点质量，则形式上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。在扩散模型中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 是观测数据、不被建模为随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 取为退化分布，故可略去。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\log Z]=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right]+\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)].$$</div>\n这里出现了一个额外的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span> 项，它不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，但在数值上不为零。为使不等式与 canonical claim 完全一致，须说明：canonical 形式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 的比值中，即把第一项写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 而把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的边缘、在 ELBO 中不显式出现。严格地说，若定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}(\\theta;x_0):=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_T)}{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right],$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}=\\mathbb E_q[\\log Z]$</span> 精确成立，且由第三步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>。canonical claim 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span> 的第一项相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span>，后者是常数。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)I)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to 0$</span> 时该项趋于高斯熵常数，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化。因此把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 单独写出、省略 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 的做法，等价于在 ELBO 上加减同一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数；下界性质不变，梯度也不变（第 7 节将用 (A4) 说明这一点）。为与 canonical claim 一致，本节采用\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right],$$</div>\n并注明：它与精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log Z]$</span> 相差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span>，故不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)+\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span> 成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 被吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 的记号时，canonical 不等式按字面成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 上述“常数差”不是文字游戏：它正是下一节 KL 分解中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span> 项的来源。本节只推导不等式，下一节把它写成 KL 和。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-推论-ELBO-与联合-KL-的恒等关系\">推论：ELBO 与联合 KL 的恒等关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-推论-ELBO-与联合-KL-的恒等关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（KL 恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)\n=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\big(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\big)+\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_0))=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\right].$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{0:T})/p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\n=\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})+\\log p_\\theta(x_0).$$</div>\n取期望，第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})$</span> 的组合正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z$</span> 的期望，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q[\\log Z]$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log Z]=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}+\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span>（由命题 1 证明第四步）。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)],$$</div>\n移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出可检验的恒等式：若数值上算出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>（后者在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 时可用数值积分），则两者之差应等于联合 KL 加常数项。第 13、14 节的代码将验证这一点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-具体例子-T-1-的闭式计算\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的闭式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-具体例子-T-1-的闭式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.5$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>。前向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_0,0.5)$</span>。反向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_1)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_1),\\sigma^2)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=0.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_1)=\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_1$</span>（即“完美去噪”）。此时后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 是退化分布（点质量于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>），ELBO 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\sim q(x_1\\mid x_0)$</span> 下的期望。直接计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]=-\\tfrac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma^2)-\\frac{\\mathbb E[(x_0-\\sqrt{0.5}x_1)^2]}{2\\sigma^2}.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.5}x_0+\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0-\\sqrt{0.5}x_1=0.5x_0-0.5\\epsilon$</span>，其平方期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.25x_0^2+0.25$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=0.5$</span>，则第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(0.25x_0^2+0.25)/1=-0.25x_0^2-0.25$</span>。第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\log(\\pi)$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\tfrac12\\log\\pi-0.25x_0^2-0.25+\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_1)].$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_1)]=-\\tfrac12\\log(2\\pi)-\\tfrac12\\mathbb E[x_1^2]=-\\tfrac12\\log(2\\pi)-\\tfrac12(0.5x_0^2+0.5)$</span>。合并得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\tfrac12\\log(2\\pi)-\\tfrac12\\log\\pi-\\tfrac12(0.5x_0^2+0.5)-0.25x_0^2-0.25.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，数值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\log(2\\pi)\\approx-0.9189$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\log\\pi\\approx-0.5724$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.5\\cdot0.75=-0.375$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.25-0.25=-0.5$</span>，总和约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2.366$</span>。另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0)=\\int p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)p_\\theta(x_1)\\mathrm dx_1$</span> 下可数值算出，应不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2.366$</span>。此例说明：ELBO 是下界，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时 KL 项退化为单步重构项加先验项，与下一节分解一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-与相邻概念的区别及推导边界\">与相邻概念的区别及推导边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-与相邻概念的区别及推导边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>须强调三点区别。第一，ELBO 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的近似等式；差值恰为联合 KL（命题 2），只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 恰为真实后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 时 KL 为零、ELBO 取等。第二，ELBO 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是前向链诱导的、固定的，不是可优化变分族；这与变分推断中“选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 使 KL 最小”的视角相反——此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 决定，优化只发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 上。第三，Jensen 不等式的方向决定了 ELBO 是下界而非上界；若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的角色互换，得到的是上界（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 的 Jensen），不可混用。</p>\n<p>边界情形：若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 退化为点质量，(A1) 失效，KL 可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，ELBO 不等式仍成立但无信息；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>，则 (A5) 失效，后验协方差奇异，闭式解不适用。这些失效模式在第 10 节反例节集中处理，本节只标注假设边界。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在绝对连续性、可积性与非退化方差假设下，Jensen 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)$</span>，其中 ELBO 是前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下对数密度比的期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 固定、仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可优化。</li>\n<li>差值恒等于联合 KL 加常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span>；canonical 形式通过把该常数吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 的记号而保持字面一致，下一节的 KL 分解将显式暴露这一项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的闭式例子与数值代码验证了不等式方向与恒等式，并标明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 时假设失效、闭式解不可用，相关反例留待第 10 节集中处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-3-ELBO-的显式展开与逐项配对\">命题 3：ELBO 的显式展开与逐项配对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-3-ELBO-的显式展开与逐项配对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的命题 1 与命题 2 已经确立了下界方向与 KL 恒等式。为使后续 KL 分解节有严格的代数基础，此处把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的期望展开为逐项配对的形式，并给出每一步所依赖的假设。此命题不引入新的分布假设，仅重排命题 1 证明第四步中的代数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（逐项配对恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)\n=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]\n+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 是有限和（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定）的期望。由 (A2)，每一项的绝对值期望有限，故期望与有限和可交换（有限和无需 Fubini，逐项相加即可）。将期望分配到每一项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（有限和与无穷和的区别）.</strong> 此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 是固定整数，故“期望与求和交换”是有限线性运算，不涉及单调收敛或控制收敛。这一点在连续时间 ELBO（第 12 节）中会改变：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 或时间连续化时，求和变为积分，交换需要单调收敛定理或控制收敛定理，届时须重新验证条件。本节不处理该极限，仅标注边界。</p>\n<p>此命题的价值在于：它把 ELBO 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T+1$</span> 个独立期望之和，每一项只涉及相邻两个时间步的变量。下一节的 KL 分解正是对这 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T+1$</span> 项逐项识别为 KL 散度或熵项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-4-后验的-Bayes-表示与可测性\">命题 4：后验的 Bayes 表示与可测性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-4-后验的-Bayes-表示与可测性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 的证明中使用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，但未证明它作为条件分布的存在性与唯一性。此处补足。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（后验的存在性与绝对连续性）.</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3)、(A5) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 存在、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处唯一，且关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续，其密度为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一步，联合密度的分解。由前向链的马尔可夫性与 (A1)，三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t,x_0)$</span> 的联合密度为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1},x_t,x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_0),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处的退化质量（在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件下视为常数）。此处用到条件独立结构：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 条件独立，这是前向链的定义性质。</p>\n<p>第二步，边缘化。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 积分得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t,x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_0),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 由前向链的高斯闭式给出（见符号表），非退化由 (A5) 保证。</p>\n<p>第三步，条件密度。由 Bayes 公式，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 处\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_{t-1},x_t,x_0)}{q(x_t,x_0)}\n=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n分母为正由 (A5) 与高斯密度处处为正保证；分子为正由 (A1)。故密度处处有定义且绝对连续。唯一性来自条件期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处意义下的唯一性（Radon–Nikodym 定理）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题为下一节“后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>”节提供了严格的存在性基础，也说明命题 1 中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 取对数是有意义的：密度处处为正，对数为有限实数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-5-ELBO-对-theta-的可微性与梯度交换\">命题 5：ELBO 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可微性与梯度交换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-5-ELBO-对-theta-的可微性与梯度交换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“变分下界的推导”，但 ELBO 的实际用途是作为优化目标。若不能对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，下界只是数值不等式。此处给出梯度交换的充分条件，为第 7 节重参数化做铺垫。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（梯度与期望交换）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)$</span> 连续可微，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)\n=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一步，逐项可微。由 (A4)，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 同理（先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，其梯度为零，但为统一处理仍纳入）。有限和的导数等于导数之和。</p>\n<p>第二步，交换期望与梯度。对每一项，须验证 Leibniz 积分法则的条件：被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0:T}$</span> 可积，且存在局部可积的支配函数。这正是 (A4) 的内容。由 Leibniz 法则（即控制收敛定理的推论），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)]\n=\\mathbb E_q[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)].$$</div>\n此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故期望测度固定，交换仅涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 两个变量。</p>\n<p>第三步，求和。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 及先验项逐项应用第二步，有限和保持可微性，得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的关键性）.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 也依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>（例如变分自编码器中编码器与解码器共享参数），则交换期望与梯度需要处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta q$</span> 项，即得分函数估计器或重参数化技巧。本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 由固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故命题 5 的证明无需这些技巧。第 7 节讨论重参数化时，处理的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 内部对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的依赖，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的依赖。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-6-ELBO-的尺度不变性与常数吸收\">命题 6：ELBO 的尺度不变性与常数吸收<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-6-ELBO-的尺度不变性与常数吸收\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 的证明第四步留下了一个悬而未决的问题：canonical claim 中省略了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span>，这是否影响下界的有效性？此处给出严格回答。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（常数吸收不改变下界与梯度）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{canon}}(\\theta;x_0)\n:=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right],$$</div>\n以及精确形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}(\\theta;x_0)\n:=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_T)}{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right].$$</div>\n则 (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}(\\theta;x_0)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{canon}}(\\theta;x_0)-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span>；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\tilde{\\mathcal L}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{canon}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 直接由定义相减：两项之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span>，该量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。(ii) 由命题 1 证明第四步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log Z]=\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span>，而 Jensen 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log Z]\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>。(iii) 由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span> 时，常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span> 的梯度为零；两项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分完全相同，故梯度相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：canonical claim 的写法在优化意义上是无损的——省略的常数项不影响梯度，也不影响“下界”这一定性结论（只是下界的数值平移了一个常数）。但须注意，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{canon}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 直接比较，不等式方向可能因常数符号而变；命题 1 的严格陈述应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>，而 canonical 形式是在“<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 被吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 的记号”这一约定下成立。这一约定在下一节 KL 分解中会被显式化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span> 项正是该常数与先验项的组合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-7-T-1-时-ELBO-的-KL-解释\">命题 7：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时 ELBO 的 KL 解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-7-T-1-时-ELBO-的-KL-解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使本节与下一节的衔接具体化，此处把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的 ELBO 写成两个 KL 项的组合，作为下一节一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的 KL 分解的雏形。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的 KL 分解）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3)、(A5) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{canon}}(\\theta;x_0)\n=-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\big(q(x_1\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_1)\\big)\n+\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\!\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\big]\n+\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\!\\big[\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)\\big].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定义展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{canon}}\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\!\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_1)+\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)}{q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)}\\right].$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 是点质量于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，其对数为零（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处），故第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]$</span>。第一项加第三项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}[\\log p_\\theta(x_1)]+\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}[\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)]\n=-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_1\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_1)),$$</div>\n因为 KL 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q-\\log p]$</span>。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与上一小节的数值例子一致：数值例子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的三部分正是重构项、先验 KL 项与熵项。下一节将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;1$</span> 的情形分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个逐时间步 KL 加一个先验 KL，其结构与命题 7 同构，只是每个时间步的“后验”由命题 4 的 Bayes 密度给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-8-ELBO-作为-x_0-的函数的可测性\">命题 8：ELBO 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的函数的可测性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-8-ELBO-作为-x_0-的函数的可测性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有命题均以“<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>”陈述。为使这一陈述有意义，须说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;\\cdot)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的函数是可测的，否则“几乎处处”无定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（可测性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\mapsto\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数可测。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 联合可测：它是高斯密度，高斯密度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的连续函数，故 Borel 可测。第二步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由命题 4 的 Bayes 公式给出，是三个可测函数的商（分母为正），故可测。第三步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 可测（高斯对数密度连续），复合上可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{0:T})\\mapsto(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 仍可测。第四步，期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\cdot]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的可测函数：对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 是概率核，积分是核作用，由核的可测性（高斯核关于参数连续）保证结果关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 可测。有限和保持可测性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的证明依赖高斯核的连续性，这是本节假设 (A1) 的具体化。若前向核不是高斯而是仅可测的抽象核，可测性需要作为额外假设写入 (A1)；本节的高斯设定使该假设自动满足。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-推导链的闭合\">推导链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-推导链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此，本节完成了以下链条：命题 1 给出不等式方向（Jensen），命题 2 给出与联合 KL 的恒等关系，命题 3 把 ELBO 写成逐项期望之和，命题 4 补足后验的存在性，命题 5 给出梯度交换的充分条件，命题 6 澄清常数吸收的无损性，命题 7 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的 KL 雏形，命题 8 保证“几乎处处”陈述有意义。这八条命题共同构成下一节 KL 分解的严格前提：下一节将对命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T+1$</span> 项逐项识别，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 的项由命题 4 的 Bayes 密度化为高斯 KL，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的项由命题 7 的结构化为重构项，先验项由命题 6 的常数吸收处理。本节不展开这些识别，只确保它们所需的数学对象均已良定义、可积、可微、可测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-ELBO-的-KL-分解\">ELBO 的 KL 分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-ELBO-的-KL-分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 12 章第 1 节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为观测样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1,\\dots,x_T$</span> 为前向扩散潜变量，前向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，联合前向分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>。反向生成模型为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>。第 1 节已证变分下界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge \\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right]=:\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>本节需要以下假设，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q|\\log p_\\theta(x_T)|&lt;\\infty$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q|\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)|&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q|\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)|&lt;\\infty$</span>。这保证第 1 节 ELBO 的每一项都是有限实数，从而下述逐项重写不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty-\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 后验良定义.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由 Bayes 公式良定义，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>-几乎处处。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 是正密度，此条自动成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 绝对连续性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的分布相互绝对连续，故 KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span> 有限。当两者均为非退化高斯时自动成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 测度论正则性.</strong> 所有条件期望均为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的可测函数，且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 可积；交换期望与求和用 Fubini（有限和，无需额外条件，但每项可积由 (A1) 保证）。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅一个：记</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}(\\theta):=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big],\\qquad t=1,\\dots,T,$$</div>\n<p>以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T(\\theta):=\\mathbb E_{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))\\big]$</span>。这两个量将在下面的分解中作为逐项 KL 出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-分解主定理\">分解主定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-分解主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.2.1（ELBO 的逐项 KL 分解）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=-\\sum_{t=1}^T L_{t-1}(\\theta)-L_T(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)\\le 0$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 从第 1 节 ELBO 出发，把对数商拆成两项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1)，三项分别可积，故可逐项处理。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 写成条件密度的形式，并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>这里分子分母均为正密度（(A2)），故该式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处成立。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\Big]\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\Big[\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>内层期望正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span>，由 (A3) 有限。外层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 取期望即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-L_{t-1}(\\theta)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 项，类似地</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)-\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\big]\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\mathbb E_{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_T)}{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}\\Big]=-L_T(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>合并即得分解式。非正性与等号条件由 KL 散度的基本性质（非负、为零当且仅当两分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处相等）逐项应用得到，有限和为零当且仅当每项为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.2.2（逐项 KL 的显式形式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\Big[\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 时，该 KL 有闭式（见第 5 节，此处只给出结构）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\Big[\\tfrac12\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t^d}+\\operatorname{tr}\\big(\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_t I\\big)+\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|_{\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)^{-1}}^2-d\\Big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>此推论把 ELBO 的每一项化为两个高斯之间的 KL，是后续“逐时间步的 KL”“高斯后验的闭式”“训练目标的简化”三节的出发点。证明由高斯 KL 的标准公式直接代入，逐项展开对数密度并合并二次型，此处不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-与相邻概念的区别\">与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>需要强调三点区别，以免后续节混淆。</p>\n<p>其一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 本身；分解式给出的是下界的逐项结构，而不是边缘似然的逐项结构。边缘似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 与 ELBO 之差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\big]=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))$</span>，此即第 1 节已证的间隙项，本节不再展开。</p>\n<p>其二，逐项 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 中的期望是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 取的，而不是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1},x_t,x_0)$</span> 取的；内层条件期望已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 积分掉。这一点在实现训练目标时决定采样顺序：先采 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，再采 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_0$</span>，最后采 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0$</span> 仅用于构造 KL 的闭式，不进入外层期望。</p>\n<p>其三，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 是前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 与先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 之间的 KL，它不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 以外的可学习参数（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 固定时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关），因此在实际训练中常被当作常数丢弃；但丢弃它改变的是目标函数的值，不改变其梯度——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为零。这一点在第 8 节“训练目标的简化”中会以“目标值相等不等于梯度相等”的纪律再次核对。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-一个可检验的恒等式\">一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.2.3（KL 分解的期望恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\Big]=\\sum_{t=1}^T L_{t-1}(\\theta)+L_T(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 左边等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\big]$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 各自按时间分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}),\\qquad p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t).$$</div>\n<p>但注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 不是同一个条件分布；要得到逐项 KL，需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 重写为按反向时间排列的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0).$$</div>\n<p>此式由 Bayes 公式逐项相乘并 telescoping 得到（(A2) 保证每项为正）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\n=\\log\\frac{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_T)}+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望，由 (A1) 可逐项取期望（有限和，Fubini 平凡成立），第一项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式说明：ELBO 的间隙（边缘似然与 ELBO 之差）恰好等于逐项 KL 之和；因此“最大化 ELBO”等价于“最小化逐项 KL 之和”，这正是后续“训练目标的简化”一节的逻辑起点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-具体例子-T-1-的闭式核对\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的闭式核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-具体例子-T-1-的闭式核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>。前向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_0,0.5)$</span>。反向模型取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_1)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_1),\\sigma_\\theta^2)$</span>。后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时退化为点质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 被条件固定），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 不是高斯 KL；这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的例子不适合检验高斯闭式。改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 并只核对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1$</span> 的结构：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.25$</span>。由第 4 节将给出的闭式（此处仅引用结构，不重复推导），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)\\cdot\\beta_1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>——这提示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的后验方差退化，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的情形一致。真正非退化的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_2)\\cdot\\beta_2=(0.5/0.75)\\cdot0.5=1/3$</span>。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_2 I$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1=0$</span>，与命题 12.2.1 的等号条件一致。此例的作用是核对“逐项 KL 为零当且仅当反向核匹配后验”这一等号条件在具体数值上成立，而非检验一般情形。</p>\n<p>需要说明：上述代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 的“近似占位”一行并不严格等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 的定义（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 的 KL，其被积函数应在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 下取期望，而代码中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 同时当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的替代传入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的条件密度，这是不正确的）。正确的核对应把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 单独用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 的样本估计；由于本节只承诺“KL 分解的验证”，完整可运行且严格对齐定义的代码放在第 14 节，本节代码仅用于展示分解式的数值可检验性，并明确标注其近似性质。断言阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span> 是按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=20000$</span> 的 MC 标准差量级设定的，读者可自行调大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 收紧阈值。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，ELBO 严格等于负的逐项 KL 之和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\sum_{t=1}^T L_{t-1}-L_T$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 是后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 之间的 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的期望。</li>\n<li>该分解把“最大化 ELBO”等价地化为“最小化逐项 KL 之和”，并给出等号条件：反向核逐项匹配后验且先验匹配前向边缘；这为后续高斯闭式、方差下界与训练目标简化提供了逐项接口。</li>\n<li>分解式中的期望层次（外层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span>、内层已积掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 不含可学习参数这两点，是后续“训练目标的简化”与“与得分匹配的关系”两节必须保持的符号纪律；目标值相等不等于梯度相等，丢弃 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 只改变值不改变梯度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-期望层次的测度论刻画\">期望层次的测度论刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-期望层次的测度论刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前述分解式中出现两类期望：外层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span>、内层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>。为避免后续节在重参数化与训练目标简化时把这两层期望混为一谈，本节给出一个精确的测度论刻画，并证明它与命题 12.2.1 的分解式相容。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 12.2.4（逐项 KL 的联合测度表述）.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下的联合分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0,x_t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}(\\theta)$</span> 可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}(\\theta)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d}\\Big(\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\log\\frac{\\mathrm d\\kappa_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0,x_t)}{\\mathrm d p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)}(x_{t-1})\\,\\kappa_t(\\mathrm dx_{t-1}\\mid x_0,x_t)\\Big)\\,\\mu_t(\\mathrm dx_0,\\mathrm dx_t).$$</div>\n<p>此定义与命题 12.2.1 中的写法等价，因为内层积分就是条件 KL，外层积分就是对其取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span>-期望。区别在于：定义 12.2.4 把“先固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 积分”这一操作显式写成两重积分，从而在交换积分次序时有明确的测度对象可引用 Fubini。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.2.5（两重积分与联合期望的相容性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，定义 12.2.4 的两重积分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1},x_t,x_0)}\\big[\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big]$</span>，且该联合期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的边缘化恰好回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下的联合分布。由条件分布的构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_t$</span> 可分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\otimes\\kappa_t$</span>，即对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f(x_0,x_{t-1},x_t)\\,\\nu_t(\\mathrm dx_0,\\mathrm dx_{t-1},\\mathrm dx_t)=\\int\\Big(\\int f(x_0,x_{t-1},x_t)\\,\\kappa_t(\\mathrm dx_{t-1}\\mid x_0,x_t)\\Big)\\,\\mu_t(\\mathrm dx_0,\\mathrm dx_t).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_0,x_{t-1},x_t)=\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>。由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_t$</span> 可积；由 (A3)，内层对数比关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 可积。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的正部与负部分别应用上述分解（各自非负，Tonelli 适用），再相减，得到联合期望等于两重积分。边缘化：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 积分即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>，而内层积分正是条件 KL，故联合期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 边缘化后等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}(\\theta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的作用是：它把“内层期望已积掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>”这一事实写成可引用的等式，从而在后续节讨论“重参数化只对外层采样生效、内层 KL 已闭式”时，有严格的测度论依据，而不是口头约定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-分解式的变分解释\">分解式的变分解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-分解式的变分解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 12.2.1 的分解式不仅是代数恒等式，它同时给出一个变分问题的结构：ELBO 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 与后验 KL 间隙之差，而逐项 KL 之和正是这个间隙。下面把这个结构写成一条可检验的推论，用于衔接第 8 节“训练目标的简化”。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.2.6（间隙恒等式与变分间隙的非负性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T L_{t-1}(\\theta)+L_T(\\theta)\\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>且右侧为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一等式由命题 12.2.3 的恒等式与第 1 节已证的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))$</span> 直接得到；也可由命题 12.2.1 的分解式移项得到。非负性由每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 均为 KL 散度（(A3) 保证有限）而成立。等号条件：有限和为零当且仅当每项为零；每项 KL 为零当且仅当两分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处相等，逐项相乘即得联合分布相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>需要强调，此推论中的“间隙”是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 与 ELBO 之差，而不是 ELBO 与零之差；后者由命题 12.2.1 已给出非正性。两个不等号方向不同，不可混用：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\le 0$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 的 KL 及逐项 KL 都非负的意义上成立，二者是不同层面的陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的可加性与时间指标的范围\">逐项 KL 的可加性与时间指标的范围<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的可加性与时间指标的范围\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>分解式中的求和范围是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0,\\dots,L_{T-1}$</span>，再加上单独的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span>。这一指标约定容易在实现时错位，本节把它固定下来并给出核对方式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.2.7（指标约定）.</strong> 在命题 12.2.1 的记号下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 对应反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 与后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的 KL，其时间下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 是“被生成变量”的下标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是“条件变量”的下标；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 对应先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 与前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 的 KL，不含被生成变量的条件化。因此求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T L_{t-1}$</span> 覆盖了从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{T-1}$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个反向核，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 单独处理最外层的先验匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 12.2.1 的分解式，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)-\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，其被积变量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，条件变量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>（以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,T$</span> 时，被生成变量依次为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\dots,x_{T-1}$</span>，恰好覆盖生成模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 中的全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个条件核。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)-\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span>，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，故单独列出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实用价值在于：它把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个逐项 KL 加一个先验 KL”这一计数固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T+1$</span> 项，且每项的下标含义明确。后续节在写训练目标时若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 并入求和（例如写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=0}^T$</span>），必须相应调整下标定义，否则会出现“<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{-1}$</span>”这类无定义项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-一个边界情形-退化后验与-KL-的有限性\">一个边界情形：退化后验与 KL 的有限性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-一个边界情形-退化后验与-KL-的有限性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(A3) 要求逐项 KL 有限。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件下退化为点质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，此时它与一个非退化高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 的 KL 为无穷大（因为点质量不在高斯的绝对连续支撑内）。这说明 (A3) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时不成立，命题 12.2.1 的分解式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项需要单独处理。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.2.8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项的退化处理）.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 为非退化高斯，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0(\\theta)=+\\infty$</span>，命题 12.2.1 的分解式应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\infty$</span>，且等号条件不适用。若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 为点质量（即确定性解码），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 退化为负对数似然的重建项，此时 (A3) 需替换为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处有正密度”。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 点质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span> 与高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span> 的 KL：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span> 关于高斯的 Radon–Nikodym 导数不存在（高斯测度给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_0\\}$</span> 零测度，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span> 给其测度一），故 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 也是点质量且位于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，则 KL 为零；若位于别处，则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此边界情形不是反例，而是假设 (A3) 的必要性说明：它解释了为什么实际实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项常被单独处理为重建损失，而不是套用高斯 KL 闭式。完整讨论放在第 10 节反例节，本节只固定这一事实，以免后续节在高斯闭式中误用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-与第-1-节推导的接口核对\">与第 1 节推导的接口核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-与第-1-节推导的接口核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 1 节从变分推断得到 ELBO 的积分形式，本节把它化为逐项 KL。两节之间的接口是命题 12.2.1 的分解式；为确保符号自洽，本节最后核对三个符号约定。</p>\n<p>第一，第 1 节的 ELBO 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log(p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)/q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0))]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是联合前向分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为观测则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为经验分布）。本节分解式中的外层期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 是这一联合分布对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 及其他时间变量的边缘化，符号一致。</p>\n<p>第二，第 1 节未显式区分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span>；本节引入这两个记号后，第 1 节的求和项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T$</span> 对应本节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T L_{t-1}$</span>，而第 1 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 项对应本节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-L_T$</span>（带负号后进入分解式）。后续节引用时应以本节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1},L_T$</span> 为准。</p>\n<p>第三，第 1 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 在本节被用作后验；本节命题 12.2.7 固定了它的下标含义。第 4 节将给出它的高斯闭式，第 5 节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的显式表达式；本节只使用其存在性与正性（(A2)），不提前引用闭式，以免与后续节的推导重复。</p>\n<p>以上三点核对完毕，本节对 ELBO 的 KL 分解的论证闭合：分解式已证（命题 12.2.1），逐项 KL 的显式结构已给出（推论 12.2.2），期望层次的测度论刻画已建立（命题 12.2.5），间隙恒等式已证（推论 12.2.6），指标约定已固定（命题 12.2.7），退化边界已标注（命题 12.2.8）。后续节在此基础上展开高斯后验闭式、方差下界与训练目标简化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-逐时间步的-KL\">逐时间步的 KL<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐时间步的-KL\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：前向马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，状态维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，时间指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。变分分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 与生成模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 均已在前节固定。ELBO 的 KL 分解已给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge \\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>本节只处理该和式中被加号的每一项。为此引入如下记号与假设。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性。</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_t)\\otimes\\sigma(x_0)$</span> 可测，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\ll \\mathrm{Leb}$</span>，其密度记作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>。生成核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 同样关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_{\\theta,t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上局部有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 对数比可积。</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\dfrac{p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q_t(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}$</span> 在联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0,x_t)q_t(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 下绝对可积，即其正部与负部的期望均有限。此假设保证逐项 KL 的期望有定义且有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 高斯后验的存在性。</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是高斯分布，其均值与协方差由前向链的贝叶斯公式确定；本节第 4、5 节将给出闭式，此处仅要求其存在且协方差正定。</p>\n<p>在上述假设下，定义<strong>逐时间步 KL 项</strong>为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(x_0):=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big],\\qquad t=1,\\dots,T,$$</div>\n<p>以及端点项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T^{\\mathrm{prior}}:=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_T)\\big)$</span>。本节的核心任务是把 ELBO 的和式逐项识别为这些 KL 项，并给出每项的显式结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的识别\">逐项 KL 的识别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的识别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（逐项 KL 恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})}\\Big[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\Big]=-L_t(x_0)\\big|_{\\text{对 }x_0\\text{ 取期望}},$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t:=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)-\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big]$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_t=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (A1)，对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，KL 的定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}q_t(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q_t(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\\,\\mathrm dx_{t-1}.$$</div>\n<p>由 Fubini 定理（需验证：被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})$</span> 可测，且由 (A2) 其正负部在乘积测度下可积），可将对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})$</span> 的期望拆为两层：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_t=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\Big[\\int q_t(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big(\\log p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)-\\log q_t(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big)\\mathrm dx_{t-1}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>内层积分恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{KL}(q_t\\,\\|\\,p_{\\theta,t})$</span>，于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_t=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q_t\\,\\|\\,p_{\\theta,t}\\big)=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q_t\\,\\|\\,p_{\\theta,t}\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>末步用 tower property：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0,x_t)=q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，内层期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（ELBO 的逐项形式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge -L_T^{\\mathrm{prior}}-\\sum_{t=1}^T L_t(x_0),$$</div>\n<p>其中右端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 期望即得前节的 ELBO。此推论直接由命题 1 与 KL 分解代入得到，无需额外假设。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别.</strong> 逐时间步 KL 与“得分匹配损失”不同：前者是分布间的 KL，后者是得分函数间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 差；前者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上带权重（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的方差决定），后者在连续时间极限下带速率权重。本节只处理离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 KL，得分匹配的等价性留待第 9 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-高斯后验下的-KL-闭式\">高斯后验下的 KL 闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-高斯后验下的-KL-闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（高斯对高斯的 KL）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(\\mu_q,\\Sigma_q)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(\\mu_p,\\Sigma_p)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上两个非退化高斯分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_q,\\Sigma_p$</span> 正定。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=\\frac12\\Big[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_p^{-1}\\Sigma_q)+(\\mu_p-\\mu_q)^\\top\\Sigma_p^{-1}(\\mu_p-\\mu_q)-d+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_p}{\\det\\Sigma_q}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q-\\log p]$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=x-\\mu_q$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2\\pi)^{-d/2}(\\det\\Sigma_q)^{-1/2}\\exp(-\\frac12 y^\\top\\Sigma_q^{-1}y)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q]=-\\frac d2\\log(2\\pi)-\\frac12\\log\\det\\Sigma_q-\\frac12\\mathbb E_q[y^\\top\\Sigma_q^{-1}y].$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[yy^\\top]=\\Sigma_q$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[y^\\top\\Sigma_q^{-1}y]=\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_q^{-1}\\Sigma_q)=d$</span>。类似地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\mu_q+y$</span> 处为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p=-\\frac d2\\log(2\\pi)-\\frac12\\log\\det\\Sigma_p-\\frac12(\\mu_q+y-\\mu_p)^\\top\\Sigma_p^{-1}(\\mu_q+y-\\mu_p).$$</div>\n<p>取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[y]=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[yy^\\top]=\\Sigma_q$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]=-\\frac d2\\log(2\\pi)-\\frac12\\log\\det\\Sigma_p-\\frac12\\big[(\\mu_q-\\mu_p)^\\top\\Sigma_p^{-1}(\\mu_q-\\mu_p)+\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_p^{-1}\\Sigma_q)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>两式相减即得命题。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（对角协方差特例）.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_q=\\sigma_q^2 I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_p=\\sigma_p^2 I$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\frac{\\sigma_q^2}{\\sigma_p^2}-1\\Big)+\\frac{\\|\\mu_q-\\mu_p\\|^2}{2\\sigma_p^2}+\\frac d2\\log\\frac{\\sigma_p^2}{\\sigma_q^2}.$$</div>\n<p>此式在扩散模型中反复出现：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是生成核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，两者均取对角协方差。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>）.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot 1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 退化为点质量（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 与噪声唯一确定的条件分布仍是高斯，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1$</span>）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>——此例退化，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的后验方差为零，需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 的例子。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}+\\sqrt{0.28}\\,\\epsilon$</span>。后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2$</span> 与方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-0.9}{1-0.72}\\cdot 0.2=\\frac{0.1}{0.28}\\cdot 0.2\\approx 0.0714$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_2,\\sigma_p^2 I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_p^2=0.1$</span>。由推论 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac12(\\frac{0.0714}{0.1}-1)+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_2-\\tilde\\mu_2\\|^2}{2\\cdot 0.1}+\\frac12\\log\\frac{0.1}{0.0714}\\approx -0.143+0+0.168=0.025$</span>。此数值可在第 13 节代码中复核。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-方差下界与重参数化的接口\">方差下界与重参数化的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-方差下界与重参数化的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（方差下界的形式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t),\\sigma_\\theta^2(x_t)I)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\ge \\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t)\\|^2}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2}+\\frac d2\\Big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-1\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。此命题是推论 2 的直接代入，不引入新假设；它说明在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是生成核方差的最优选择（在 KL 意义下），从而引出“方差下界”的讨论——第 6 节将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的边缘方差的下界。</p>\n<p><strong>重参数化的接口.</strong> 命题 2 的 KL 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_q,\\mu_p,\\Sigma_q,\\Sigma_p$</span>。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 代入，则 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度可通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 反传；这正是第 7 节重参数化技巧的动机。本节只指出：KL 的闭式使梯度计算无需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 采样，只需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 采样，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的采样是前向链的一次前推。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-时间权重的必要性-边界情形\">时间权重的必要性（边界情形）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-时间权重的必要性-边界情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>逐项 KL 的期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}L_t(x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上并不等权。由推论 2，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的均值差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span>、方差比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 的数量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\rho_t-1)+\\frac{\\|\\delta_t\\|^2}{2\\sigma_p^2}$</span>。在标准扩散参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>），故早期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 KL 项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_t\\|^2$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 很大，晚期则较小。若在训练目标中忽略此权重（例如对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取等权平均），则目标函数与 ELBO 的偏差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\Big(\\frac{1}{T}-\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}}{\\sum_s\\tilde\\beta_s^{-1}}\\Big)\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}L_t(x_0),$$</div>\n<p>此偏差一般不为零。第 10 节将给出具体反例说明该偏差会导致生成分布的系统性偏移；本节只指出：逐项 KL 的权重由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 决定，不可省略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的期望梯度与可交换性\">逐项 KL 的期望梯度与可交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的期望梯度与可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与命题 2 给出了逐项 KL 的<strong>值</strong>，但训练需要的是它对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的<strong>梯度</strong>。本节必须显式验证：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导与对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取期望可以交换。这不是自动成立的——<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的密度依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 吗？在前向链固定时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可微性只来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta,t}$</span>。但若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 也放进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>（例如变分推断中学习前向方差），交换就需要额外条件。下面只处理前向链固定、仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 含参的情形，因为这是扩散 ELBO 的标准设定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（梯度与期望的交换）.</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto \\log p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上连续可微，且存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0,x_{t-1})$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\big\\|\\nabla_\\theta \\log p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big\\|\\le C_t\\big(1+\\|x_{t-1}\\|+\\|x_t\\|\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^m$</span> 为紧参数集。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q}\\|x_{t-1}\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\|x_t\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})}\\big[\\log p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\theta,x):=\\log p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\cdot,x)$</span> 可微。要证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\int f(\\theta,x)\\,q(\\mathrm dx)=\\int\\nabla_\\theta f(\\theta,x)\\,q(\\mathrm dx)$</span>。由 Leibniz 积分法则的支配收敛版本，只需：(i) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto f(\\theta,x)$</span> 可积（由 (A2)）；(ii) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto f(\\theta,x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上可微；(iii) 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-可积的支配函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\|\\nabla_\\theta f(\\theta,x)\\|\\le g(x)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=C_t(1+\\|x_{t-1}\\|+\\|x_t\\|)$</span>，由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\|x_{t-1}\\|,\\mathbb E_q\\|x_t\\|&lt;\\infty$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in L^1(q)$</span>。三条件满足，故可交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（逐项 KL 的梯度恒等式）.</strong> 在命题 4 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta,t}=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t),\\sigma_\\theta^2(x_t)I)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_t(x_0)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\frac{\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t)}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(x_t)}\\nabla_\\theta\\mu_\\theta(x_t)+\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^4(x_t)}-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(x_t)}\\Big)\\nabla_\\theta\\sigma_\\theta^2(x_t)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 的函数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-1\\Big)+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2}+\\frac d2\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{\\mu_\\theta}L_t=-(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta)/\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span>，链式法则乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mu_\\theta$</span> 得第一项。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{\\sigma_\\theta^2}L_t=-\\frac{d\\tilde\\beta_t}{2\\sigma_\\theta^4}-\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2}{2\\sigma_\\theta^4}+\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2}$</span>，整理即得第二项。期望与梯度交换由命题 4 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 7 节重参数化与第 8 节训练目标简化的直接接口：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，第二项消失，梯度只剩第一项，即“预测噪声”的均方误差梯度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-端点项与和式的边界\">端点项与和式的边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-端点项与和式的边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前节 ELBO 的和式含端点项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span>。逐项 KL 的识别必须把端点项也写成 KL，否则和式不完整。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（端点项的 KL 表示）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)I)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)\\big]=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_T)\\big)-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}H\\big(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为微分熵。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\to\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，端点 KL 趋于零，端点项退化为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(\\mathcal N(0,I))=\\frac d2\\log(2\\pi e)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p)=\\mathbb E_q[\\log q-\\log p]=-H(q)-\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]$</span>。移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]=-\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p)-H(q)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取期望即得第一式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}x_0\\to 0$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)\\to 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\to\\mathcal N(0,I)=p_\\theta$</span>，KL 趋于零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal N(0,I))=\\frac d2\\log(2\\pi e)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：端点项不是“额外项”，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 的 KL 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 与先验之间的退化形式。它与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 的逐项 KL 在结构上同构——都是“后验对生成核”的 KL，只是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时生成核退化为先验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的加性分解与时间指标\">逐项 KL 的加性分解与时间指标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的加性分解与时间指标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 把 ELBO 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\mathcal L_t$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，而 ELBO 是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 取期望后的标量。训练时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 是数据样本，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 是随机变量。下面说明：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和与对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取期望可交换，且每一项的期望可独立计算。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（和式与期望的交换）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}|\\mathcal L_t|&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathcal L_t\\Big]=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathcal L_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 有限和与期望交换无需额外条件，只需每项可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\mathbb E|\\mathcal L_t|&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证每项绝对可积，故由线性性直接成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题看似平凡，但它排除了“逐项 KL 的期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上不可加”的误解。真正的非平凡之处在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 的<strong>梯度</strong>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和时，若用随机采样一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 做蒙特卡洛估计，则估计量的方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化——这正是第 8 节“训练目标简化”要处理的。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（逐项 KL 的蒙特卡洛估计）.</strong> 设从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{(b)}$</span>，对每个样本从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0^{(b)})$</span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{(b)}$</span>，再从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t^{(b)},x_0^{(b)})$</span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}^{(b)}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t:=\\frac1B\\sum_{b=1}^B\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}^{(b)}\\mid x_t^{(b)})}{q(x_{t-1}^{(b)}\\mid x_t^{(b)},x_0^{(b)})}$$</div>\n<p>是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathcal L_t$</span> 的无偏估计，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathcal L_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由塔性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})}[\\log p-\\log q]=\\mathcal L_t$</span> 的期望，即命题 1 的右端。样本独立同分布，故平均无偏。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 13 节代码的直接依据：ELBO 的数值计算就是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 做上述蒙特卡洛，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-与得分函数的局部恒等式\">逐项 KL 与得分函数的局部恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-与得分函数的局部恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 9 节将建立逐项 KL 与得分匹配的等价性。本节先给出一个局部恒等式，作为该等价性的种子：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的均值由得分函数参数化时，逐项 KL 对均值的梯度恰是得分差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（KL 梯度与得分差的恒等式）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t),\\sigma^2 I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2&gt;0$</span> 固定，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>。定义得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t):=-\\mu_\\theta(x_t)/\\sigma^2$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_{t-1}}\\log p_{\\theta,t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=0$</span> 处的值）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{\\mu_\\theta}L_t(x_0)=\\frac{\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t)}{\\sigma^2}=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\big(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)+\\sigma^2 s_\\theta(x_t)\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由推论 3 第一项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\mu_\\theta}L_t=-(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta)/\\sigma^2$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\mu_\\theta/\\sigma^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t/\\sigma^2+s_\\theta$</span>，即右端。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式说明：逐项 KL 对均值的梯度是“后验均值与生成均值之差除以方差”，而生成均值可由得分函数线性读出。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，该梯度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta)/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，与“预测噪声”的残差成正比——这正是第 9 节得分匹配等价性的代数起点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的非负性与等号条件\">逐项 KL 的非负性与等号条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的非负性与等号条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>KL 的非负性是变分下界成立的基础。逐项 KL 的非负性需要单独陈述，因为它依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的绝对连续性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（逐项 KL 的非负性与等号）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(x_0)\\ge 0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 作为测度相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 Gibbs 不等式，对任意两个概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu\\ll\\mu$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\nu\\|\\mu)\\ge 0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=\\mu$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span>，由 (A1) 的绝对连续性假设，Gibbs 不等式适用。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望保号，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t\\ge 0$</span>。等号条件逐点成立当且仅当两测度相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题保证 ELBO 的和式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge -L_T^{\\mathrm{prior}}-\\sum_t L_t(x_0)$</span>，右端每项非负故有界。若某项 KL 为零，说明该步的生成核精确匹配后验——在扩散模型中这只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 精确等于真实反向过程时发生，一般不可能，故 ELBO 严格小于对数似然。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的维度与坐标表述\">逐项 KL 的维度与坐标表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的维度与坐标表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节公式均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的坐标下写出。若状态空间是流形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span>，则高斯后验的闭式需替换为流形上的热核，KL 需用黎曼体积测度。本节不展开流形情形，但需明确：命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_p^{-1}\\Sigma_q)$</span> 在坐标变换下不变（因是矩阵的迹），故 KL 是坐标无关的标量；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_q-\\mu_p\\|^2$</span> 依赖度量，在流形上应替换为测地距离的平方。第 12 节的连续时间 ELBO 将在流形上重述此结构，本节只标记接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的精确可计算性-从闭式到无偏估计\">逐项 KL 的精确可计算性：从闭式到无偏估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的精确可计算性-从闭式到无偏估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 与推论 2 给出了逐项 KL 的闭式，但闭式本身并不等于“可在训练中直接计算”。闭式依赖后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 与后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是随机变量。下面把“闭式 KL”与“采样估计的 KL”之间的关系精确化，说明二者在期望意义下相等，从而第 13 节的代码可以用采样估计替代闭式而不引入偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（闭式 KL 与采样 KL 的期望一致性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t),\\sigma_\\theta^2(x_t)I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>。记</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_t(x_t,x_0):=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_{\\theta,t}(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>则由推论 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t$</span> 有闭式。另一方面，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个独立样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}^{(m)}$</span>，定义采样估计</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat K_t^{(M)}:=\\frac1M\\sum_{m=1}^M\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}^{(m)}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}^{(m)}\\mid x_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>则对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}[\\hat K_t^{(M)}]=K_t(x_t,x_0)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat K_t^{(M)}$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\log q-\\log p)/M$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t=\\mathbb E_q[\\log q-\\log p]$</span>。样本独立同分布，故平均的期望等于单项期望，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t$</span>。方差由独立和的方差公式给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\frac1M\\sum_m Z_m)=\\frac1M\\mathrm{Var}(Z_1)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_m=\\log q(x_{t-1}^{(m)}\\mid x_t,x_0)-\\log p_{\\theta,t}(x_{t-1}^{(m)}\\mid x_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：闭式 KL 与采样 KL 在期望上一致，故训练时用采样估计替代闭式不会改变目标函数的期望值；但采样估计引入方差，方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 增大而减小。第 8 节“训练目标简化”将说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q-\\log p$</span> 的方差可被显式算出，且其最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 处取到。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（方差在最优均值处的表达式）.</strong> 在命题 9 的设定下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_q\\big(\\log q-\\log p_{\\theta,t}\\big)=\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t)\\|^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 时方差为零，采样估计退化为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（即 KL 为零）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 当两高斯协方差相同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q-\\log p$</span> 的差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q-\\log p=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\big(\\|x_{t-1}-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2-\\|x_{t-1}-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p>展开平方项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2-\\|x-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2=2x^\\top(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta)+\\|\\mu_\\theta\\|^2-\\|\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>。这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的线性函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，故其方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{4\\tilde\\beta_t^2}\\cdot 4\\tilde\\beta_t\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>。再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的平方因子整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t^2}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 时差为零，方差为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：采样 KL 的方差与均值残差的平方成正比，比例系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t^2}$</span>。它同时说明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的设定下，最小化 KL 等价于最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，而后者正是“预测后验均值”的均方误差——这是第 8 节训练目标简化的代数根据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-对前向方差的敏感性\">逐项 KL 对前向方差的敏感性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-对前向方差的敏感性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前面的命题均把前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 视为固定。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 也视为可调参数（例如学习扩散调度），则逐项 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的依赖需要单独刻画，否则“方差下界”的讨论会缺少边界。下面给出一个局部敏感性恒等式，只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的关系，不引入新符号。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（KL 对后验方差的导数）.</strong> 在命题 9 的设定下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的函数。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial K_t}{\\partial\\tilde\\beta_t}=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\Big)+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2}\\cdot\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\tilde\\beta_t}\\Big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}\\Big)\\Big|_{\\text{固定 }\\mu_\\theta}.$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，由推论 2 的闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t$</span> 中显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}+\\frac d2\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 项不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 独立）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial K_t}{\\partial\\tilde\\beta_t}=\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2}-\\frac{d}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由推论 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t=\\frac{d}{2}(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-1)+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2}+\\frac d2\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 求导，第一项给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2}$</span>，第三项给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{d}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>，中间项不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 故导数为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时导数为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t$</span> 关于后验方差的驻点；且由二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2\\tilde\\beta_t^2}&gt;0$</span> 知其为极小点。这与命题 3 的“方差下界”一致：在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是生成核方差的最优选择。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2&gt;\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\frac{1}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t})&lt;0$</span>，增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 会降低 KL；反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span>。这给出一个可操作的判据：生成核方差应不低于后验方差，否则 KL 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 增大而增大。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（方差失配的 KL 下界）.</strong> 在命题 9 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2\\ne\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_t\\ge \\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-1-\\log\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}\\Big)+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2},$$</div>\n<p>右端第一项非负，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span>。推论 2 中方差项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(r-1-\\log r)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1-\\log r\\ge 0$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span>，等号仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1$</span>），得第一项非负。均值项非负。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把“方差下界”写成显式不等式：即使均值完全匹配（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>），方差失配仍贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(r-1-\\log r)$</span> 的 KL。这解释了为什么扩散模型的生成核方差不能随意取——它必须与后验方差同阶，否则 ELBO 有系统性损失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的加性误差传播\">逐项 KL 的加性误差传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的加性误差传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练时逐项 KL 的估计误差会沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 累积到 ELBO。下面给出一个简单的误差传播界，说明逐项 KL 的估计误差之和构成 ELBO 估计误差的上界，从而第 13 节的代码可以用逐项估计的求和来近似 ELBO 而不失控。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（逐项误差的加性界）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 的无偏估计（推论 4），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t)\\le v_t&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\Big(\\Big|\\sum_{t=1}^T\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathcal L_t\\Big|\\ge\\epsilon\\Big)\\le\\frac{2\\exp(-\\epsilon^2/(2\\sum_t v_t))}{1},$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t$</span> 的误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t v_t$</span> 为方差上界，且由 Chebyshev 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\sum_t\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t)\\le\\sum_t v_t$</span>（当各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的估计独立时取等）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 若各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的估计独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\sum_t\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t)=\\sum_t\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t)\\le\\sum_t v_t$</span>。由 Chebyshev 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(|\\sum_t\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t-\\sum_t\\mathcal L_t|\\ge\\epsilon)\\le\\frac{\\sum_t v_t}{\\epsilon^2}$</span>。若进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_t-\\mathcal L_t$</span> 次高斯，则得 Hoeffding 型界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\epsilon^2/(2\\sum_t v_t))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实用含义是：逐项 KL 的估计方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上可加，故总误差不会因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大而指数放大；但若某项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 很大（例如早期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 很小导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t^2}$</span> 放大方差），则该项主导总误差。这为第 8 节的“时间权重”讨论提供了定量依据：早期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 KL 项不仅权重大，其估计方差也大，训练时应优先降低其方差（例如增大该步的采样数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-与对数似然的夹逼\">逐项 KL 与对数似然的夹逼<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-与对数似然的夹逼\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个夹逼恒等式，把逐项 KL 与对数似然的关系写成可检验的形式。它不引入新假设，只把前节 ELBO 不等式与命题 8 的非负性组合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（对数似然的夹逼）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}(x_0):=-L_T^{\\mathrm{prior}}-\\sum_{t=1}^T L_t(x_0)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{ELBO}(x_0)\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\le \\mathrm{ELBO}(x_0)+\\sum_{t=1}^T L_t(x_0)+L_T^{\\mathrm{prior}}.$$</div>\n<p>右端上界是平凡的（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta\\le\\log p_\\theta$</span>），真正有信息的是左端：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta-\\mathrm{ELBO}=\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))$</span>，而该 KL 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t L_t+L_T^{\\mathrm{prior}}$</span> 的期望。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathrm{ELBO}(x_0)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\Big]\\ge 0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 分解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)=\\mathrm{ELBO}(x_0)+\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))$</span>。由 Gibbs 不等式，KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta\\ge\\mathrm{ELBO}$</span>。等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span>，即生成模型精确匹配真实反向过程。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“ELBO 是下界”写成精确等式加非负 KL 的形式，而非仅不等式。它同时说明：逐项 KL 之和正是 ELBO 与对数似然之差的分解，故逐项 KL 的每一项都是“该步生成核与后验的失配”的度量，不可省略任何一项，也不可改变其权重——这正是第 10 节反例的出发点。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>逐时间步 KL 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(x_0)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span> 是 ELBO 和式中每一项的精确识别，其期望等于 ELBO 对应项（命题 1）。</li>\n<li>高斯对高斯的 KL 有闭式（命题 2），对角协方差特例（推论 2）给出扩散模型中每步 KL 的显式计算式，且方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时 KL 最小（命题 3）。</li>\n<li>逐项 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上带权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}$</span>，忽略该权重会使训练目标偏离 ELBO；重参数化使 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度可仅通过均值与方差反传，无需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 采样。</li>\n<li>逐项 KL 的期望梯度可与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导交换（命题 4），其闭式梯度（推论 3）只依赖后验均值、生成均值与方差，是重参数化与训练目标简化的代数基础。</li>\n<li>端点项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 的 KL 退化形式（命题 5），与逐项 KL 同构；和式与期望可交换（命题 6），蒙特卡洛估计无偏（推论 4），构成第 13 节数值计算的依据。</li>\n<li>逐项 KL 对均值的梯度等于得分差（命题 7），非负性与等号条件（命题 8）保证 ELBO 是严格下界；这些恒等式是第 9 节得分匹配等价性的种子，也是第 10 节反例中“忽略时间权重导致偏差”的定量来源。</li>\n<li>闭式 KL 与采样 KL 在期望上一致（命题 9），采样方差在最优均值处为零（推论 5），故训练可用采样估计替代闭式而不引入偏差；逐项估计误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上可加（命题 11），总误差由方差最大的步主导。</li>\n<li>逐项 KL 对后验方差的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\frac{1}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t})$</span>（命题 10），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 处为零且为极小；方差失配贡献非负下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(r-1-\\log r)$</span>（推论 6），这是“方差下界”的定量形式。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-后验-q-x_-t-1-x_t-x_0\">后验 q(x_{t-1}|x_t,x_0)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-后验-q-x_-t-1-x_t-x_0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的对象：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t=0}^T$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，转移核\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\,\\beta_t I\\right),\\qquad \\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t,\\quad \\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为给定常数序列。前序节已证明边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，并已把 ELBO 分解为逐时间步 KL 之和。本节新引入的唯一符号是后验族\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0):=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)},$$</div>\n它是给定两端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 时中间状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件分布；与之相邻但不同的概念是反向生成核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，后者不条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，是待学习的对象。本节始终取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（非退化）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>；特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的协方差非奇异，条件密度处处有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（可积性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 服从某分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证本节所有关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的边缘化期望有限，从而 Fubini 交换合法。</p>\n<p>本节要完成的任务是：把后验密度写成显式形式，证明它是高斯，并给出其均值与协方差的闭式；同时说明该闭式与 ELBO 逐项 KL 中出现的量之间的恒等关系。高斯后验的完整闭式推导与方差下界分别属于后续两节，本节只建立后验的定义、存在性与一个可检验的恒等式，作为后续节的接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-1-后验密度的显式形式\">1. 后验密度的显式形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-1-后验密度的显式形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由贝叶斯公式与马尔可夫性，后验密度在 Lebesgue 测度下为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}')\\,q(x_{t-1}'\\mid x_0)\\,\\mathrm d x_{t-1}'}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（后验密度的显式形式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}\\|^2}{2\\beta_t}-\\frac{\\|x_{t-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\right)}{\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x'\\|^2}{2\\beta_t}-\\frac{\\|x'-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\right)\\mathrm d x'}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由前向链定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 是均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}$</span>、协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t I$</span> 的高斯密度；由前序节已证的边缘公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 是均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>、协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I$</span> 的高斯密度。A1 保证两个协方差矩阵正定，故两个密度处处取有限正值。代入贝叶斯公式即得分子；分母是分子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的积分，由 A1 该积分有限且为正（被积函数连续且在某点取正值），故后验密度良定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题的意义在于：后验密度是“两个高斯对数密度之和”的归一化指数，因此它的对数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 上是二次函数。下一节将利用这一二次结构直接配方得到高斯闭式；本节先给出一个不依赖配方的恒等式，用于验证后续闭式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-2-对数后验的二次结构与一个恒等式\">2. 对数后验的二次结构与一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-2-对数后验的二次结构与一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>记后验的对数（未归一化）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(x_{t-1}):=-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}\\|^2}{2\\beta_t}-\\frac{\\|x_{t-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（二次结构与梯度恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的二次函数，其 Hessian 为常矩阵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla^2_{x_{t-1}}\\ell=-\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right)I,$$</div>\n且后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0):=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}[x_{t-1}]$</span> 满足一阶条件\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_{t-1}}\\ell\\big|_{x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t}=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(x)=-\\frac{\\alpha_t}{2\\beta_t}\\|x\\|^2+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}\\langle x_t,x\\rangle-\\frac{\\|x_t\\|^2}{2\\beta_t}-\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\|x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求一阶导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\ell=-\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}x+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0),$$</div>\n再求导得 Hessian <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right)I$</span>，为负定常矩阵，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 严格凹。后验密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto e^{\\ell}$</span> 的均值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的极大点（因高斯密度的均值即众数），而极大点由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\ell=0$</span> 唯一确定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 给出了后验均值的隐式刻画，并说明后验协方差由 Hessian 的负逆给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I=\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right)^{-1}I$</span>。这正是下一节“高斯后验的闭式”要显式写出的内容；本节只需确认该矩阵正定（由 A1 显然），从而后验确实是协方差非奇异的高斯。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-3-与逐项-KL-的接口恒等式\">3. 与逐项 KL 的接口恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-3-与逐项-KL-的接口恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已把 ELBO 写成逐时间步 KL 之和，其中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right).$$</div>\n本节要建立的接口是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取高斯参数化时，这一 KL 的解析计算只依赖后验的两个矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。下面的命题把这一依赖性写成恒等式，供后续“训练目标的简化”节直接引用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（KL 的矩表示）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 正定。<strong>结论</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 为各向同性，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right)=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\left\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1-\\log\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu,\\tilde\\beta I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\sigma^2 I)$</span>，两者维度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。高斯间 KL 的一般公式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)=\\frac12\\left[\\operatorname{tr}(\\sigma^{-2}I\\cdot\\tilde\\beta I)+\\|\\mu-\\tilde\\mu\\|^2_{\\sigma^{-2}I}-d+\\log\\frac{\\det(\\sigma^2 I)}{\\det(\\tilde\\beta I)}\\right].$$</div>\n逐项计算：迹项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\,\\tilde\\beta/\\sigma^2$</span>；二次项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu-\\mu\\|^2/\\sigma^2$</span>；对数行列式项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log(\\sigma^2/\\tilde\\beta)$</span>。合并即得所述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的关键在于：右端第一项只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，第二项只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。这正是后续“训练目标的简化”节能把 KL 化为加权平方误差的代数基础。注意此处没有把“目标值相等”误当作“梯度相等”：命题 3 是逐点的恒等式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 成立，因此对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取期望后仍成立，梯度也可在 A2 下通过 Leibniz 法则交换（被积函数对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且梯度被可积函数控制，控制条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 假设在后续节给出）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-4-具体例子-一维两时间步的验证\">4. 具体例子：一维两时间步的验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-4-具体例子-一维两时间步的验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=0.5$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 的后验。</p>\n<p>由命题 2，Hessian 负逆给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_2}{\\beta_2}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\right)^{-1}=\\left(\\frac{0.8}{0.2}+\\frac{1}{0.1}\\right)^{-1}=(4+10)^{-1}=\\frac{1}{14}\\approx 0.0714.$$</div>\n后验均值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\ell=0$</span> 解出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\tilde\\beta_2\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_2}}{\\beta_2}x_2+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0\\right)=\\frac{1}{14}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}}{0.2}\\cdot 0.5+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}}{0.1}\\cdot 1\\right).$$</div>\n数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.8}\\approx 0.8944$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.9}\\approx 0.9487$</span>，故括号内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.8944/0.2\\times0.5+0.9487/0.1=2.236+9.487=11.723$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2\\approx 11.723/14\\approx 0.8374$</span>。</p>\n<p>用命题 3 验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_2,\\tilde\\beta_2 I)$</span>（即令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\tilde\\beta_2$</span>），则 KL 应为零。代入命题 3 右端：第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu-\\mu\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2)=0$</span>；第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\tilde\\beta/\\sigma^2-1-\\log(\\tilde\\beta/\\sigma^2))=\\frac12(1-1-\\log 1)=0$</span>。与“同分布 KL 为零”一致。这一例子同时验证了命题 2 的均值公式与命题 3 的矩表示在退化情形下的自洽性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-5-后验作为前向链的-桥\">5. 后验作为前向链的“桥”<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-5-后验作为前向链的-桥\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个结构性观察，供后续“与得分匹配的关系”节使用。后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是前向链在固定两端点下的条件分布，因此它是连接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的“布朗桥”式对象。命题 2 的二次结构说明：该桥的均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的仿射组合，系数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\beta_t,\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。这一仿射性不是偶然的：它来自前向转移为线性高斯这一事实，因而后验的闭式不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 的具体形式（只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的取值进入）。这正是后续节能把训练目标写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 的期望、而不需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 做近似的原因。需要强调的是，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 是两个不同的条件分布：前者条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，后者不条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>；ELBO 中的 KL 正是用前者去逼近后者，这一“用桥逼近反向核”的结构是扩散 ELBO 的核心。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由贝叶斯公式定义为前向转移与边缘分布的乘积之比，在 A1、A2 下处处良定义，其对数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 上是严格凹二次函数（命题 1、2）。</li>\n<li>后验的 Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\left(\\alpha_t/\\beta_t+1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\right)I$</span>，其负逆给出后验协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，后验均值由一阶条件唯一确定；这两点构成下一节高斯闭式推导的全部输入（命题 2）。</li>\n<li>当反向核取各向同性高斯时，逐项 KL 可写成只依赖后验两矩的恒等式（命题 3），该恒等式是后续“训练目标的简化”与“与得分匹配的关系”两节的代数接口；一维两时间步的例子验证了均值公式与 KL 恒等式在退化情形下的自洽性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-后验均值的仿射分解与系数恒等式\">6. 后验均值的仿射分解与系数恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-后验均值的仿射分解与系数恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出了后验均值的隐式刻画，但后续节需要的是显式的仿射分解。本小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的线性组合，并给出系数所满足的恒等式；这些恒等式是下一节“高斯后验的闭式”直接引用的对象。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（后验均值的仿射分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>结论</strong>：存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{(t)},c_t^{(0)}$</span>，使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=c_t^{(t)}x_t+c_t^{(0)}x_0,$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t^{(t)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t},\\qquad c_t^{(0)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\tilde\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}},\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_t=\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right)^{-1}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2 的一阶条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\ell=0$</span>，其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\ell=-\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}x+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0).$$</div>\n令其为零并解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right)x=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0.$$</div>\n左端系数矩阵即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\tilde\\beta_t\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\right)$</span>，逐项读出系数即得所述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（系数和恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{(t)}+c_t^{(0)}=1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\alpha_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=1-\\beta_1$</span>，一般不等）。更精确地，对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t^{(t)}+c_t^{(0)}=\\tilde\\beta_t\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right),$$</div>\n该量不恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的程度刻画了后验均值对两端点的“非凸组合”性质。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接由命题 4 的系数表达式相加得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_0}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_0=0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1^{(0)}$</span> 的表达式出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span>，须单独处理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 退化（条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 确定），不属于本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span> 的一般讨论范围，故命题 4 的适用范围应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 不作为随机变量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5 提醒：后验均值一般不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的凸组合，系数和不为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；这与“桥的均值应落在两端点之间”的直觉不同，原因在于前向转移的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与边缘方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 不等，权重未归一。下一节配方时会看到，归一化后的系数才构成凸组合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-7-后验协方差的两种等价刻画\">7. 后验协方差的两种等价刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-7-后验协方差的两种等价刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 用 Hessian 负逆给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，本小节给出第二种刻画：通过前向转移与边缘方差的“并联”公式。两种刻画相等是一个可检验的恒等式，也是后续“方差下界”节的出发点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（协方差的并联公式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t:=\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t:=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\left(\\frac{1}{v_t/\\alpha_t}+\\frac{1}{w_t}\\right)^{-1}=\\frac{\\alpha_t v_t w_t}{w_t+\\alpha_t v_t}.$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\min\\{v_t/\\alpha_t,\\,w_t\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一个等号是命题 2 的 Hessian 负逆改写：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t/\\beta_t=1/(\\beta_t/\\alpha_t)$</span>。第二个等号是代数化简。不等式由“并联电阻小于任一分量”的初等事实：对正数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/a+1/b)^{-1}&lt;a$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;b$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的意义：后验方差小于前向转移方差（除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span>）与边缘方差中的任何一个。这解释了为什么后验比先验更“尖”：条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 两端点后，中间状态的不确定性被两个约束同时压缩。后续“方差下界”节将证明：任何反向核的方差若小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则对应 KL 项发散；若大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则 KL 项有正的下界。命题 6 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 正是该下界的候选值。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的单调性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 不减。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的单调性不必然与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 一致；具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 两个序列共同决定，后者随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 可能先增后减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 递减（因每个因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 递增；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t/\\alpha_t=\\beta_t/(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 不减时递增。两个递增量的并联仍递增，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 不减的假设下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 实际关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 递增。若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 不减的假设，则两个因子方向可能相反，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的单调性无一般结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 7 修正了命题陈述中的含糊处：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 不减的标准设定下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 确实递增，这与“后验在早期时间步更尖、晚期更宽”的直觉一致。该单调性在后续“训练目标的简化”节用于说明时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 的量级变化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-8-后验的熵与互信息恒等式\">8. 后验的熵与互信息恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-8-后验的熵与互信息恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出后验的一个信息论恒等式，用于连接本节与“与得分匹配的关系”节。后验的微分熵有闭式，且它与前向链的互信息满足一个分解恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（后验熵的闭式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>结论</strong>：对几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\right)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\!\\left(2\\pi e\\,\\tilde\\beta_t\\right),$$</div>\n且该熵不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的取值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2，后验是协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 的高斯分布（均值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 变，协方差不随）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span> 的微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\log\\det(2\\pi e\\,\\Sigma)$</span>；代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\,\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（互信息分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0,x_t)$</span> 的微分熵有限。<strong>结论</strong>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(x_{t-1};x_t\\mid x_0)=h\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\right)-h\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\right)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\tilde\\beta_t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：条件互信息的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(x_{t-1};x_t\\mid x_0)=h(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)-h(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>。第一项由前序节边缘公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I)$</span>，熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}))$</span>。第二项由命题 8。相减得所述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9 的右端为正，因为由命题 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故对数内比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;1$</span>。这给出一个可检验的不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t/\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，由 A1 显然成立。该恒等式在后续“与得分匹配的关系”节用于把得分匹配的加权系数解释为条件互信息的倒数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-9-后验的采样表示与重参数化的接口\">9. 后验的采样表示与重参数化的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-9-后验的采样表示与重参数化的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续“重参数化”节需要后验的采样公式。本小节给出该公式并证明其与命题 4 的仿射分解一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（后验的重参数化采样）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 独立，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=c_t^{(t)}x_t+c_t^{(0)}x_0+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,\\varepsilon$$</div>\n服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：右端是独立高斯变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>（视为固定）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的仿射函数，故服从高斯分布；其均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{(t)}x_t+c_t^{(0)}x_0=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>（命题 4），协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的协方差乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>）。由命题 2，后验是均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 的高斯，故两者同分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 是后续“重参数化”节的直接输入：它把“从后验采样”化为“从标准高斯采样再仿射变换”，从而使梯度可以通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 回传。需要强调，命题 10 的采样公式只对后验成立，不对反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 成立；后者是待学习的分布，其重参数化需单独定义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-10-一个反例边界-beta_t-to1-时后验退化\">10. 一个反例边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to1$</span> 时后验退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-10-一个反例边界-beta_t-to1-时后验退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有命题都依赖 A1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>）。本小节指出 A1 失效时后验的行为，作为后续反例节的边界说明（完整反例构造见第 10 节，此处只给出一句边界陈述，不展开）。</p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，前向转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 的均值趋于零、方差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的信息关联消失；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 趋于边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>，命题 4 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{(t)}\\to0$</span>，后验不再“桥接” <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。这一退化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时使 A1 失效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 仍正，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=0$</span> 使命题 6 的并联公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t/\\alpha_t$</span> 发散），故本节命题的适用范围严格排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span>。完整构造与失效分析见第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-11-本节与后续节的推导链接口\">11. 本节与后续节的推导链接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-11-本节与后续节的推导链接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立了后验的定义（命题 1）、二次结构（命题 2）、仿射分解（命题 4）、协方差并联公式（命题 6）、熵与互信息恒等式（命题 8、9）、重参数化采样（命题 10）。这些对象构成后续节的输入：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>下一节“高斯后验的闭式”将把命题 2 的 Hessian 负逆与命题 4 的仿射分解合并，写成标准高斯形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，并验证其与命题 1 的密度表达式一致。</li>\n<li>“方差下界”节将用命题 6 的并联公式证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是 KL 项的下界候选。</li>\n<li>“重参数化”节将直接引用命题 10 的采样公式。</li>\n<li>“训练目标的简化”节将用命题 3 的矩表示与命题 4 的仿射分解，把 KL 化为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的期望。</li>\n<li>“与得分匹配的关系”节将用推论 9 的互信息恒等式解释加权系数。</li>\n<li>第 10 节反例节将展开第 10 小节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to1$</span> 边界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节不重复这些后续节的推导，只保证接口的符号与恒等式自洽。特别地，本节所有命题的假设（A1、A2）在后续节中保持不变，后续节若需额外假设（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性）将在该节开头显式列出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-高斯后验的闭式\">高斯后验的闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-高斯后验的闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0:=1$</span>；边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。逐时间步 KL 已在前序节定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}_t=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big],\\quad t\\ge 2,$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}[-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]$</span>。本节只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 的后验闭式。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，分别定义为后验均值与后验方差标量；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t:=\\tilde\\beta_t I\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span>。记号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的欧氏范数平方。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中核对：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性。</strong> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 均为非退化高斯，其密度关于 Lebesgue 测度存在且处处为正。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 条件密度的贝叶斯一致性。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下的联合密度由前向链给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 处处成立，故条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)/q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 良定义。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 高斯乘积封闭性。</strong> 两个高斯密度的乘积（作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 固定）仍是高斯密度，其归一化常数由配方给出；这是有限维高斯分布的标准性质，无需额外正则性。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 矩阵维度与指标。</strong> 所有协方差矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 标量矩阵（数量矩阵），故配方可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上逐坐标进行，且各坐标共享同一标量方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下为何成立：(A1) 由前向链的构造直接给出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 是扩散调度的定义域）；(A2) 是马尔可夫链的因子分解与贝叶斯公式的直接应用；(A3) 是高斯分布在线性变换与条件化下的封闭性；(A4) 是前向链采用各向同性协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t I$</span> 的直接后果。四条的验证均不依赖任何未陈述的外部条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-定义-后验的精确对象\">定义：后验的精确对象<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-定义-后验的精确对象\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，定义后验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为在给定终端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件分布。它与相邻概念的区别必须说清：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它与<strong>反向去噪分布</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 不同：后者以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为参数、不以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件，是待学习的生成分布；前者以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件，是前向链诱导的、完全已知的分布（不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>）。ELBO 的逐项 KL 正是用前者去逼近后者。</li>\n<li>它与<strong>边缘后验</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 不同：后者需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 积分，一般没有闭式；而以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件的版本有闭式，这正是 ELBO 可计算的关键。</li>\n<li>它与<strong>前向转移</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 方向相反：前者从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，后者从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 前进到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-12-5-1-高斯后验的闭式\">命题 12.5.1（高斯后验的闭式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-12-5-1-高斯后验的闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 存在标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 与向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I\\big),$$</div>\n且显式地\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\beta_t,\\qquad\n\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (A2)，对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\propto q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n由前向链定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N\\big(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I\\big),\\qquad\nq(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I\\big).$$</div>\n将两个密度写成指数形式，忽略与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 无关的因子：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\propto\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1}\\|^2\\Big),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\propto\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\|x_{t-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0\\|^2\\Big).$$</div>\n乘积的指数为二次型。记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A:=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}},\\qquad\nb:=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}\\,x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0,$$</div>\n则指数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\big(A\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2-2\\langle b,x_{t-1}\\rangle\\big)+C(x_t,x_0)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 无关。配方得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{A}{2}\\Big\\|x_{t-1}-\\frac{b}{A}\\Big\\|^2+C'(x_t,x_0),$$</div>\n故后验为高斯，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=b/A$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-1}I$</span>。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>：利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A=\\frac{1-\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\n=\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})},$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=(1-\\alpha_t)+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 并整理。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=A^{-1}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\beta_t,$$</div>\n这正是 canonical claim 中的方差表达式。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>。</p>\n<p>计算均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=b/A=\\tilde\\beta_t\\,b$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t\\Big(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\Big)\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0.$$</div>\n两项系数即命题所述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-推论-12-5-2-均值对-x_0-的线性与对-x_t-的仿射\">推论 12.5.2（均值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的线性与对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-推论-12-5-2-均值对-x_0-的线性与对-x_t-的仿射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> 命题 12.5.1 的条件成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\mapsto\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的线性映射，其矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I$</span>；对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mapsto\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 是仿射映射，线性部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 12.5.1 的显式表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的线性组合，系数为标量乘以单位矩阵。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无常数项，故为线性；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 亦无常数项，故严格说也是线性而非仅仿射——这里“仿射”一词覆盖线性情形。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验的恒等式。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0$</span>（即前向边缘的均值点），代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,x_0\\big)\n=\\Big(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)x_0.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t\\big)/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\cdots$</span>，直接整理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big(\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t\\big)\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t),$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0$</span>。这与直觉一致：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 恰在其边缘均值处，后验均值回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的边缘均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-一种常见的误算\">一种常见的误算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-一种常见的误算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在配方时若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的方差误写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>（而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>），会得到错误的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>。正确结果是命题 12.5.1 中的两式；检验方式是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\cdot(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=\\beta_t$</span> 的极限行为应与前向转移的噪声尺度相容，而错误公式不满足这一相容性。另一种误算是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 的系数互换，这会破坏推论 12.5.2 中的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，可用该恒等式作为快速自检。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是高斯的，其方差标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 与均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 由命题 12.5.1 显式给出，证明仅用贝叶斯因子分解与高斯配方。</li>\n<li>均值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 线性、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 线性，且满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>；该恒等式可作为实现中的自检。</li>\n<li>本节闭式是后续方差下界、重参数化与训练目标简化的唯一入口：所有逐时间步 KL 的解析化都建立在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 这一形式上。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-12-5-3-后验方差的单调性与边界行为\">命题 12.5.3（后验方差的单调性与边界行为）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-12-5-3-后验方差的单调性与边界行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。则：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\in(0,1)$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>（即噪声调度趋于恒等、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\to 0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 很大、前向链已充分混合）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> (i) 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，比值严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 且为正。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\to 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\epsilon_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\epsilon_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t=\\epsilon_{t-1}+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t-\\epsilon_{t-1}=\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{t-1}/\\epsilon_t\\to 1$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 1$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 1$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to\\beta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 命题 12.5.3 说明后验方差恒不超过前向单步噪声方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，且在调度两端（极弱噪声或极强混合）退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>。中间区段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span> 反映了“已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的不确定性被压缩”这一事实：条件化削减了方差。该单调压缩是后续方差下界讨论的出发点——任何对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的近似若给出大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的值，必与 (i) 矛盾。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-12-5-4-后验均值作为-x_t-与-x_0-的凸组合的等价形式\">命题 12.5.4（后验均值作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的凸组合的等价形式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-12-5-4-后验均值作为-x_t-与-x_0-的凸组合的等价形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> 命题 12.5.1 的条件成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 定义标量权重\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t^{(0)}:=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad\nw_t^{(t)}:=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=w_t^{(0)}x_0+w_t^{(t)}x_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{(0)}+w_t^{(t)}\\ne 1$</span> 一般成立；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 时二者之和恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。进一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 可等价地写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的“去噪校正”形式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\hat\\epsilon_t\\Big),\\qquad\n\\hat\\epsilon_t:=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 第一部分的显式系数直接取自命题 12.5.1。求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t^{(0)}+w_t^{(t)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 并整理分子：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t+\\alpha_t\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\cdots$$</div>\n为避免跳步，直接通分：分子乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=1-\\bar\\alpha_t-\\beta_t$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\cdot$</span>分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t-\\beta_t$</span>。此式一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，故和不为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 时，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>（推论 12.5.2 的恒等式），即和等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二部分的等价形式：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_t$</span> 表出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\epsilon_t)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=w_t^{(0)}x_0+w_t^{(t)}x_t$</span>，合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 化简，即得所述形式。逐步核对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t^{(0)}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}+w_t^{(t)}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_t$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-w_t^{(0)}\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 乘以某量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，故需验证\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big)\\cdots$$</div>\n直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，右端化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big)$</span>。通分后分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\beta_t$</span> 除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，再乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>，需与左端相等。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 可验证两边恒等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 第二形式把后验均值写成“从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 减去按噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 加权的标准化残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_t$</span>，再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>”。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_t$</span> 正是前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的标准化噪声：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_t=\\epsilon$</span> 几乎必然。这一形式是后续“与得分匹配的关系”一节中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 与得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 联系起来的代数桥梁：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_t=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处成立（因高斯对数密度的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-12-5-5-逐时间步-KL-的闭式化-仅用本节闭式\">命题 12.5.5（逐时间步 KL 的闭式化，仅用本节闭式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-12-5-5-逐时间步-KL-的闭式化-仅用本节闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关的标量协方差（这是 DDPM 章采用的参数化，本节只引用其形式，不展开其推导）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 可测且平方可积于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}_t=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2\\Big]+\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 两个各向同性高斯的 KL 有标准闭式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\sigma_1^2 I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\sigma_2^2 I)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_2^2}\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{\\sigma_1^2}+\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}-1\\Big).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_2=\\mu_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\sigma_t^2$</span> 即得。该闭式的推导只用高斯密度的显式对数与迹恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(I)=d$</span>，无需交换积分与极限；外层期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}$</span> 作用于非负可测函数，由 (A1) 的处处正密度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的平方可积性保证有限（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 平方可积，则第一项期望有限；第二项为常数）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 该命题把前序节定义的抽象 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_t$</span> 化为两项：一项是均值匹配的加权平方误差，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span>；另一项是与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关的常数，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。后者在训练中不提供梯度（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 而言），但在比较不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 参数化时决定 ELBO 的绝对水平。注意这里没有把“目标值相等”误当作“梯度相等”：第一项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度确实只经由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，而第二项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为零——这一区分是后续“训练目标的简化”一节合法的前提。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-推论-12-5-6-sigma_t-2-tilde-beta_t-时-KL-的退化\">推论 12.5.6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时 KL 的退化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-推论-12-5-6-sigma_t-2-tilde-beta_t-时-KL-的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> 命题 12.5.5 的条件成立，且取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>（即反向方差取后验方差）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}_t=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\log 1+1-1)=0$</span> 消失。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 在命题 12.5.5 的常数项中代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\tilde\\beta_t/\\tilde\\beta_t)+\\tilde\\beta_t/\\tilde\\beta_t-1=0+1-1=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 该退化说明：当反向方差与后验方差匹配时，逐时间步 KL 纯粹是均值匹配的加权平方误差，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化。这一权重正是“忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”一节要讨论的对象：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 误当作与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关的常数，则各时间步的相对重要性被扭曲，训练目标不再等于 ELBO。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-12-5-7-后验均值的有界性与-Lipschitz-常数\">命题 12.5.7（后验均值的有界性与 Lipschitz 常数）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-12-5-7-后验均值的有界性与-Lipschitz-常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span> 属于紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_0,K_t\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)\\mapsto\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_0\\times K_t$</span> 上 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数不超过\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t:=\\max\\big(w_t^{(0)},w_t^{(t)}\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{(0)},w_t^{(t)}$</span> 为命题 12.5.4 的权重；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|\\le w_t^{(0)}\\|x_0\\|+w_t^{(t)}\\|x_t\\|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 12.5.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的线性组合，系数为非负标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{(0)},w_t^{(t)}$</span>。对任意两点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t),(x_0',x_t')$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t',x_0')\\|\\le w_t^{(0)}\\|x_0-x_0'\\|+w_t^{(t)}\\|x_t-x_t'\\|\\le L_t\\big(\\|x_0-x_0'\\|+\\|x_t-x_t'\\|\\big).$$</div>\n在乘积空间上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 型度量即得 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 型度量时常数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}L_t$</span>。有界性由三角不等式直接给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 该命题为后续“重参数化”一节中讨论重参数化梯度的可交换性提供正则性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 线性，故其梯度为常矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{(t)}I$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关；这意味着对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求导与对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求期望可交换（Leibniz 法则的离散版本），无需 Dominated Convergence 的额外验证。同时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 的显式形式让“后验均值不会放大输入扰动”这一直觉有了定量版本。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-恒等式验证-tilde-beta_t-与-tilde-mu_t-的相容性\">恒等式验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-恒等式验证-tilde-beta_t-与-tilde-mu_t-的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>作为本节闭式的一个可检验恒等式，验证后验均值与后验方差满足高斯条件化的“精度相加”关系。记前向转移的精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1:=1/\\beta_t$</span>、前向边缘的精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2:=1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，则后验精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda:=\\lambda_1\\alpha_t+\\lambda_2=1/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，且后验均值满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda\\,\\tilde\\mu_t=\\lambda_1\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_t+\\lambda_2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0.$$</div>\n这正是命题 12.5.1 证明中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=b/\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的等价陈述。数值上，对上一小节例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=1/0.2=5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2=1/0.1=10$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=5\\cdot 0.8+10=14$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=1/14$</span>，与解析值一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\tilde\\mu_2=5\\cdot\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot 0.5+10\\cdot\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot 1.0\\approx 2.236068+9.486833=11.722901$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$14$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.837350$</span>，与命题 12.5.1 的均值一致。该恒等式可作为实现中检查精度与均值是否自洽的快速断言，代码中已通过 <code>assert np.isclose(beta_tilde, 1/14)</code> 与均值断言覆盖。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-与相邻概念的边界-后验闭式不蕴含反向过程闭式\">与相邻概念的边界：后验闭式不蕴含反向过程闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-与相邻概念的边界-后验闭式不蕴含反向过程闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>必须显式区分：本节给出的是<strong>以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件</strong>的后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的闭式。反向生成过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 不以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件，其真实形式（即若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 取最优时的形式）需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 积分，一般无闭式。ELBO 的合法性恰恰来自：用有闭式的条件后验去构造变分分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 只需可计算即可，不要求闭式。把“后验有闭式”误读为“反向过程有闭式”是常见混淆；本节的所有命题只对前者成立。后续“与得分匹配的关系”一节将说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_t$</span> 与得分相连，而这一联系不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 的可积性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-维度与坐标的显式核对\">维度与坐标的显式核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-维度与坐标的显式核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上逐坐标成立，因为协方差均为标量矩阵。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=(x_t^{(1)},\\dots,x_t^{(d)})$</span>，则对每个坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t^{(i)}=w_t^{(0)}x_0^{(i)}+w_t^{(t)}x_t^{(i)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}\\big(x_{t-1}^{(i)}\\mid x_t,x_0\\big)=\\tilde\\beta_t,$$</div>\n且不同坐标的后验条件独立（因协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 无跨坐标项）。这一逐坐标独立性是 (A4) 的直接推论，也是后续重参数化中“每个坐标独立采样标准正态”的依据。若前向协方差不是标量矩阵（例如对角但各坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^{(i)}$</span> 不同），则本节闭式需逐坐标替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to\\beta_t^{(i)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to\\bar\\alpha_t^{(i)}$</span>，命题 12.5.1 的证明结构不变，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 变为对角矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(\\tilde\\beta_t^{(i)})$</span>；本节不展开该推广，因其不改变 ELBO 的逐项结构，只改变常数项中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为各坐标项之和。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-12-5-8-后验均值与边缘均值的偏差恒等式\">命题 12.5.8（后验均值与边缘均值的偏差恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-12-5-8-后验均值与边缘均值的偏差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0$</span> 为前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{t-1}:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的均值。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-m_{t-1}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(x_t-m_t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 12.5.1 的显式表达式，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t-m_{t-1}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t+\\Big(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Big)x_0.$$</div>\n合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 系数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Big(\\frac{\\beta_t-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Big(\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t-1+\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big).$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t-1+\\beta_t=-\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 系数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\frac{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t-m_{t-1}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0.$$</div>\n再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\alpha_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，第二项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，与第一项提取公因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 后恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0=x_t-m_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 该恒等式把后验均值相对边缘均值的偏移写成前向残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-m_t$</span> 的线性缩放，缩放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t:=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\in(0,1)$</span>。它说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 偏离其边缘均值时，后验均值只按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的比例朝同方向偏移，而非全额跟随——这正是条件化压缩不确定性的代数表现，与命题 12.5.3 的方差压缩互为对偶。该恒等式还给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的显式上界：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}&lt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t&lt;1$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-m_{t-1}\\|\\le\\|x_t-m_t\\|$</span>，即后验均值到边缘均值的距离不超过前向残差的范数。这一不等式在后续“与得分匹配的关系”一节中用于界定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_t$</span> 的缩放误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-推论-12-5-9-kappa_t-与-tilde-beta_t-beta_t-的关系\">推论 12.5.9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t$</span> 的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-推论-12-5-9-kappa_t-与-tilde-beta_t-beta_t-的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> 命题 12.5.8 的条件成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t:=\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\rho_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^2=\\alpha_t\\rho_t^2$</span>。进一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^2+\\rho_t\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\cdot\\alpha_t$</span> 不构成独立恒等式；唯一成立的代数关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\rho_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由定义直接读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\rho_t$</span>。平方即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 该推论把两个压缩因子联系起来：方差压缩比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 与均值偏移比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t&lt;\\rho_t$</span>，即均值偏移的压缩比方差压缩更“保守”。这一关系在实现中可用于交叉校验：若代码分别计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t$</span> 与命题 12.5.8 的缩放因子，二者之商必须等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>，否则说明某一处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 索引错位。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-12-5-10-后验协方差的迹与熵\">命题 12.5.10（后验协方差的迹与熵）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-12-5-10-后验协方差的迹与熵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 的协方差迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_t)=d\\,\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，微分熵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\big(2\\pi e\\,\\tilde\\beta_t\\big),$$</div>\n且该熵与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 无关，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m,\\sigma^2 I)$</span> 的微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 即得。熵不依赖均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，故与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 熵的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 无关性说明：后验的不确定性大小完全由时间步决定，与具体观测值无关——这是各向同性高斯假设 (A4) 的直接后果。若协方差依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>（如学习到的对角方差），熵将随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 变化，逐时间步 KL 的常数项也不再是常数。该命题为后续“方差下界”一节提供基准：任何对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的近似若改变熵，就改变了 ELBO 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数项，从而改变不同时间步之间的相对权重。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-12-5-11-后验对-x_0-的依赖在-t-to-1-时的退化\">命题 12.5.11（后验对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的依赖在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1$</span> 时的退化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-12-5-11-后验对-x_0-的依赖在-t-to-1-时的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1\\in(0,1)$</span> 固定。</p>\n<p><strong>结论：</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\dfrac{\\beta_1}{1-\\alpha_2\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2\\to 0$</span>（第二步噪声趋于零）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2\\to\\sqrt{\\alpha_2}\\,x_1$</span> 的极限需谨慎：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2\\to\\sqrt{\\alpha_2}x_1$</span> 几乎必然，后验退化为点质量，熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to-\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 12.5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\rho_2\\beta_2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_2)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2$</span> 无关（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=\\alpha_2\\bar\\alpha_1=(1-\\beta_2)\\bar\\alpha_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_2$</span> 实际依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2$</span>）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2\\to 1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2\\to\\bar\\alpha_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_2\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2\\to\\beta_2\\to 0$</span>。均值方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2^{(0)}\\to\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}\\cdot 0/(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2^{(t)}\\to 1\\cdot(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2\\to x_2$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{\\alpha_2}x_1+\\sqrt{\\beta_2}\\epsilon\\to x_1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2\\to 1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2\\to x_1$</span>。熵由命题 12.5.10 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2\\to 0$</span> 发散到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读。</strong> 该退化说明后验闭式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 时的极限行为：方差消失、均值锁定到前一步，熵发散。这一极限不是 ELBO 的合法参数点（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 发散），故实际调度必须保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有正下界；这也是后续“方差下界”一节要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 有正下界的动机之一。命题同时澄清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 的后验仍依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>（经由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2^{(0)}$</span>），只是当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2\\to 0$</span> 时该依赖消失——这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 条件”的边界一致，衔接了前序节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项的定义。</p>\n<pre><code></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-方差下界\">方差下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-方差下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已固定的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 固定。后验闭式已在第 5 节建立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I\\big),\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t .$$</div>\n<p>本节只处理第 3 节逐项 KL 中出现的方差比较项。为避免与第 5 节的均值推导重复，本节引入如下新符号并写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(t)$</span>：变分模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(t))$</span> 的协方差矩阵，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(t)=\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 为可学习标量（对角各向同性）。维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2:=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>：真实后验方差标量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t(\\theta):=\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)-\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>：方差偏差标量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(\\mathcal N(m_1,\\sigma_1^2I)\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal N(m_2,\\sigma_2^2I)\\big)$</span>：两个各向同性高斯在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 KL，闭式见引理 6.2。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设（逐条显式）：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减。这保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 且有限，后验良定义。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mapsto\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微。这是第 3 节 KL 可积性与本节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 求导的前提。</p>\n<p>(A3) 期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立。这是 KL 有限性的充分条件（见引理 6.2 的证明），在第 3 节已作为可积性假设写入。</p>\n<p>(A4) 本节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 求导时，使用 Leibniz 积分求导法则；被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 的偏导在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2\\in[\\epsilon,\\infty)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>）上被一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关的可积函数控制。该控制函数由 (A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在紧区间上的有界性给出，故条件成立。</p>\n<p>(A5) 本节不涉及时间极限与积分交换，仅做有限维代数与单变量求导，故无需 Dominated Convergence；唯一用到的是 Leibniz 法则，其条件由 (A4) 验证。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别。</strong> 第 3 节逐项 KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span>，其被积对象是两个高斯测度；第 5 节给出后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的闭式；本节只固定均值、单独考察方差参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 对 KL 的贡献，并证明该贡献在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 处取唯一极小值。这与“均值匹配”是两件独立的事：均值偏差项与方差偏差项在 KL 闭式中可加分离（引理 6.2），故方差下界可单独陈述，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的选取。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-1-两个各向同性高斯之间的-KL-闭式\">6.1 两个各向同性高斯之间的 KL 闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-1-两个各向同性高斯之间的-KL-闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>引理 6.2（高斯 KL 闭式）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1,m_2\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2,\\sigma_2^2&gt;0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(\\mathcal N(m_1,\\sigma_1^2I)\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal N(m_2,\\sigma_2^2I)\\big)\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{\\sigma_1^2}+\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}-1\\Big)+\\frac{\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2}{2\\sigma_2^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2,\\sigma_2^2\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1,m_2\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 有限。无其他正则性需求（有限维高斯测度绝对连续）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\mathcal N(m_i,\\sigma_i^2I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,2$</span>。KL 定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_1\\|p_2)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p_1(x)\\log\\frac{p_1(x)}{p_2(x)}\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_i^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,p_2$</span> 互相绝对连续，积分有限（下面逐项算出）。写密度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_i(x)=-\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_i^2)-\\frac{\\|x-m_i\\|^2}{2\\sigma_i^2}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_1(x)}{p_2(x)}\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{\\sigma_1^2}\n-\\frac{\\|x-m_1\\|^2}{2\\sigma_1^2}+\\frac{\\|x-m_2\\|^2}{2\\sigma_2^2}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 取期望。第一项为常数。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_1}\\|x-m_1\\|^2=d\\sigma_1^2$</span>，故贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{d\\sigma_1^2}{2\\sigma_1^2}=-\\frac d2$</span>。第三项需展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x-m_2\\|^2=\\|x-m_1\\|^2+2\\langle x-m_1,m_1-m_2\\rangle+\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x-m_1\\|^2=d\\sigma_1^2$</span>，交叉项期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（中心化），常数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_1}\\frac{\\|x-m_2\\|^2}{2\\sigma_2^2}\n=\\frac{d\\sigma_1^2+\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2}{2\\sigma_2^2}.$$</div>\n<p>合并三项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_1\\|p_2)\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{\\sigma_1^2}-\\frac d2+\\frac{d\\sigma_1^2}{2\\sigma_2^2}+\\frac{\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2}{2\\sigma_2^2},$$</div>\n<p>即引理所述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 引理 6.2 的右端关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sigma_1^2,\\sigma_2^2)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2$</span> 是可分离的：均值项只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2/(2\\sigma_2^2)$</span> 进入，方差项只通过前一个括号进入。这一可分离性是本节“方差下界”能独立于均值讨论的结构性原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-2-方差下界的主定理\">6.2 方差下界的主定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-2-方差下界的主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 6.3（方差下界）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的均值映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span>，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\sigma_\\theta^2):=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)I)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\sigma_\\theta^2)\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}-1\\Big)\n+\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 的函数，在</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_\\theta^{2,\\star}(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t+\\frac{1}{d}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$$</div>\n<p>处取唯一极小值；特别地，当均值完全匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(\\cdot,t)=\\tilde\\mu_t(\\cdot,x_0)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>-几乎处处意义下）时，极小点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^{2,\\star}(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，且此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(\\tilde\\beta_t)=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 中方差项为零。由此得到方差下界：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\sigma_\\theta^2)\\ge \\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}-1\\Big)\\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>第二个不等号对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)&gt;0$</span> 成立，等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时取得。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>；(A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 可测、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 可微；(A3) 保证均值偏差项的期望有限，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 有限且可对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 求导；(A4) 保证求导与期望交换合法。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一步，把引理 6.2 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2=p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)I)$</span>。逐点（固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>）有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_1\\|p_2)\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}-1\\Big)\n+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)} .$$</div>\n<p>第二步，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望。第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关，直接提出；第二项由 (A3) 可积，期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\sigma_\\theta^2(t))$</span> 交换（线性）。得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 的表达式。</p>\n<p>第三步，求极小。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:=\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b:=\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c:=\\frac1d\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2\\ge0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(s)=\\frac d2\\Big(\\log\\frac sb+\\frac bs-1\\Big)+\\frac{dc}{2s}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 求导（由 (A4) 合法）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm dL_t}{\\mathrm ds}\n=\\frac d2\\Big(\\frac1s-\\frac{b}{s^2}\\Big)-\\frac{dc}{2s^2}\n=\\frac{d}{2s^2}\\big(s-b-c\\big).$$</div>\n<p>令导数为零得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=b+c$</span>。二阶导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d^2L_t}{\\mathrm ds^2}\n=\\frac d2\\Big(-\\frac1{s^2}+\\frac{2b}{s^3}\\Big)+\\frac{dc}{s^3}\n=\\frac{d}{2s^3}\\big(2b+2c-s\\big).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=b+c$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2b+2c-s=b+c&gt;0$</span>，故为严格极小。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s)\\to+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0^+$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c/s$</span> 项均发散）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s)\\to+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 项发散），故极小唯一。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=b$</span>。</p>\n<p>第四步，方差下界。由第三步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s)-L_t(s^\\star)\\ge0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s)\\ge L_t(s^\\star)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s^\\star)$</span> 中方差项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dc}{2(b+c)}\\ge0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s)\\ge\\frac d2\\big(\\log\\frac sb+\\frac bs-1\\big)$</span>。最后，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u+1/u-1\\ge0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\log u\\ge0$</span>，等号仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span>），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=s/b$</span> 即得第二个不等号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.4（方差项的独立下界）.</strong> 在定理 6.3 的假设下，逐项 KL 中由方差失配贡献的部分满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}-1\\Big)\\ge0,$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。因此若训练目标把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 作为自由参数，则任何偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的取值都会使 ELBO 严格下降（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge1$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 直接由定理 6.3 第四步与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\log u\\ge0$</span> 的等号条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与均值项的耦合）.</strong> 推论 6.4 只说明方差项本身非负；它不意味着最优方差恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>——定理 6.3 表明当均值失配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 时，最优方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t+c$</span>，即模型会用更大的方差去“吸收”均值误差。这是方差下界与均值匹配耦合的唯一通道，且耦合强度正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>。第 8 节训练目标简化将利用这一点：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则方差项恒为零，目标只剩均值项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-3-一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子\">6.3 一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-3-一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 6.5（方差项的恒等式）.</strong> 在定理 6.3 假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(s)-\\frac{1}{2s}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2\n=\\frac d2\\Big(\\log\\frac sb+\\frac bs-1\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定理 6.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 表达式直接移项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式可用来在数值上分离“方差项”与“均值项”：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s)$</span> 与均值项，二者之差应精确等于右端标量函数，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 成正比、与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 分布无关。</p>\n<p><strong>例 6.6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 的数值验证）.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\tilde\\beta_t=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0.05$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=0.05$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>。由定理 6.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=0.15$</span>。计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(0.1)=\\frac12\\Big(\\log1+\\frac{0.1}{0.1}-1\\Big)+\\frac{0.05}{2\\cdot0.1}=0+0.25=0.25,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(0.15)=\\frac12\\Big(\\log1.5+\\frac{0.1}{0.15}-1\\Big)+\\frac{0.05}{2\\cdot0.15}\n=\\frac12(0.405465+0.666667-1)+0.166667\n=0.036066+0.166667=0.202733.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(0.15)&lt;L_t(0.1)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=0.15$</span> 一致。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.3$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(0.3)=\\frac12\\Big(\\log3+\\frac{0.1}{0.3}-1\\Big)+\\frac{0.05}{0.6}\n=\\frac12(1.098612+0.333333-1)+0.083333\n=0.215973+0.083333=0.299306&gt;L_t(0.15).$$</div>\n<p>三点比较确认极小在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star$</span> 处。下面的代码节将把该例与一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的恒等式一并数值验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-4-方差下界与-固定方差-约定的关系\">6.4 方差下界与“固定方差”约定的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-4-方差下界与-固定方差-约定的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节将采用 DDPM 的常见约定：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的方差固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>），只学习均值。定理 6.3 给出这一约定的精确代价：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，方差项为零，但若均值失配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(\\tilde\\beta_t)=\\frac{dc}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>，而可学习方差的最优值给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s^\\star)=\\frac d2\\big(\\log\\frac{b+c}{b}+\\frac{b}{b+c}-1\\big)+\\frac{dc}{2(b+c)}$</span>。二者之差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\tilde\\beta_t)-L_t(s^\\star)\n=\\frac{dc}{2b}-\\frac{dc}{2(b+c)}-\\frac d2\\Big(\\log\\frac{b+c}{b}+\\frac{b}{b+c}-1\\Big)\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\frac{c}{b}-\\frac{c}{b+c}-\\log\\frac{b+c}{b}-\\frac{b}{b+c}+1\\Big)$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 时严格为正（可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\log u\\ge0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(b+c)/b&gt;1$</span> 处取严格正，加上代数整理得到）。因此固定方差不是 ELBO 的最优选择，但在均值误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 较小时代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(c^2/b)$</span> 量级：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+c/b)$</span> 展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{b}-\\log(1+\\frac cb)-\\frac{c}{b+c}+\\frac{b}{b+c}-1$</span> 的首阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c^2}{2b^2}$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dc^2}{4b^2}$</span>。这解释了为何固定方差约定在工程上可行：代价是均值误差的二阶小量。该展开的严格陈述与余项估计留到第 8 节训练目标简化中给出，本节只记录这一接口。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>引理 6.2 给出两个各向同性高斯之间 KL 的闭式，并证明其关于均值偏差与方差比是可分离的；这是本节把方差问题从逐项 KL 中独立出来的代数基础。</li>\n<li>定理 6.3 证明逐项 KL 作为方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^{2,\\star}(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t+\\frac1d\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 处取唯一极小，并由此得到方差项的非负下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(\\log\\frac{s}{b}+\\frac bs-1)\\ge0$</span>，等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时成立；推论 6.4 与恒等式 6.5 给出可数值检验的分离形式。</li>\n<li>例 6.6 在一维、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0.05$</span> 的具体数值上验证了极小点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=0.15$</span> 与三点比较；本节同时给出固定方差约定相对最优方差的代价为均值误差的二阶小量这一接口，供第 8 节训练目标简化使用。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef gauss_kl_iso(m1, m2, s1, s2, d):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;KL(N(m1,s1 I) || N(m2,s2 I))，m1,m2 为长度 d 向量。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    assert s1 &gt; 0 and s2 &gt; 0\n    mean_term = np.sum((m1 - m2) ** 2) / (2.0 * s2)\n    var_term = 0.5 * d * (np.log(s2 / s1) + s1 / s2 - 1.0)\n    return var_term + mean_term\n\ndef L_t(s, b, c, d):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;定理 6.3 的 L_t(s)，c = (1/d) E||mu_tilde - mu_theta||^2。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    assert s &gt; 0 and b &gt; 0 and c &gt;= 0\n    return 0.5 * d * (np.log(s / b) + b / s - 1.0) + 0.5 * d * c / s\n\n# 例 6.6：d=1, b=0.1, c=0.05\nd, b, c = 1, 0.1, 0.05\ns_star = b + c\nassert abs(s_star - 0.15) &lt; 1e-12\nvals = {s: L_t(s, b, c, d) for s in [0.1, 0.15, 0.3]}\nprint(&quot;例6.6 L_t 值:&quot;, vals)\nassert vals[0.15] &lt; vals[0.1] and vals[0.15] &lt; vals[0.3]\nassert abs(vals[0.1] - 0.25) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(vals[0.15] - 0.2027325540540822) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 一般 d 的恒等式 6.5 数值验证：随机取 m1,m2,s\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nfor trial in range(5):\n    d = int(rng.integers(1, 6))\n    m1 = rng.normal(size=d)\n    m2 = rng.normal(size=d)\n    s = float(rng.uniform(0.05, 0.5))\n    b = float(rng.uniform(0.05, 0.5))\n    # 构造 L_t(s) 与均值项，验证差等于方差项\n    kl = gauss_kl_iso(m1, m2, b, s, d)  # 对应 q||p，s1=b, s2=s\n    mean_term = np.sum((m1 - m2) ** 2) / (2.0 * s)\n    var_term = 0.5 * d * (np.log(s / b) + b / s - 1.0)\n    assert abs(kl - mean_term - var_term) &lt; 1e-12\n    assert abs(var_term - 0.5 * d * (np.log(s / b) + b / s - 1.0)) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;恒等式 6.5 数值验证通过；KL 分解形状: 标量&quot;)\n\n# 定理 6.3 极小点验证：对若干 (b,c,d) 检查 s_star 最小\nfor b in [0.05, 0.1, 0.3]:\n    for c in [0.0, 0.02, 0.1]:\n        for d in [1, 3, 8]:\n            s_star = b + c\n            grid = np.linspace(0.01, 2.0, 2001)\n            Ls = np.array([L_t(s, b, c, d) for s in grid])\n            assert Ls.min() &gt;= L_t(s_star, b, c, d) - 1e-10\n            assert abs(grid[Ls.argmin()] - s_star) &lt; 0.01 or c == 0.0\nprint(&quot;定理 6.3 极小点数值验证通过；预期 s_star = b + c&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-5-方差下界的逐时间步聚合\">6.5 方差下界的逐时间步聚合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-5-方差下界的逐时间步聚合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前四小节把单个时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的方差贡献孤立出来。本节的目标是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个时间步的方差项聚合，说明“逐项 KL 的方差部分”作为整体也具有一个可分离的下界，并且该下界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>（对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>）处同时取到。这一聚合不是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个标量下界简单相加就完事：需要验证求和与期望交换、以及各时间步的最优方差互不耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.7（聚合方差下界）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记第 3 节逐项 KL 分解中的方差部分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V(\\theta):=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}-1\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>并记均值失配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t:=\\frac1d\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{t=1}^T L_t\\big(\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)\\big)\n= V(\\theta)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\frac{d\\,c_t}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\theta)\\ge0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。进一步，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个独立自由参数，则联合目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t L_t$</span> 的唯一极小点为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_\\theta^{2,\\star}(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t+c_t,\\qquad t=1,\\dots,T,$$</div>\n<p>且各分量的极小互不影响（目标关于各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 可加分离）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1) 保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>；(A2) 保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 可测；(A3) 保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 有限。求和为有限和（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>），无需 Fubini 或 Dominated Convergence；有限和与期望的交换是线性的，不构成极限交换。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一步，由定理 6.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 表达式，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t\\big(\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)\\big)\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}-1\\Big)+\\frac{d\\,c_t}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)} .$$</div>\n<p>第二步，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 求和。有限和保持等式，得聚合表达式。</p>\n<p>第三步，非负性。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t:=\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)/\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 个方差项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(u_t-1-\\log u_t)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\log u\\ge0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>）且等号仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span>，每个加项非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\theta)\\ge0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\theta)=0$</span> 当且仅当每个加项为零，即每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=1$</span>，亦即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<p>第四步，联合极小。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t L_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个单变量函数之和，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span>，联合极小等价于逐分量极小。由定理 6.3 第三步，每个分量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^{2,\\star}(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t+c_t$</span> 处取唯一严格极小；有限个严格极小之和仍在逐分量最优点取唯一严格极小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（聚合下界不是“最紧”的逐点下界之和）.</strong> 命题 6.7 的非负性只用到每个加项非负，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\theta)\\ge0$</span> 是逐点成立的，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\theta)=0$</span> 要求所有时间步同时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>；若只固定部分时间步的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，其余时间步的方差项仍可正。这与第 8 节“固定全部方差”的约定一致：该约定令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(\\theta)\\equiv0$</span>，把 ELBO 的方差自由度完全消去，代价由命题 6.7 的均值项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t d c_t/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 承担。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-6-方差下界对参数化选择的敏感性\">6.6 方差下界对参数化选择的敏感性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-6-方差下界对参数化选择的敏感性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 6.3 的极小点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^{2,\\star}(t)=\\tilde\\beta_t+c_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 又依赖均值网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>。这带来一个在工程上必须澄清的问题：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span> 参数化为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 共享的标量（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\exp(\\psi_\\theta(t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta$</span> 为可学习标量），则方差参数与均值参数在联合优化中耦合；此时“方差下界”不再是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 后的静态结论，而是需要在联合目标上重新陈述。本小节给出这一陈述的精确形式，并证明它不改变下界的非负性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.8（联合参数化下的方差下界）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)=\\exp(\\psi_\\theta(t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta(t)\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\psi_\\theta(t)-\\log\\tilde\\beta_t+\\tilde\\beta_t e^{-\\psi_\\theta(t)}-1\\Big)\\ge0,$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta(t)=\\log\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。并且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta(t)$</span> 的梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial V}{\\partial\\psi_\\theta(t)}\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(1-\\tilde\\beta_t e^{-\\psi_\\theta(t)}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta(t)=\\log\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 处为零；二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\tilde\\beta_t e^{-\\psi_\\theta(t)}&gt;0$</span>，故为严格极小。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\psi}$</span> 均有定义；(A4) 保证对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta$</span> 求导与有限和交换合法（有限和无需控制函数，逐项求导即可）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=e^{\\psi}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(s/b)=\\psi-\\log b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b/s=be^{-\\psi}$</span>。代入命题 6.7 的加项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的表达式。非负性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\log u\\ge0$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=e^{\\psi}/b$</span> 得到；等号条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi=\\log b$</span>。求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\psi}(\\psi-\\log b+be^{-\\psi}-1)=1-be^{-\\psi}$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/2$</span> 得梯度；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi=\\log b$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$be^{-\\psi}=1$</span>，梯度为零；二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\psi}(1-be^{-\\psi})=be^{-\\psi}&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与重参数化的接口）.</strong> 命题 6.8 说明：即便方差以对数标量参数化并与均值共享 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，方差项仍是一个关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta(t)$</span> 的凸函数（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\log u$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span> 上严格凸），其唯一极小在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta(t)=\\log\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。这意味着在联合优化中，方差参数的梯度信号会把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\theta(t)$</span> 拉向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，而均值参数的梯度信号独立地把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 拉向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>；两者的耦合只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 进入最优方差的偏移（定理 6.3），不通过方差项的凸性结构。第 7 节重参数化将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的采样写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta+\\sigma_\\theta\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，本节结论保证该采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta$</span> 的最优取值有闭式可依。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-7-一个边界情形-tilde-beta_t-随-t-退化时的下界行为\">6.7 一个边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 退化时的下界行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-7-一个边界情形-tilde-beta_t-随-t-退化时的下界行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(A1) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 对所有有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。但连续时间 ELBO（第 12 节）会取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 的极限；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 可能趋于零，定理 6.3 的极小点公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t+c_t$</span> 仍形式上有意义，但方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(\\log(s/\\tilde\\beta_t)+\\tilde\\beta_t/s-1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 发散。本小节把这一边界行为写成一条可检验的命题，作为第 12 节的接口，而不在此展开连续时间推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.9（退化方差比的发散率）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\ge0$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0^+$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac d2\\Big(\\log\\frac{s}{\\varepsilon}+\\frac{\\varepsilon}{s}-1\\Big)\n=\\frac d2\\log\\frac{s}{\\varepsilon}+O(1),$$</div>\n<p>即方差项以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\varepsilon)$</span> 的速率发散；而极小点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=\\varepsilon+c_t\\to c_t$</span>，极小值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(s^\\star)=\\frac d2\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\varepsilon+c_t}{\\varepsilon}+\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon+c_t}-1\\Big)+\\frac{d\\,c_t}{2(\\varepsilon+c_t)}$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2\\log\\frac{c_t}{\\varepsilon}+O(1)$</span>，仍发散；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(s^\\star)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\in[0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>。无其他正则性需求（初等极限）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(s/\\varepsilon)=\\log s-\\log\\varepsilon$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\varepsilon\\to+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon/s\\to0$</span>，故主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2\\log(s/\\varepsilon)$</span>，余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac d2+o(1)=O(1)$</span>。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=\\varepsilon+c_t$</span>，代入定理 6.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 表达式；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log((\\varepsilon+c_t)/\\varepsilon)=\\log(1+c_t/\\varepsilon)\\to+\\infty$</span>，故发散；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log1+1-1=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 项为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（为何这不是反例）.</strong> 命题 6.9 不违反定理 6.3 的非负下界：下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(\\log(s/\\tilde\\beta_t)+\\tilde\\beta_t/s-1)\\ge0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 仍成立，只是当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0$</span> 时该下界本身发散。这说明“方差项非负”与“方差项有界”是两件事；连续时间 ELBO 必须用测度变换（把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\varepsilon)$</span> 吸收进时间积分）来处理这一发散，而不能直接取逐点极限。该处理的严格形式属于第 12 节，本节只记录发散率以备接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-8-方差下界与逐项-KL-的数值一致性检验\">6.8 方差下界与逐项 KL 的数值一致性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-8-方差下界与逐项-KL-的数值一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个不依赖具体数据分布的检验：对任意给定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)$</span>，逐项 KL 的解析值（引理 6.2）与“方差项 + 均值项”的分离计算必须逐位一致到机器精度。这一检验在第 14 节代码中会作为 KL 分解验证的一部分复用，但本节先以独立命题的形式固定其代数依据，避免第 14 节重复推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.10（分离计算的代数恒等）.</strong> 在引理 6.2 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1,m_2\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1,s_2&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(\\mathcal N(m_1,s_1I)\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal N(m_2,s_2I)\\big)\n=\\frac d2\\Big(\\log\\frac{s_2}{s_1}+\\frac{s_1}{s_2}-1\\Big)+\\frac{\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2}{2s_2},$$</div>\n<p>右端两项分别为“方差项”与“均值项”，且两项的取值互不依赖对方的参数（方差项不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1,m_2$</span>，均值项不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1$</span>）。因此对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1,m_2$</span>，KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_2$</span> 的极小化可只对方差项进行，均值项作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/s_2$</span> 的系数进入一阶条件，这正是定理 6.3 第三步的代数来源。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一等式即引理 6.2。分离性由右端表达式直接读出：方差项只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1,s_2,d$</span>；均值项只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1,m_2,s_2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_2$</span> 求导时，方差项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(1/s_2-s_1/s_2^2)$</span>，均值项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2/(2s_2^2)$</span>；令和为零即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_2=s_1+\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2/d$</span>，与定理 6.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=\\tilde\\beta_t+c_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2=d\\,c_t$</span> 时一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（可检验性）.</strong> 命题 6.10 的价值在于它把“KL 的解析闭式”与“方差项/均值项的分离计算”钉死为同一个代数恒等式，从而任何数值实现只要在浮点误差内不满足该恒等式，就说明实现中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_2$</span> 或均值范数有一处写错。第 14 节的验证代码将直接以该恒等式为断言，而不是以“训练损失下降”这类间接指标为依据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef kl_iso(m1, m2, s1, s2, d):\n    assert s1 &gt; 0 and s2 &gt; 0\n    return 0.5 * d * (np.log(s2 / s1) + s1 / s2 - 1.0) + np.sum((m1 - m2) ** 2) / (2.0 * s2)\n\ndef split_kl(m1, m2, s1, s2, d):\n    var_term = 0.5 * d * (np.log(s2 / s1) + s1 / s2 - 1.0)\n    mean_term = np.sum((m1 - m2) ** 2) / (2.0 * s2)\n    return var_term, mean_term\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(7)\nfor _ in range(8):\n    d = int(rng.integers(1, 9))\n    m1 = rng.normal(size=d)\n    m2 = rng.normal(size=d)\n    s1 = float(rng.uniform(0.01, 1.0))\n    s2 = float(rng.uniform(0.01, 1.0))\n    total = kl_iso(m1, m2, s1, s2, d)\n    vt, mt = split_kl(m1, m2, s1, s2, d)\n    assert abs(total - (vt + mt)) &lt; 1e-12\n    # 方差项不含均值：改变 m2 不影响 vt\n    vt2, _ = split_kl(m1, m2 + 1.0, s1, s2, d)\n    assert abs(vt - vt2) &lt; 1e-12\n    # 均值项不含 s1：改变 s1 不影响 mt\n    _, mt2 = split_kl(m1, m2, s1 * 2.0, s2, d)\n    assert abs(mt - mt2) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;命题 6.10 分离恒等式与参数独立性验证通过；输出为标量 KL 与 (方差项, 均值项)&quot;)\n\n# 命题 6.9 发散率检验：eps -&gt; 0 时方差项主项为 0.5*d*log(s/eps)\nd, s = 3, 0.2\nfor eps in [1e-1, 1e-2, 1e-3, 1e-4]:\n    vt = 0.5 * d * (np.log(s / eps) + eps / s - 1.0)\n    main = 0.5 * d * np.log(s / eps)\n    assert vt - main &lt; 0.0  # 余项为负常数阶\n    assert abs((vt - main) + 0.5 * d) &lt; 0.5 * d * eps / s + 1e-12\nprint(&quot;命题 6.9 发散率主项检验通过；预期余项趋于 -d/2&quot;)\n\n# 命题 6.8 对数参数化梯度零点检验\nd, b = 4, 0.07\npsi = np.log(b)\ngrad = 0.5 * d * (1.0 - b * np.exp(-psi))\nassert abs(grad) &lt; 1e-12\nhess = 0.5 * d * b * np.exp(-psi)\nassert hess &gt; 0\nprint(&quot;命题 6.8 梯度零点与正二阶导验证通过；预期 grad=0, hess&gt;0&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-重参数化\">重参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向扩散链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>；边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。记数据维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，时间指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>：标准高斯噪声样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>：参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的噪声预测网络，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，输出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 同维。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 诱导的反向均值，定义见下文 (7.3)。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>：反向协方差，本节仅取标量形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)$</span>：简化训练目标，定义见 (7.6)。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,\\theta)\\mapsto\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,\\theta)$</span> 联合可测；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部有界。此假设保证下文期望与梯度交换合法。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 高斯重参数化的合法性</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 正定，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m+SZ\\sim\\mathcal N(m,SS^\\top)$</span>。此为标准事实，本节用它把采样写成确定性变换加噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 反向过程的正则性</strong>：反向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为高斯，故其对数密度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 二次可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span> 保证 KL 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 时间权重非负</strong>：本节所有 KL 项的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，不做额外加权；第 10 节将说明丢弃权重会破坏目标一致性。</p>\n<p>下面给出重参数化的核心定义，并说明它与“直接对高斯密度求期望”的区别。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-重参数化的定义与相邻概念的区别\">重参数化的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 7.1（重参数化）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 独立，则称</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,Z \\tag{7.1}$$</div>\n<p>为后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的重参数化。类似地，对反向分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>，其重参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t Z'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z'\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立。</p>\n<p>区别在于：直接写法把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 视为“分布中的随机变量”，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时必须穿过概率密度；重参数化把随机性全部隔离到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 中，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 成为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的确定性函数加外生噪声。于是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的期望梯度可写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的期望梯度，路径导数（pathwise derivative）合法，这正是训练目标可简化的代数基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.2（重参数化的分布恒等）</strong>：在 (A2) 下，由 (7.1) 定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的边缘分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,I_d$</span>。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m+SZ\\sim\\mathcal N(m,SS^\\top)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$SS^\\top=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span>，故分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m,\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，与后验定义一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明重参数化不改变分布，只改变“随机性来源”。下一小节把它用于 ELBO 中逐项 KL 的梯度计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-逐项-KL-的重参数化形式\">逐项 KL 的重参数化形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-逐项-KL-的重参数化形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已得到逐时间步 KL：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big]. \\tag{7.2}$$</div>\n<p>两个高斯之间的 KL 有闭式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2}{\\sigma_t^2}+d\\left(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1-\\log\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right)\\right]. \\tag{7.3}$$</div>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的欧氏范数。式 (7.3) 中第二项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 固定时），因此对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度只来自第一项。重参数化的作用是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的差写成可采样形式。</p>\n<p>由前序节高斯后验闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的线性组合。具体地，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t. \\tag{7.4}$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span> 代入 (7.4)，得到前序节已建立的等价形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon\\right). \\tag{7.5}$$</div>\n<p>式 (7.5) 是重参数化的关键恒等式：它把后验均值表示为“当前样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 减去按信噪比缩放的噪声”。若反向均值取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>，则 (7.3) 第一项的分子变为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2. \\tag{7.6}$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 7.3（KL 的重参数化恒等式）</strong>：在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}},\\,\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)}\\left[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon,t)\\|^2\\right]+C_t, \\tag{7.7}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t=\\frac{d}{2}\\big(\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2-1-\\log(\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2)\\big)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (7.2)，外层期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取。用重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，由 (A2) 该变换的分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。代入 (7.3)，第一项由 (7.6) 给出；第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>。期望的线性性与 (A1) 保证各项可积，故等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7.3 表明：逐项 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的依赖完全集中在噪声预测的均方误差上，且每个时间步的权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。下一小节讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的选取如何影响该权重。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-方差选取与重参数化的相容性\">方差选取与重参数化的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-方差选取与重参数化的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节方差下界给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时 KL 有限且下界成立。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t=0$</span>，KL 退化为纯均方误差项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E\\left[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2\\right]. \\tag{7.8}$$</div>\n<p>若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>（前向方差），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t\\neq0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，不影响梯度。两种选取都与重参数化相容，因为 (7.7) 的推导只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 与 (A3)，未用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的具体关系。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.4（梯度恒等式）</strong>：在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta\\|$</span> 被可积函数控制，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta D_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E\\left[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta\\right]. \\tag{7.9}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 (7.7) 求梯度。被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 的常数倍，其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>。由控制收敛（Dominated Convergence）与 (A1) 的局部有界性，梯度与期望可交换。整理常数得 (7.9)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>式 (7.9) 是重参数化的直接产物：梯度只沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的雅可比传播，不出现对概率密度求导的 score-function 项。这解释了为什么扩散训练可以用简单的回归损失，而不需要 REINFORCE 型估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-具体例子-一维情形的手算验证\">具体例子：一维情形的手算验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-具体例子-一维情形的手算验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\cdot0.5\\approx0.9487+0.1581=1.1068$</span>。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，由 (7.5)：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.8}}\\left(x_2-\\frac{0.2}{\\sqrt{1-0.72}}\\epsilon\\right).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.28}\\cdot0.5\\approx0.8485+0.2646=1.1131$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-0.72}=\\sqrt{0.28}\\approx0.5292$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{1}{0.8944}\\left(1.1131-\\frac{0.2}{0.5292}\\cdot0.5\\right)=\\frac{1}{0.8944}(1.1131-0.1890)\\approx1.0335.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面由 (7.4) 直接算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.2}{0.28}\\cdot1+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot0.1}{0.28}\\cdot1.1131\\approx\\frac{0.1897}{0.28}+\\frac{0.0894}{0.28}\\cdot1.1131\\approx0.6775+0.3554=1.0329.$$</div>\n<p>两者在舍入误差内一致，验证了 (7.4) 与 (7.5) 的等价性。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=\\epsilon$</span>，则 (7.6) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_2-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=0$</span>，KL 第一项为零；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_2-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_2^2}{\\alpha_2(1-\\bar\\alpha_2)}\\|\\epsilon\\|^2=\\frac{0.04}{0.8\\cdot0.28}\\cdot0.25\\approx0.0446$</span>，与直接代入 (7.3) 的结果一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-代码-重参数化与-KL-的数值一致性\">代码：重参数化与 KL 的数值一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-代码-重参数化与-KL-的数值一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证 (7.1) 的分布恒等、(7.5) 的代数恒等，以及 (7.7) 与 (7.3) 的数值一致。代码可运行，含 <code>assert</code> 与形状打印。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# 参数\nd = 4\nT = 3\nbetas = np.array([0.1, 0.2, 0.3])\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = np.cumprod(alphas)\n\nx0 = rng.normal(size=d)\neps = rng.normal(size=d)\n\n# 前向采样 x_t = sqrt(alpha_bar_t) x0 + sqrt(1-alpha_bar_t) eps\ndef sample_xt(t, x0, eps):\n    return np.sqrt(alpha_bars[t-1]) * x0 + np.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[t-1]) * eps\n\n# (7.4) 后验均值\ndef tilde_mu_74(t, xt, x0):\n    ab_prev = alpha_bars[t-2] if t &gt;= 2 else 1.0\n    return (np.sqrt(ab_prev) * betas[t-1] / (1 - alpha_bars[t-1])) * x0 \\\n         + (np.sqrt(alphas[t-1]) * (1 - ab_prev) / (1 - alpha_bars[t-1])) * xt\n\n# (7.5) 等价形式\ndef tilde_mu_75(t, xt, eps):\n    return (1/np.sqrt(alphas[t-1])) * (xt - betas[t-1]/np.sqrt(1-alpha_bars[t-1]) * eps)\n\nfor t in range(1, T+1):\n    xt = sample_xt(t, x0, eps)\n    m74 = tilde_mu_74(t, xt, x0)\n    m75 = tilde_mu_75(t, xt, eps)\n    assert np.allclose(m74, m75, atol=1e-10), (t, m74, m75)\n    print(f&quot;t={t}, tilde_mu shape={m74.shape}, max|diff|={np.max(np.abs(m74-m75)):.2e}&quot;)\n\n# 重参数化分布恒等：用大量样本检验均值和协方差\nt = 2\nxt = sample_xt(t, x0, eps)\nab_prev = alpha_bars[t-2]\ntilde_beta = (1 - ab_prev)/(1 - alpha_bars[t-1]) * betas[t-1]\nm = tilde_mu_74(t, xt, x0)\nN = 200000\nZ = rng.normal(size=(N, d))\nsamples = m[None, :] + np.sqrt(tilde_beta) * Z\nassert np.allclose(samples.mean(axis=0), m, atol=0.02)\nassert np.allclose(np.cov(samples.T), tilde_beta*np.eye(d), atol=0.02)\nprint(f&quot;reparam sample shape={samples.shape}, mean err={np.max(np.abs(samples.mean(0)-m)):.3f}&quot;)\n\n# (7.7) 与 (7.3) 数值一致：固定 sigma_t^2 = tilde_beta_t\nsigma2 = tilde_beta\neps_theta = rng.normal(size=d)  # 任意预测\nmu_theta = (1/np.sqrt(alphas[t-1])) * (xt - betas[t-1]/np.sqrt(1-alpha_bars[t-1]) * eps_theta)\n\nkl_direct = 0.5 * (np.sum((m - mu_theta)**2)/sigma2\n                   + d*(tilde_beta/sigma2 - 1 - np.log(tilde_beta/sigma2)))\nkl_reparam = (betas[t-1]**2/(2*sigma2*alphas[t-1]*(1-alpha_bars[t-1]))) \\\n             * np.sum((eps - eps_theta)**2) \\\n             + 0.5*d*(tilde_beta/sigma2 - 1 - np.log(tilde_beta/sigma2))\nassert np.allclose(kl_direct, kl_reparam, atol=1e-10)\nprint(f&quot;KL direct={kl_direct:.6f}, reparam={kl_reparam:.6f}, shape scalar&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <code>max|diff|</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span> 量级；重参数样本均值误差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span>；KL 两式相等至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-重参数化与得分匹配的接口\">重参数化与得分匹配的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化与得分匹配的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只建立代数接口，得分匹配的完整推导留待后续节。由前序节，反向均值可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>。另一方面，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 由得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 参数化，则反向漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t+\\beta_t s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>。两者相等当且仅当</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t). \\tag{7.12}$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 7.6（噪声预测与得分的等价参数化）</strong>：在 (A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，反向高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的均值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 参数化与由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 参数化给出同一族分布，当且仅当 (7.12) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：反向均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的仿射函数。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的仿射函数，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数与常数项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>；常数项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}}\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}s_\\theta$</span>。令两者相等，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\epsilon_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=s_\\theta$</span>，即 (7.12)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7.6 说明重参数化后的回归目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 与得分匹配目标在代数上只差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有关的缩放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。这个因子正是后续“训练目标简化”节要处理的时间权重来源；本节只确认接口存在且符号自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-重参数化的可测性与独立性条件\">重参数化的可测性与独立性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化的可测性与独立性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>重参数化写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}Z$</span> 时，隐含要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 独立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，则边缘分布一般不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>。本小节把这一条件写成可检验的命题，并说明它在扩散链中为何成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.7（独立噪声的充分性）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span> 为概率空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X:(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\to(\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z:(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\to(\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d))$</span> 为随机向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 独立，则对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[f(\\tilde\\mu_t(X)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}Z)]=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(y)\\,\\mathcal N(y;\\tilde\\mu_t(X),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)\\,dy. \\tag{7.13}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由独立性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Z)$</span> 的联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P_X\\otimes\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}Z$</span> 的分布由命题 7.2 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 用 Fubini 定理（被积函数有界，条件满足）得 (7.13)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>在扩散链中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 可取为前向采样时使用的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的独立副本，或训练时每个 mini-batch 独立重采的噪声；它与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 及网络参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 均独立。因此 (7.13) 的条件在工程实现中自然满足。若实现中误把同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 跨时间步复用且不重采，则各时间步的 KL 估计相关，但期望仍无偏；这一点不影响本节恒等式，只影响方差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-一个反例边界-非高斯后验下的重参数化失效\">一个反例边界：非高斯后验下的重参数化失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-一个反例边界-非高斯后验下的重参数化失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有恒等式依赖后验为高斯。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 换成非高斯分布，重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}Z$</span> 一般不再给出正确边缘，命题 7.2 失效。完整构造留待第 10 节反例节；此处只指出失效机制：命题 7.2 的证明只用 (A2) 的仿射高斯封闭性，非高斯分布不满足该封闭性，故 (7.1) 的右端边缘分布与目标后验不同，进而 (7.7) 的 KL 恒等式不再成立。本节不展开该反例的数值细节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-重参数化的维度与坐标说明\">重参数化的维度与坐标说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化的维度与坐标说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节公式均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的標準坐标下写出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 对角矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 为标量。式 (7.3) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 欧氏范数平方，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 为自然对数。式 (7.6) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 为标量权重，作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 上。若数据为图像等多通道张量，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 取为展平后的总维数，所有公式逐元素成立；若需保留空间结构，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span> 换为各向同性协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为张量空间上的恒等算子，命题 7.2 与 7.3 的证明不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-重参数化下的时间步采样与无偏性\">重参数化下的时间步采样与无偏性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化下的时间步采样与无偏性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练时通常对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 均匀采样而非遍历全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步。本小节说明这种随机时间步采样不破坏 ELBO 的无偏性，并给出其与 (7.11) 的关系。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\epsilon)$</span> 独立。定义随机目标</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}(\\theta)=-\\,T\\cdot h_t(\\theta,\\epsilon), \\tag{7.17}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 由 (7.14) 给出，负号对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的下降方向。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.9（随机时间步的无偏性）</strong>：在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\epsilon}[\\tilde{\\mathcal L}(\\theta)]=-\\sum_{s=1}^T\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}[h_s(\\theta,\\epsilon)]. \\tag{7.18}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\epsilon)$</span> 独立，用 Fubini 定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_0,\\epsilon)$</span> 可积，由 (A1) 与高斯矩有限保证），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\epsilon}[\\tilde{\\mathcal L}]=\\frac{1}{T}\\sum_{s=1}^T\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}[-\\,T\\,h_s(\\theta,\\epsilon)]=-\\sum_{s=1}^T\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}[h_s(\\theta,\\epsilon)].$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>式 (7.18) 表明：随机抽取单个时间步并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 得到的目标，其期望恰为全部时间步 KL 之和的负值。因此用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span> 的随机梯度做下降，等价于对完整 ELBO 做无偏随机梯度下降。这里的关键仍是重参数化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度由命题 7.5 给出，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的随机性只影响求和顺序，不影响每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 的路径导数合法性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-重参数化在连续时间极限下的形式\">重参数化在连续时间极限下的形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化在连续时间极限下的形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只建立离散时间重参数化与连续时间重参数化之间的代数对应，完整连续时间 ELBO 留待后续节。设时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=1/N$</span>。离散前向方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_k}=\\Delta\\,\\beta(t_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\to\\exp(-\\int_0^{t_k}\\beta(s)\\,ds)$</span>。后验均值 (7.5) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 下的极限为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_{t_k}\\to x_{t_k}+\\beta(t_k)\\nabla_{x_{t_k}}\\log q(x_{t_k}\\mid x_0)\\,\\Delta, \\tag{7.19}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_{t_k}}\\log q(x_{t_k}\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>。式 (7.19) 的右端是反向 SDE 的漂移在离散网格上的欧拉步。重参数化在连续时间下的对应写法为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_k-\\Delta}=x_{t_k}+\\beta(t_k)\\nabla_{x_{t_k}}\\log q(x_{t_k}\\mid x_0)\\,\\Delta+\\sqrt{\\beta(t_k)\\Delta}\\,Z_k, \\tag{7.20}$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立。比较 (7.1) 与 (7.20)：离散重参数化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}Z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 下变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\beta(t_k)\\Delta}Z_k$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\Delta\\to\\beta(t_k)$</span>。这给出恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\Delta\\to0}\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_{t_k}}{\\Delta}=\\beta(t_k), \\tag{7.21}$$</div>\n<p>它把离散方差下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 翻译为连续时间条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)\\ge\\beta(t)$</span>。本小节只确认 (7.19)–(7.21) 的代数一致性，不展开连续时间 ELBO 的测度论细节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-重参数化的可微性与几乎处处意义\">重参数化的可微性与几乎处处意义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化的可微性与几乎处处意义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 7.5 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微。工程中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 为神经网络，通常仅几乎处处可微（如 ReLU 在零点不可微）。本小节说明这一弱化不破坏恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.10（几乎处处可微下的恒等式）</strong>：在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且几乎处处可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta\\|$</span> 被可积函数控制，则 (7.11) 在几乎处处意义下成立，即等式两端作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^p$</span> 上几乎处处相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：局部 Lipschitz 函数几乎处处可微，且其梯度与差商的极限几乎处处一致。由控制收敛定理，对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E[h_t]=\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta h_t]$</span> 成立；不可微点集为零测集，不影响几乎处处等式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和得 (7.11) 几乎处处成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题说明：即便 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 含 ReLU 等非光滑激活，只要梯度几乎处处存在且被控制，路径导数仍是合法估计量。工程实现中自动微分在不可微点选取任一子梯度，不影响几乎处处意义下的训练目标。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-重参数化与协方差参数化的区别\">重参数化与协方差参数化的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-重参数化与协方差参数化的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节固定反向协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>。若把协方差也参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，重参数化变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta+\\Sigma_\\theta^{1/2}Z$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta^{1/2}$</span> 为矩阵平方根。此时 (7.3) 的 KL 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\det\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\tilde\\beta_t\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1})$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度不再只经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。本小节只指出：本节所有恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span> 下成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，命题 7.3 的常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数，训练目标简化节需另行处理。本节不展开该情形，以保持符号与本章 canonical claims 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>重参数化把后验与反向高斯的随机性隔离为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的标准高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 成为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的确定性函数加外生噪声；命题 7.2 证明该变换不改变分布。</li>\n<li>命题 7.3 给出逐项 KL 的重参数化恒等式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的依赖只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 出现，权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</li>\n<li>推论 7.4 说明梯度只沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的雅可比传播，不出现 score-function 项；这为后续训练目标简化提供了代数依据，且与方差下界的任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 选取相容。</li>\n<li>推论 7.4 与命题 7.5 说明梯度只沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的雅可比传播，不出现 score-function 项；命题 7.6 给出噪声预测与得分参数的代数等价 (7.12)，命题 7.7 给出独立噪声下重参数化边缘分布的充分条件。</li>\n<li>推论 7.4 与命题 7.5 说明梯度只沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的雅可比传播，不出现 score-function 项；命题 7.6 给出噪声预测与得分参数的代数等价 (7.12)，命题 7.7 给出独立噪声下重参数化边缘分布的充分条件；命题 7.8–7.10 进一步给出路径导数的方差上界、随机时间步的无偏性、连续时间极限下的方差对应，以及几乎处处可微下的恒等式合法性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-训练目标的简化\">训练目标的简化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-训练目标的简化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>；变分下界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅一个：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>，定义见下文（式 (8.6)）。维度约定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 单位阵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的欧氏范数平方。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条在命题中引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 均为 Borel 可测；且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 高斯参数化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数（本节简化目标固定方差，见命题 8.3 的注）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 前向方差非退化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 正则性用于交换期望与梯度</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_\\theta\\mu_\\theta\\|$</span> 被一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-可积函数控制（Leibniz 积分法则的条件）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（逐项 KL 的显式形式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right]\n=-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且该 KL 等于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2\\big]+\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　两高斯分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\sigma_1^2 I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\sigma_2^2 I)$</span> 的 KL 闭式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_2^2}\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{\\sigma_1^2}+\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}-1)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_2=\\mu_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\sigma_t^2$</span> 即得。期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span> 的联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取，由 (A1) 保证可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.1 说明：ELBO 中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项在固定方差参数化下，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可学习部分<strong>只</strong>经由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 进入，第二项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。这正是简化的起点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.2（后验均值重参数化恒等式）</strong>　在 (A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\epsilon\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由前向边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 与贝叶斯公式，后验均值满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 代入，合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.3（训练目标简化的主定理）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>（即与后验方差同阶的常数），则 ELBO 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right]\n=-\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}},$$</div>\n<p>其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\Big[\\Big\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon,\\,t\\big)\\Big\\|^2\\Big],\n\\tag{8.6}$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由命题 8.1，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_q[\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2]$</span>。由 (A4) 与 Leibniz 积分法则（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_\\theta\\mu_\\theta\\|$</span> 可积），梯度可移入期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E_q[(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta)^\\top\\partial_\\theta\\mu_\\theta]$</span>。由命题 8.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon)$</span>（代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的参数化后逐项相消）。于是梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\mathbb E_q\\big[(\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon)^\\top\\partial_\\theta\\mu_\\theta\\big].$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\mu_\\theta=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\partial_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，上式化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E[\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2]$</span> 的链式结果（因子 2 来自平方）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和即得 (8.6) 的梯度恒等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（方差选择与方差下界的关系）</strong>　命题 8.3 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 是<strong>目标简化</strong>，不是 ELBO 的最优方差。第 6 节已证 ELBO 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 给出；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\neq\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，(8.6) 与真实 ELBO 相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数（命题 8.1 第二项），故<strong>梯度相同、目标值不同</strong>。这正是本节标题“训练目标的简化”的精确含义：简化的是可学习部分，不是 ELBO 数值本身。禁止把二者混为一谈。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.4（可检验恒等式：简化目标与 KL 的数值一致性）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\n=\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\mathbb E\\big[\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2\\big]+\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}-1\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　将命题 8.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta$</span> 表达式代入命题 8.1 的第一项，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E[\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2]$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\cdot$</span>（此处用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 展开）可验证系数化简为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span>。第二项即命题 8.1 的常数项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.4 给出一个<strong>可数值检验的恒等式</strong>：左侧用高斯 KL 闭式直接算，右侧用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 参数化算，二者应逐位相等（至浮点误差）。第 14 节的代码验证即基于此。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的闭式核对）</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=\\beta_1=0.1$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\cdot0.5\\approx1.1068$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=0.4$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.9}}(x_1-\\frac{0.1}{\\sqrt{0.1}}\\cdot0.4)\\approx\\frac{1}{0.9487}(1.1068-0.1265)\\approx1.0334$</span>。后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_1=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.9}}(x_1-\\frac{0.1}{\\sqrt{0.1}}\\cdot0.5)\\approx\\frac{1}{0.9487}(1.1068-0.1581)\\approx1.0001$</span>。命题 8.4 右侧：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\cdot0.1}(0.5-0.4)^2+\\frac{1}{2}(\\log1+1-1)=0.05$</span>；左侧：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\cdot0.1}(1.0001-1.0334)^2+0=0.0055$</span>。二者不等，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span> 时第二项为零，但第一项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 相同，差异来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{0.1}{\\sqrt{0.9}\\sqrt{0.1}}\\approx0.333$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 的平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{0.01}{0.09}=0.111$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}=5$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.555$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}=5$</span> 不同。<strong>该例说明命题 8.4 的系数化简需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\beta_t$</span> 同时成立，而后者一般不成立</strong>；因此命题 8.4 的恒等式应保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 因子，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E[\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2]+\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}-1\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>这正是本节要强调的：<strong>简化目标 (8.6) 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span> 是重参数化后的习惯写法，它与真实 KL 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 只差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的因子，故梯度方向一致、目标值有偏</strong>。第 10 节的反例将量化这一偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.5（简化目标的梯度无偏性，在固定方差下）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与 ELBO 梯度<strong>逐项成比例</strong>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项比例因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\big/\\frac{1}{\\beta_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由命题 8.4 的修正系数与命题 8.3 的梯度计算直接比较即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.5 是本节的核心可检验推论：<strong>比例因子与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关</strong>，故用 (8.6) 做梯度下降与用真实 ELBO 做梯度下降的轨迹在重标时间后相同；但若各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的比例因子不同（一般如此），则<strong>时间权重被扭曲</strong>，这正是第 10 节反例的主题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef posterior_mean(x_t, x_0, alpha_bar_t, alpha_t, beta_t):\n    # 命题 8.2 的两种等价写法\n    eps = (x_t - alpha_bar_t.sqrt() * x_0) / (1 - alpha_bar_t).sqrt()\n    return (x_t - beta_t / (1 - alpha_bar_t).sqrt() * eps) / alpha_t.sqrt()\n\ndef kl_gaussian(m1, s1, m2, s2, d):\n    return 0.5 / s2 * ((m1 - m2) ** 2).sum(-1) + 0.5 * d * (\n        torch.log(torch.tensor(s2 / s1)) + s1 / s2 - 1\n    )\n\nd, T = 4, 3\nbeta = torch.tensor([0.1, 0.2, 0.3])\nalpha = 1 - beta\nalpha_bar = torch.cumprod(alpha, dim=0)\nx0 = torch.randn(d)\neps = torch.randn(d)\nxt = alpha_bar[-1].sqrt() * x0 + (1 - alpha_bar[-1]).sqrt() * eps\neps_theta = 0.3 * eps  # 任意可微参数化的占位\n\nt = T - 1\nmu_post = posterior_mean(xt, x0, alpha_bar[t], alpha[t], beta[t])\nmu_theta = (xt - beta[t] / (1 - alpha_bar[t]).sqrt() * eps_theta) / alpha[t].sqrt()\ntilde_beta = (1 - alpha_bar[t - 1]) / (1 - alpha_bar[t]) * beta[t]\n\nkl_direct = kl_gaussian(mu_post, tilde_beta, mu_theta, beta[t], d)\nkl_reparam = beta[t] / (2 * alpha[t] * (1 - alpha_bar[t])) * ((eps - eps_theta) ** 2).sum() \\\n    + 0.5 * d * (torch.log(beta[t] / tilde_beta) + tilde_beta / beta[t] - 1)\n\nassert torch.allclose(kl_direct, kl_reparam, atol=1e-5), (kl_direct, kl_reparam)\nprint(&quot;KL direct:&quot;, kl_direct.item())\nprint(&quot;KL reparam:&quot;, kl_reparam.item())\nprint(&quot;shape check:&quot;, kl_direct.shape, &quot;expected: torch.Size([])&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-简化目标的方差选择与-ELBO-数值偏差的显式刻画\">简化目标的方差选择与 ELBO 数值偏差的显式刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-简化目标的方差选择与-ELBO-数值偏差的显式刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8.5 只断言了<strong>梯度方向</strong>的比例关系，未给出目标值偏差的量。为使“简化”一词在数值上可核验，本节给出偏差的显式分解。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，记真实逐项 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span>，简化目标第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>（即 (8.6) 中被加数）。由命题 8.4 的修正系数，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\mathbb E\\big[\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2\\big]+\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}-1\\Big).\n\\tag{8.7}$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 8.6（偏差分解）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t:=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=c_t\\,\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+C_t,\\qquad\nC_t:=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}-1\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t\\ge 0$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 亦与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　式 (8.7) 的第一项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的定义直接改写即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t\\ge0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u+1/u-1\\ge0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>，等号仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span>）取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.6 的要点是：<strong>简化目标与真实 KL 之间是逐项的仿射关系</strong>，斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 与截距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 均不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。因此对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\sum_t c_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+\\sum_t C_t$</span>。若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 相等，则最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span> 等价；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，则二者不等价——这正是第 10 节反例要量化的“时间权重扭曲”。本节只建立恒等式，不展开反例。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 的单调性）</strong>　在 (A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 未必单调；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta$</span> 为常数时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\dfrac{\\beta^2}{(1-\\beta)(1-(1-\\beta)^t)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格单调递减。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta)^t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-(1-\\beta)^t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递增，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 严格递减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 8.7 说明：即便在最简单的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 情形，简化目标的逐项权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 也随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 衰减，而 (8.6) 对各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 用同一系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta}$</span>，故<strong>早期时间步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）在真实 ELBO 中权重更大，在简化目标中被低估</strong>。这是“忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”的数学根源，其定量版本留待第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-简化目标的可微性与重参数化梯度的合法性\">简化目标的可微性与重参数化梯度的合法性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-简化目标的可微性与重参数化梯度的合法性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(A4) 只保证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可微性与控制，尚未保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的梯度可交换期望。本节补足这一环，因为 (8.6) 的实用价值依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E[\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2]=\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.8（重参数化梯度的交换条件）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-可积的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x_0,\\epsilon)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon,t)\\|\\le g(x_0,\\epsilon)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立。则在 (A1)–(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\big[\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon,t)\\|^2\\big]\n=\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(\\theta,x_0,\\epsilon)=\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)\\|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta)^\\top\\partial_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\|\\epsilon\\|+\\sup_\\theta\\|\\epsilon_\\theta\\|)g$</span> 控制；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的高斯性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon\\|&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 可积，控制函数可积。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\theta,x_0,\\epsilon)$</span> 应用 Leibniz 积分法则（测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I)\\otimes q(x_0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-有限），得交换合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.8 与命题 8.3 合起来给出完整链条：真实 ELBO 梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span>（命题 8.3）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 简化目标梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span>（命题 8.8）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 可用的蒙特卡洛梯度。三步中每一步的假设都已显式列出，无一步依赖“适当条件”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-一个可手算的恒等式核验\">一个可手算的恒等式核验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-一个可手算的恒等式核验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.25$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=\\frac{0}{0.5}\\cdot0.5$</span> 需约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 时分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此约定下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1$</span> 退化；故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的例子从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 取。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.5}{0.75}\\cdot0.5=\\frac13$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.25}\\cdot0+\\sqrt{0.75}\\cdot1=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.5}}(\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}-\\frac{0.5}{\\sqrt{0.75}}\\cdot0)=\\sqrt2\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}=\\sqrt{1.5}$</span>。后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.5}}(\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}-\\frac{0.5}{\\sqrt{0.75}}\\cdot1)=\\sqrt2(\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt3})=\\sqrt2\\cdot\\frac{3-2}{2\\sqrt3}=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2\\sqrt3}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt6}$</span>。命题 8.6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=\\frac{0.25}{0.5\\cdot0.75}=\\frac23$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_2^{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac{1}{2\\cdot0.5}(1-0)^2=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2\\mathcal L_2^{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac23$</span>。直接算 KL 第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_2}(\\tilde\\mu_2-\\mu_\\theta)^2=\\frac{3}{2}(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt6}-\\sqrt{1.5})^2=\\frac32(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt6}-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt6})^2=\\frac32\\cdot\\frac{4}{6}=1$</span>。<strong>二者不等</strong>，因为命题 8.6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 对应的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span> 系数，而直接 KL 用的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\neq\\beta_t$</span> 时，命题 8.4 的恒等式须用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span>。本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{0.5}{2\\cdot0.5\\cdot0.75}=\\frac23=c_2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_2}=\\frac32$</span> 不同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2\\mathcal L_2^{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac23$</span> 与直接 KL 第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的差异恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_2}-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac32-\\frac23=\\frac56$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\mu_2-\\mu_\\theta)^2=\\frac{4}{6}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{5}{9}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\frac23=\\frac13$</span> 不符——<strong>该手算暴露了一个必需要精确表述的系数</strong>：直接 KL 的第一项系数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>，而命题 8.4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 误差系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时才与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 一致；本节 (8.6) 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，故命题 8.4 的恒等式应写作</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E[\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2]+\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}-1\\Big)$$</div>\n<p><strong>仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t$</span> 时</strong>才与命题 8.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 形式吻合。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\neq\\beta_t$</span>，故命题 8.1 的第一项系数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 参数化后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，故真实 KL 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 误差系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，<strong>不是</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。命题 8.4 与命题 8.6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 应据此更正为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t\\,\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\Big/\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)},$$</div>\n<p>化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。代入本例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{0.25}{(1/3)\\cdot0.5\\cdot0.75}=\\frac{0.25}{0.125}=2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2\\mathcal L_2^{\\mathrm{simple}}=2\\cdot1=2$</span>，仍与直接 KL 第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 不符——差异源于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_2^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span> 而真实 KL 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>，二者之比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}=\\frac23$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 应再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}$</span> 才对齐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span> 的写法。最终对齐 (8.6) 系数的比例因子为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>本例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{0.5}{0.5\\cdot0.75}=\\frac43$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac43\\cdot1=\\frac43\\neq1$</span>。<strong>手算表明：命题 8.4、8.6 的系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\neq\\beta_t$</span> 时须以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 为基准重写，本节 (8.6) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span> 只是习惯写法，其与真实 KL 的比例因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span></strong>。该比例因子与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故命题 8.5 的“梯度方向一致”结论不变，但目标值偏差的定量表达式须用此因子。第 10 节反例将以此因子为准。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-简化目标作为-ELBO-的替代-何时等价\">简化目标作为 ELBO 的替代：何时等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-简化目标作为-ELBO-的替代-何时等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8.9（等价性判据）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\min_\\theta\\sum_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\min_\\theta\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span> 相同，当且仅当所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的比例因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t:=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 相等。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由命题 8.6 更正后的仿射关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\rho_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+C_t$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\sum_t\\rho_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+\\sum_t C_t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\equiv\\rho$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\rho\\sum_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+\\sum_t C_t$</span>，两目标仅差正常数与正比例，argmin 相同。反之若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1,t_2$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{t_1}\\neq\\rho_{t_2}$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t_1}^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 减小而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t_2}^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 增大，可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的排序相反，故 argmin 不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.9 把“简化是否合法”化归为一个纯代数判据：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 是否为常数。对常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t=\\frac{\\beta^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t(1-\\beta)(1-(1-\\beta)^t)}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}{1-(1-\\beta)^t}\\beta$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t=\\frac{\\beta}{(1-\\beta)(1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1})}$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减，故<strong>常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 下简化目标与真实 ELBO 的 argmin 一般不同</strong>。这解释了为何 (8.6) 只是“训练目标的简化”而非“ELBO 的等价重写”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-简化目标的方差选择-为何-sigma_t-2-beta_t-而非-tilde-beta_t\">简化目标的方差选择：为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-简化目标的方差选择-为何-sigma_t-2-beta_t-而非-tilde-beta_t\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8.9 的等价性判据以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 为前提。若改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则比例因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 是否恒为常数？本节回答这一问题，因为它决定了“简化”一词在方差维度上的自由度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.10（最优方差下的比例因子）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。则逐项 KL 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 误差系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，且比例因子</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_t^{\\ast}:=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$$</div>\n<p>在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 下仍随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由命题 8.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时第一项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>；由命题 8.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 误差系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^{\\ast}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}{1-(1-\\beta)^t}\\beta$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^{\\ast}=\\frac{\\beta^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t^2(1-\\beta)(1-(1-\\beta)^t)}=\\frac{(1-(1-\\beta)^t)^2}{(1-\\beta)^{2t-1}(1-\\beta)(1-(1-\\beta)^t)}=\\frac{1-(1-\\beta)^t}{(1-\\beta)^{2t}(1-\\beta)^{-1}}$</span>，化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^{\\ast}=\\frac{1-(1-\\beta)^t}{(1-\\beta)^{2t-1}}$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.10 说明：<strong>无论取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 还是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，比例因子都随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化</strong>，故简化目标与真实 ELBO 的 argmin 在两种方差下均一般不同。方差选择只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 的单调方向（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 时递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时递增），不改变“不等价”这一结论。这排除了“换一个方差就能让简化目标等价于 ELBO”的可能性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-简化目标的时间加权形式与重标时间\">简化目标的时间加权形式与重标时间<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-简化目标的时间加权形式与重标时间\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8.9 的判据可改写为对时间权重的陈述。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\sum_t\\rho_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+\\sum_t C_t$</span> 两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_1&gt;0$</span>，由 (A3)），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\rho_1}\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\sum_t\\frac{\\rho_t}{\\rho_1}\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+\\frac{1}{\\rho_1}\\sum_t C_t.\n\\tag{8.8}$$</div>\n<p>式 (8.8) 表明：真实 ELBO（至仿射变换）等价于对简化目标的逐项施加权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t:=\\rho_t/\\rho_1$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\equiv1$</span>，则简化目标无偏；否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 刻画了“忽略时间权重”造成的偏差。对常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>，由命题 8.9 的计算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{1-(1-\\beta)}{1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}\\cdot\\frac{1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}{1-(1-\\beta)}$</span> 需以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t=\\frac{\\beta}{(1-\\beta)(1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1})}$</span> 代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\rho_t}{\\rho_1}=\\frac{1-(1-\\beta)}{1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}=\\frac{\\beta}{1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_1$</span> 退化，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的定义从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 起有效；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta}{1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to\\beta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>）。<strong>即：真实 ELBO 对早期时间步赋予更大权重（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=\\beta/(1-(1-\\beta))=\\beta/\\beta=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3=\\beta/(1-(1-\\beta)^2)&lt;1$</span>），简化目标则对各步一视同仁</strong>。这正是第 10 节反例的定量基础：用 (8.6) 训练等价于用权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 扭曲后的 ELBO 训练，扭曲程度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 共同决定。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.11（重标时间下的梯度流等价）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(\\tau)$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\theta=-\\nabla_\\theta\\sum_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 演化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\theta(\\tau)$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\tilde\\theta}=-\\nabla_{\\tilde\\theta}\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span> 演化，初值相同。则存在严格递增的重标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto s(\\tau)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(\\tau)=\\tilde\\theta(s(\\tau))$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立，当且仅当所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 相等。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由命题 8.9 更正后的仿射关系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\sum_t\\rho_t\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\equiv\\rho$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\sum_t D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\rho\\nabla_\\theta\\sum_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>，两梯度场仅差常数倍，故轨迹在时间重标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(\\tau)=\\rho\\tau$</span> 下重合。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 不全相等，则两梯度场在一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处不平行（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 方向不同即可），轨迹分离。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 8.11 把命题 8.9 的 argmin 判据强化为<strong>轨迹判据</strong>：不仅终点不同，整条优化路径都不同。这排除了“虽然 argmin 不同但优化过程近似相同”的模糊说法——在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 不全相等时，两条梯度流在有限时间内即分离。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-简化目标的蒙特卡洛估计与其无偏性\">简化目标的蒙特卡洛估计与其无偏性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-简化目标的蒙特卡洛估计与其无偏性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(8.6) 的实用形式是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 采样后取平均。本节给出该估计的无偏性与方差，因它是“可运行代码”一节的理论依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.12（蒙特卡洛估计的无偏性）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_0^{(i)},\\epsilon^{(i)}\\}_{i=1}^n$</span> 独立同分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{(i)}\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^{(i)}\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^n\\sum_{t=1}^T\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\Big\\|\\epsilon^{(i)}-\\epsilon_\\theta\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0^{(i)}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon^{(i)},t\\big)\\Big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}}]=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}})=\\frac{1}{n}\\mathrm{Var}(\\sum_t\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 与重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，被加数的期望等于 (8.6) 中对应项（Fubini，由 (A1) 可积性保证）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和取期望得无偏性。方差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的独立性与标准方差公式得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.12 的要点是：<strong>无偏性只依赖重参数化与 Fubini，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 是否为常数</strong>。因此简化目标的蒙特卡洛梯度是无偏的（对简化目标本身），但<strong>对真实 ELBO 有偏</strong>——偏差正是命题 8.6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 因子。这与“把目标值相等当成梯度相等”的禁止事项一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的无偏性不能推出它对 ELBO 的无偏性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.13（梯度估计的方差上界）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 与命题 8.8 的控制条件下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2\\le M$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}}\\big)\\le\\frac{4M}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^T\\frac{1}{\\beta_t^2}\\mathbb E\\big[\\|\\partial_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　单样本梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\frac{1}{\\beta_t}(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta)^\\top\\partial_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2\\le2(\\|\\epsilon\\|^2+M)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon\\|^2=d$</span>，逐项用 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 控制，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的独立性得方差上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.13 给出一个可检验的推论：方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\beta_t^{-2}$</span> 增长，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 很小时早期时间步的梯度估计方差爆炸——这正是实践中需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 均匀采样而非按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 顺序累加的原因。该推论与本节主题“训练目标的简化”相接：简化目标把各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的系数统一为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span>，使方差结构显式可算，从而支持第 13 节的数值实现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-简化目标与逐项-KL-的数值核验流程\">简化目标与逐项 KL 的数值核验流程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-简化目标与逐项-KL-的数值核验流程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使命题 8.4、8.6、8.9 在代码层面可核验，本节给出一个不依赖具体数据的三步流程，作为第 14 节代码验证的规范。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤一（闭式 KL）</strong>：对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\epsilon,\\theta$</span>，按命题 8.1 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t,\\mu_\\theta,\\sigma_t^2$</span> 直接算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤二（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 参数化）</strong>：按命题 8.2 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon)$</span>，按命题 8.4 更正后的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 算同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span>，应与步骤一逐位相等（至浮点误差）。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤三（简化目标）</strong>：按 (8.6) 算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>，再按命题 8.6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 重构 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\rho_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+C_t$</span>，应与步骤一相等。</p>\n<p>三步中任一步不等即说明系数写错。该流程的数学依据是命题 8.4 的恒等式与命题 8.6 的仿射分解；其代码实现见第 14 节，本节只固定核验规范，不重复代码。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在固定方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 的高斯参数化下，ELBO 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可学习部分只经由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 进入；由命题 8.2 的重参数化恒等式，它等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 预测误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 的加权期望。</li>\n<li>训练目标简化 (8.6) 与真实逐项 KL 的差别仅在<strong>系数</strong>：真实 KL 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 误差系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，而 (8.6) 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span>；二者之比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故梯度方向一致，但<strong>目标值有偏、时间权重被扭曲</strong>（第 10 节反例量化）。</li>\n<li>命题 8.4 给出可数值检验的 KL 恒等式，命题 8.5 给出梯度比例因子；二者共同构成本节“简化”一词的精确数学内容：简化的是可学习部分的系数写法，不是 ELBO 的数值本身，更不是把目标值相等当成梯度相等。</li>\n<li>简化目标 (8.6) 与真实逐项 KL 之间是逐项仿射关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\rho_t\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{simple}}+C_t$</span>，比例因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 与截距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 均不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>；命题 8.9 给出二者 argmin 相同的充要条件是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 相等。</li>\n<li>命题 8.8 补足了重参数化梯度交换期望的合法性条件（控制函数可积 + Leibniz），使命题 8.3 的梯度恒等式在蒙特卡洛实现中可用；三步链条的假设均已显式列出。</li>\n<li>手算例（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1,T=2,\\beta=0.5$</span>）表明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\neq\\beta_t$</span> 时，命题 8.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 系数与 (8.6) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}$</span> 系数不可混用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 须以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 为基准重写；该例同时验证了命题 8.9 的判据在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 下给出“不等价”的结论。</li>\n<li>命题 8.10 证明：无论取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 还是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，比例因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 都随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，故“换方差使简化目标等价于 ELBO”不可行；方差选择只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 的单调方向。</li>\n<li>式 (8.8) 与推论 8.11 把简化目标的偏差表述为时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\rho_t/\\rho_1$</span> 的扭曲与梯度流的分离：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 不全相等时，两条优化轨迹在有限时间内即分离，不仅是 argmin 不同。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-与得分匹配的关系\">与得分匹配的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-与得分匹配的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号，不引入新的随机过程对象。为避免歧义，先把本节用到的量列成符号表，并写明它们在前序节中的定义式。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前向过程：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。</li>\n<li>后验：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t .$$</div></li>\n<li>得分函数：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=\\nabla_x\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时的条件得分，以及边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta(x_t)$</span>。本节只讨论条件得分与训练目标之间的关系，边缘得分出现在第 15 节接口处，不在本节展开。</li>\n<li>噪声预测网络：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，满足参数化\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 是网络输出的得分估计。此式是本节的核心定义，它把“预测噪声”与“估计得分”视为同一对象在两种坐标下的表示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，每条都在后续命题中显式引用。</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续，密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上处处为正且连续可微。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\|\\nabla_x\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 训练目标中的期望与梯度交换合法：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的可积控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x_t)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2\\|\\le g(x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[g]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A4) 时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 由前序节“训练目标的简化”给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 是第 6 节方差下界所选的后验方差。本节不重新推导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，只使用其闭式。</p>\n<p>(A1)–(A3) 在本节情境下成立的理由：扩散模型的前向核是高斯核，其密度处处为正且光滑，故 (A1) 自动成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取值于紧支撑或具有有限二阶矩的数据分布时，(A2) 由高斯密度的对数梯度线性增长性得到；(A3) 是工程实现中网络光滑且参数有界的标准假设，若网络含非 Lipschitz 激活则需额外截断，这一点在第 10 节反例节处理。</p>\n<p>本节要证明的核心命题是：在第 7 节重参数化与第 8 节训练目标简化的基础上，逐时间步 KL 的梯度与去噪得分匹配目标（denoising score matching）的梯度在期望意义下相等。这不是“目标值相等”，而是“梯度相等”，二者区别必须显式写出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-1-逐时间步-KL-的得分形式\">1. 逐时间步 KL 的得分形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-1-逐时间步-KL-的得分形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由第 3 节，逐时间步 KL 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n由第 5 节高斯后验闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 的高斯。由第 7 节重参数化，可写\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,\\xi,\\qquad \\xi\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I).$$</div>\n模型侧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 也取高斯，其均值由网络给出。第 8 节已把模型均值参数化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\Big),$$</div>\n方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>。于是两个高斯的 KL 有闭式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\right]+C_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t=\\frac d2\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{d\\tilde\\beta_t}{2\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac d2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。这一步只用高斯 KL 的标准闭式，不涉及新假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-2-主定理-KL-梯度等于得分匹配梯度\">2. 主定理：KL 梯度等于得分匹配梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-2-主定理-KL-梯度等于得分匹配梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（KL 梯度与得分匹配梯度的恒等）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\big\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\big\\|^2\\Big]\\text{ 的梯度},$$</div>\n更精确地，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big(w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\big]\\Big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 是前向过程在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时的标准化噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 如 (A4)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分三步。</p>\n<p>第一步，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta$</span> 写成噪声差。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon_t$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的闭式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_t\\Big).$$</div>\n这是第 5 节已证的恒等式，此处直接引用。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\big).$$</div>\n取范数平方：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\|^2.$$</div>\n代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 的闭式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\right]+C_t.$$</div>\n括号内系数正是 (A4) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\big]+C_t.$$</div></p>\n<p>第二步，验证期望与梯度交换。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\|$</span> 被可积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|\\,\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta\\|$</span> 控制，而 (A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t$</span> 平方可积，故控制函数可积。由 Dominated Convergence 定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E=\\mathbb E\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，梯度为零。</p>\n<p>第三步，合并。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 求梯度得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\big]=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big(w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\big]\\Big).$$</div>\n命题得证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2.1 的要点是：它给出的是<strong>梯度恒等</strong>，而非目标值恒等。目标值相差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>，但常数不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故梯度相同。这一点在第 10 节反例节会用来构造“忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”的反例：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 误设为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关的常数，则梯度不再与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 的梯度相等，优化轨迹偏离 ELBO 的下降方向。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-3-得分匹配的等价表述\">3. 得分匹配的等价表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-3-得分匹配的等价表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3.1（得分形式的得分匹配）</strong> 在命题 2.1 的条件下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big(w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s_t(x_t)\\|^2\\big]\\Big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\epsilon_t/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|s_\\theta-s_t\\|^2.$$</div>\n代入命题 2.1 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3.1 说明：噪声预测目标与得分匹配目标只差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，因此二者的梯度方向一致。这正是“与得分匹配的关系”的精确表述：逐时间步 KL 的梯度，等于带时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 的条件得分匹配梯度。注意这里用的是<strong>条件</strong>得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)=\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，不是边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span>；二者关系由 Tweedie 公式给出，属于第 15 节接口内容，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-4-具体例子-d-1-单步验证\">4. 具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、单步验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-4-具体例子-d-1-单步验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_1,1)=0.2$</span>，前向采样得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_1=0.5$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\cdot0.5$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1=0.1$</span>。</p>\n<p>由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的非常数部分为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_1\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_1\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_1^2}{2\\sigma_1^2\\alpha_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)}(0.2-0.5)^2=\\frac{0.01}{2\\cdot0.1\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.1}\\cdot0.09=0.05.$$</div>\n直接由 KL 闭式验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_1-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.9}}\\frac{0.1}{\\sqrt{0.1}}(0.2-0.5)$</span>，平方除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sigma_1^2=0.2$</span> 得同一数值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>。两者一致，验证了第一步的恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-5-代码-梯度恒等的数值验证\">5. 代码：梯度恒等的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-5-代码-梯度恒等的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 上验证命题 2.1：分别计算 KL 闭式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度与加权得分匹配目标对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度，断言二者相等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd, beta1 = 1, 0.1\nalpha1 = 1.0 - beta1\nab1 = alpha1\nsigma1_sq = beta1  # 取方差下界\nw1 = beta1**2 / (2.0 * sigma1_sq * alpha1 * (1.0 - ab1))\n\nx0 = torch.tensor([1.0])\neps1 = torch.tensor([0.5])\nx1 = torch.sqrt(torch.tensor(ab1)) * x0 + torch.sqrt(torch.tensor(1.0 - ab1)) * eps1\n\ntheta = torch.tensor([0.2], requires_grad=True)\n\n# KL 闭式：非常数部分\nmu_tilde = (1.0/torch.sqrt(torch.tensor(alpha1))) * (x1 - beta1/torch.sqrt(torch.tensor(1.0-ab1)) * eps1)\nmu_theta = (1.0/torch.sqrt(torch.tensor(alpha1))) * (x1 - beta1/torch.sqrt(torch.tensor(1.0-ab1)) * theta)\nkl = ((mu_tilde - mu_theta)**2 / (2.0*sigma1_sq)).sum()\ng_kl = torch.autograd.grad(kl, theta)[0]\n\n# 加权得分匹配\nsm = w1 * ((theta - eps1)**2).sum()\ng_sm = torch.autograd.grad(sm, theta)[0]\n\nprint(&quot;x1 shape:&quot;, x1.shape, &quot;kl:&quot;, kl.item(), &quot;sm:&quot;, sm.item())\nprint(&quot;g_kl:&quot;, g_kl.item(), &quot;g_sm:&quot;, g_sm.item())\nassert torch.allclose(g_kl, g_sm, atol=1e-6), &quot;梯度恒等失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 2.1 数值验证通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>kl</code> 与 <code>sm</code> 数值相等（均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>），<code>g_kl</code> 与 <code>g_sm</code> 相等，断言通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-与相邻概念的区别\">6. 与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>必须把三个容易混淆的对象分开。(i) <strong>条件得分匹配</strong>：目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s_t(x_t)\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件得分，期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取。(ii) <strong>边缘得分匹配</strong>：目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span>，期望对边缘分布取，二者由 Tweedie 公式联系但不相等。(iii) <strong>KL 梯度</strong>：命题 2.1 证明的是 (i) 与逐时间步 KL 梯度的恒等，不是 (ii) 与 KL 的恒等。把 (ii) 当成 KL 梯度是常见错误，第 10 节反例节会给出边缘得分误用导致偏差的构造。本节只建立 (i) 与 KL 的恒等，边缘得分接口留给第 15 节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>逐时间步 KL 的非常数部分可闭式写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，这一步只用高斯 KL 闭式与第 5 节后验均值恒等式。</li>\n<li>命题 2.1 证明的是<strong>梯度恒等</strong>而非目标值恒等：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=\\nabla_\\theta(w_t\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2)$</span>，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 不贡献梯度；推论 3.1 把它翻译成条件得分匹配形式，权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。</li>\n<li>条件得分匹配、边缘得分匹配与 KL 梯度是三个不同对象；本节只建立条件得分匹配与 KL 梯度的恒等，边缘得分接口在第 15 节处理，误用边缘得分会在第 10 节反例节给出偏差构造。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-7-时间权重与得分匹配权重的相容性\">7. 时间权重与得分匹配权重的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-7-时间权重与得分匹配权重的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2.1 把逐时间步 KL 的梯度写成加权条件得分匹配的梯度，但权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 由第 6 节方差下界选定。本节必须说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 取方差下界时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与得分匹配权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 的乘积是否仍与 ELBO 的梯度严格相容。这不是新假设，而是对 (A4) 的检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（权重相容性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)=\\frac{\\beta_1}{2\\alpha_1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 直接代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n再把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 代入分母，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div>\n命题得证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7.1 的作用是：它把推论 3.1 中的复合权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 化为只含前向调度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t,\\alpha_t,\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的闭式，不再显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>。这意味着当方差取下界时，条件得分匹配的权重完全由前向过程决定，与网络参数化无关。这一点在第 8 节训练目标简化中已被隐式使用，本节把它显式化为可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-8-得分匹配目标对-x_0-的边缘化\">8. 得分匹配目标对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的边缘化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-8-得分匹配目标对-x_0-的边缘化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2.1 的期望是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取的，而实际训练中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 来自数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>。必须把两层期望合并，否则梯度恒等只在单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 上成立，不构成对 ELBO 整体的陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.1（双层期望的合并）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，记数据分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big(w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\big]\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=w_t\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}$</span>。交换两层期望与梯度需 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 各一次。Fubini 的条件是联合可积：由 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 可积；Dominated Convergence 的条件与命题 2.1 第二步相同，控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 一致可积。两次交换合法，结论成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 8.1 的意义是：训练时从数据分布抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、再从前向核抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，所得梯度的期望恰是 ELBO 逐时间步梯度的期望。这是“训练目标简化”一节所述采样流程的数学依据，本节把它写成显式的双层期望恒等式，避免把“对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 平均”当作默认操作而不加验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-9-得分匹配梯度与-ELBO-全梯度的拼接\">9. 得分匹配梯度与 ELBO 全梯度的拼接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-9-得分匹配梯度与-ELBO-全梯度的拼接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节把 ELBO 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T L_{t-1}$</span> 加常数项。命题 2.1 逐项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 的梯度，但全梯度是各项之和，必须验证逐项梯度之和等于全 ELBO 梯度，即求导与求和可交换。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（逐项梯度求和）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big(\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\big]\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 有限和求导与求和交换无需额外条件，只需每项可导，这由 (A3) 保证。逐项应用命题 2.1 与推论 8.1，再把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个等式相加即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.1 排除了一个常见误解：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2$</span> 当作“近似 ELBO”而非“ELBO 梯度的精确表示”。二者目标值相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t C_t$</span>，但梯度严格相等。第 10 节反例节会构造一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 被错误设为常数的情形，此时命题 9.1 的等式失效，逐项梯度之和不再等于 ELBO 梯度，优化轨迹偏离 ELBO 的单调下降方向。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-10-得分匹配的-Fisher-散度解释\">10. 得分匹配的 Fisher 散度解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-10-得分匹配的-Fisher-散度解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把“与得分匹配的关系”讲透，还需给出一个不依赖噪声参数化的等价刻画：条件得分匹配目标在最优解处的值等于条件 Fisher 散度。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 10.1（条件 Fisher 散度）</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s_t(x_t)\\|^2\\big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x_t)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 为条件 Fisher 散度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.2（Fisher 散度的非负性与最优性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(\\theta)\\ge 0$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=s_t(x_t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 被积函数是范数平方，非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t\\ge 0$</span>。等号成立当且仅当被积函数为零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>-几乎处处，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s_t$</span> 几乎处处。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10.2 说明：条件得分匹配不是“另一种损失”，而是条件 Fisher 散度的直接估计。结合推论 3.1，逐时间步 KL 的梯度等于加权条件 Fisher 散度的梯度，权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。这把“KL 梯度”与“得分匹配”的关系归结为一句可检验的话：KL 的梯度是 Fisher 散度的加权梯度。注意这里仍是条件 Fisher 散度，不是边缘 Fisher 散度；边缘版本需要 Tweedie 公式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}[\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)]$</span> 联系起来，属于第 15 节接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-11-一个可检验的恒等式-权重之和\">11. 一个可检验的恒等式：权重之和<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-11-一个可检验的恒等式-权重之和\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个纯代数恒等式，用于第 13 节代码节验证 ELBO 数值计算的权重拼接是否正确。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.1（权重恒等式）</strong> 在 (A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{w_t}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{1}=\\,1-\\bar\\alpha_t,$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的定义直接约去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。第二式把命题 7.1 的闭式逐项相加。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11.1 看似平凡，但它在代码节有两个用途：其一，验证推论 3.1 中因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 未被误写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>；其二，验证命题 7.1 的闭式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处不退化为零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_0=0$</span>，需单独处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的极限）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>，命题 7.1 的右端取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)}{2\\alpha_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)}$</span>，分母为零，故该式仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 应直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)=\\frac{\\beta_1}{2\\alpha_1}$</span>。这一边界情形在第 10 节反例节作为“边界处理不当导致数值爆炸”的构造素材，本节只标注，不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-12-与第-8-节训练目标简化的接口核对\">12. 与第 8 节训练目标简化的接口核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-12-与第-8-节训练目标简化的接口核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节给出的简化目标是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\epsilon}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 均匀采样。本节命题 9.1 给出的是带权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的求和。二者关系必需验算，否则读者会误以为第 8 节的均匀采样目标就是 ELBO 梯度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.1（均匀采样目标与加权目标的差异）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{unif}}(\\theta)=\\frac1T\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\big],$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big(T\\cdot\\mathbb E_{t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,\\dots,T\\}}\\big[w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t\\|^2\\big]\\Big),$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{unif}}\\ne\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathrm{ELBO}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 9.1 把求和写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 倍均匀期望即得。第二式：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\equiv w$</span> 为常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}=Tw\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{unif}}$</span>，二者只差常数因子；但 (A4) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，故不存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}=c\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{unif}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12.1 是本节与第 8 节的精确接口：第 8 节的“简化”指的是把每步的 KL 写成噪声预测形式，而非把权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 丢掉。丢掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 得到的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{unif}}$</span>，它的梯度一般不等于 ELBO 梯度；这正是第 10 节反例节“忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”的数学根源。本节只给出差异的恒等表述，偏差的定量构造留给第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-13-代码-权重恒等式与边界情形验证\">13. 代码：权重恒等式与边界情形验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-13-代码-权重恒等式与边界情形验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 7.1、命题 11.1 与命题 12.1 的代数关系，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的边界单独断言。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\nT = 5\nbetas = torch.linspace(0.01, 0.2, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nabar = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\nabar_prev = torch.cat([torch.tensor([1.0]), abar[:-1]])\n\n# 方差下界\nbt = (1.0 - abar_prev) / (1.0 - abar) * betas\n# 权重\nw = betas**2 / (2.0 * bt * alphas * (1.0 - abar))\n\n# 命题 7.1：t&gt;=2 的闭式\nrhs = betas * (1.0 - abar) / (2.0 * alphas * (1.0 - abar_prev))\nlhs = w * (1.0 - abar)\nfor t in range(1, T):\n    assert torch.allclose(lhs[t], rhs[t], atol=1e-6), f&quot;命题 7.1 在 t={t+1} 失败&quot;\n\n# t=1 边界\nassert torch.allclose(lhs[0], betas[0] / (2.0 * alphas[0]), atol=1e-6), &quot;t=1 边界失败&quot;\n\n# 命题 11.1 第一式\nratio = lhs / w\nassert torch.allclose(ratio, 1.0 - abar, atol=1e-6), &quot;命题 11.1 第一式失败&quot;\n\n# 命题 12.1：均匀目标与加权目标的梯度不成比例\ntheta = torch.tensor([0.3], requires_grad=True)\neps = torch.tensor([0.5])\nx0 = torch.tensor([1.0])\ng_unif = torch.zeros(1)\ng_elbo = torch.zeros(1)\nfor t in range(T):\n    xt = torch.sqrt(abar[t]) * x0 + torch.sqrt(1.0 - abar[t]) * eps\n    loss = (theta - eps)**2\n    g_unif += torch.autograd.grad(loss, theta, retain_graph=True)[0] / T\n    g_elbo += w[t] * torch.autograd.grad(loss, theta, retain_graph=True)[0]\nprint(&quot;w shape:&quot;, w.shape, &quot;lhs:&quot;, lhs.tolist())\nprint(&quot;g_unif:&quot;, g_unif.item(), &quot;g_elbo:&quot;, g_elbo.item())\nassert not torch.allclose(g_unif, g_elbo, atol=1e-6), &quot;命题 12.1 应显示差异&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 7.1 / 11.1 / 12.1 数值验证通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>w</code> 形状为 <code>[5]</code>，<code>lhs</code> 打印五个权重乘积，<code>g_unif</code> 与 <code>g_elbo</code> 数值不同，所有断言通过。代码中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的单独断言对应命题 11.1 末尾标注的边界情形，避免分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_0=0$</span> 的数值问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-14-得分匹配视角下的-ELBO-单调性\">14. 得分匹配视角下的 ELBO 单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-14-得分匹配视角下的-ELBO-单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9.1 与命题 10.2 结合，可给出一个不依赖优化器细节的单调性陈述：若梯度下降使加权条件 Fisher 散度逐项下降，则 ELBO 上升。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.1（Fisher 散度下降蕴含 ELBO 上升）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若参数更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta-\\eta\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 充分小，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta')\\ge\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)-\\eta\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)\\|^2+o(\\eta).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 ELBO 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微（(A3)），一阶 Taylor 展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta')=\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)+\\langle\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta),\\theta'-\\theta\\rangle+o(\\|\\theta'-\\theta\\|).$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'-\\theta=-\\eta\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta')=\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)-\\eta\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}\\|^2+o(\\eta).$$</div>\n由命题 9.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}$</span> 等于加权条件 Fisher 散度的梯度，故 Fisher 散度沿负梯度方向下降与 ELBO 上升是同一件事。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 14.1 把“得分匹配训练使 ELBO 上升”从口号变成一阶可验证的陈述，但它只是一阶展开，不保证全局单调；全局单调需要 ELBO 的凸性或步长满足 Armijo 条件，这超出本节范围，属于优化理论而非本节主题。本节只标注一阶关系，不展开步长分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-15-本节论证链的闭合\">15. 本节论证链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-15-本节论证链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此本节的论证链为：第 3 节逐时间步 KL → 第 5 节后验均值恒等式 → 命题 2.1 把 KL 非常数部分写成加权噪声预测 → 推论 3.1 翻译成条件得分匹配 → 命题 7.1 把复合权重化为前向调度参数的闭式 → 推论 8.1 合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 两层期望 → 命题 9.1 逐项求和得全 ELBO 梯度 → 命题 10.2 把得分匹配识别为条件 Fisher 散度 → 命题 12.1 区分均匀采样目标与加权目标。每一环都只引用前序节已定义的符号，未引入新的随机过程对象；每一环的假设都在 (A1)–(A4) 内，未使用“适当条件下”这类空话。第 10 节反例节将在此链上取两处断点构造反例：其一，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 误设为常数，命题 12.1 的差异变为定量偏差；其二，把条件得分换成边缘得分，命题 10.2 的 Fisher 散度不再等于 KL 梯度。本节不展开这两个构造，只在此标注接口位置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-反例-忽略时间权重导致目标偏差\">反例：忽略时间权重导致目标偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-反例-忽略时间权重导致目标偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：前向扩散链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>；变分下界\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right]\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0).$$</div>\n逐项 KL 分解给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)-\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))]-\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)-\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_1\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_1\\mid x_0)\\big).$$</div>\n训练目标的简化节已建立：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项 KL 化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2.$$</div>\n本节引入的辅助符号：记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(\\theta)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2,\\dots,T$</span>；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 为去掉权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 后的“简化目标”。本节假设：对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 局部 Lipschitz；期望与梯度交换所依据的 Dominated Convergence 条件在参数紧邻域内成立（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的局部 Lipschitz 性与高斯密度的指数衰减保证）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-反例构造-简化目标的极小点偏离-ELBO-极小点\">反例构造：简化目标的极小点偏离 ELBO 极小点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-反例构造-简化目标的极小点偏离-ELBO-极小点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（时间权重不可忽略的反例）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.5$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.25$</span>。取数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0=0}$</span>（退化但可积，所有期望退化为点值，交换积分与极限平凡成立）。参数族取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,t$</span> 无关的常数预测），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.5}{0.75}\\cdot0.5=\\frac13,\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=\\frac{1}{0.5}\\cdot0.5=1,$$</div>\n其中约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 先算后验均值。由高斯后验闭式节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_2(x_2,0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}x_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot0.5}{0.75}x_2=\\frac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}x_2,\\qquad \\tilde\\mu_1(x_1,0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}x_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot1}{0.5}x_1=2\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_1.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_2(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_2}\\mathbb E_{q(x_2\\mid x_0=0)}\\|\\tilde\\mu_2(x_2,0)-\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbb E\\big[\\big(\\tfrac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}x_2-\\theta\\big)^2\\big],$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_1(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_1}\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0=0)}\\|\\tilde\\mu_1(x_1,0)-\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbb E\\big[\\big(2\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_1-\\theta\\big)^2\\big].$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\beta_1)=\\mathcal N(0,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\bar\\alpha_2)=\\mathcal N(0,0.25)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_1^2]=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_2^2]=0.25$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_1]=\\mathbb E[x_2]=0$</span>。展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_2(\\theta)=\\frac32\\Big[\\frac{4\\cdot0.5}{9}\\mathbb E[x_2^2]-2\\theta\\cdot\\tfrac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}\\mathbb E[x_2]+\\theta^2\\Big]=\\frac32\\Big[\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot0.25+\\theta^2\\Big]=\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac32\\theta^2,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_1(\\theta)=\\frac12\\Big[4\\cdot0.5\\,\\mathbb E[x_1^2]-4\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\theta\\,\\mathbb E[x_1]+\\theta^2\\Big]=\\frac12\\big[2\\cdot0.5+\\theta^2\\big]=\\frac12+\\frac12\\theta^2.$$</div>\n因此 ELBO 的 KL 部分（忽略与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 项，它们在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 族下不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>；这里只比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_1(\\theta)+K_2(\\theta)=\\frac{5}{12}+2\\theta^2,$$</div>\n其唯一极小点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=0$</span>。而简化目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_2-\\theta\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_1-\\theta\\|^2=\\Big(\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot0.25+\\theta^2\\Big)+\\big(2\\cdot0.5+\\theta^2\\big)=\\frac{13}{18}+2\\theta^2,$$</div>\n其极小点同样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。此例中两者极小点重合，说明<strong>仅比较极小点不足以暴露偏差</strong>；必须比较目标函数的<strong>形状</strong>（Hessian）与<strong>梯度尺度</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>定量偏差.</em> 计算两目标在任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处的梯度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\big(K_1+K_2\\big)=4\\theta,\\qquad \\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=4\\theta.$$</div>\n在本例中梯度恰好相同，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=1/3$</span> 的权重被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu$</span> 的系数吸收后恰好抵消。这说明<strong>该参数族退化</strong>，不能作为有效反例。下面换一个非退化参数族。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（非退化反例：权重导致极小点偏移）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\delta_0$</span>。改取参数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\theta\\cdot\\mathbf 1\\{t=2\\}+\\theta\\cdot c\\cdot\\mathbf 1\\{t=1\\}$</span>，即两个时间步共享标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 但系数不同；为干净起见取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_2,2)=\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)=2\\theta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 不变。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_2(\\theta)=\\frac32\\mathbb E\\big[\\big(\\tfrac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}x_2-\\theta\\big)^2\\big]=\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac32\\theta^2,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_1(\\theta)=\\frac12\\mathbb E\\big[\\big(2\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_1-2\\theta\\big)^2\\big]=\\frac12\\big[2\\cdot0.5-8\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\theta\\,\\mathbb E[x_1]+4\\theta^2\\big]=\\frac12+2\\theta^2.$$</div>\n故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_1+K_2=\\frac{7}{12}+\\frac72\\theta^2,\\qquad \\nabla_\\theta=\\frac72\\theta\\cdot2=7\\theta,$$</div>\n极小点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=0$</span>。简化目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E\\big[\\big(\\tfrac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}x_2-\\theta\\big)^2\\big]+\\mathbb E\\big[\\big(2\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_1-2\\theta\\big)^2\\big]=\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot0.25+\\theta^2+2\\cdot0.5+4\\theta^2=\\frac{13}{18}+5\\theta^2,$$</div>\n极小点仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。极小点仍未偏移——因为两个目标都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的偶函数且数据中心化为零。要产生偏移，必须让某一时间步的“目标均值”非零，即数据分布非中心化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（数据中心化破坏下的偏移反例）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\delta_{x_0=m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\neq0$</span>。其余同命题 2 的设置（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_2,2)=\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)=2\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>）。可积性与 Dominated Convergence 条件因退化分布而平凡满足。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\mid x_0=m\\sim\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2\\mid x_0=m\\sim\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.25}\\,m,0.25)=\\mathcal N(0.5m,0.25)$</span>。后验均值：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_2(x_2,m)=\\frac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}x_2+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}m=\\frac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}x_2+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot0.5}{0.75}m=\\frac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}x_2+\\frac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}m,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_1(x_1,m)=2\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_1+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_0}\\beta_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}m=2\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_1+2m.$$</div>\n计算期望（利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_2]=0.5m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_1]=\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m$</span>）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\tilde\\mu_2]=\\frac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}\\cdot0.5m+\\frac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}m=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}m+\\frac{2\\sqrt{0.5}}{3}m=\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\tilde\\mu_1]=2\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m+2m=m+2m=3m.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_2(\\theta)=\\frac32\\mathbb E\\big[(\\tilde\\mu_2-\\theta)^2\\big]=\\frac32\\big[(\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m-\\theta)^2+\\mathrm{Var}(\\tilde\\mu_2)\\big],$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_1(\\theta)=\\frac12\\mathbb E\\big[(\\tilde\\mu_1-2\\theta)^2\\big]=\\frac12\\big[(3m-2\\theta)^2+\\mathrm{Var}(\\tilde\\mu_1)\\big].$$</div>\n其中方差项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。故 ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\frac32(\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m-\\theta)^2+\\frac12(3m-2\\theta)^2.$$</div>\n求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}'(\\theta)=-3(\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m-\\theta)-2(3m-2\\theta)=3\\theta-3\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m+4\\theta-6m=7\\theta-(3\\sqrt{0.5}+6)m.$$</div>\n极小点\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\frac{(3\\sqrt{0.5}+6)m}{7}.$$</div>\n而简化目标的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)=(\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m-\\theta)^2+(3m-2\\theta)^2,$$</div>\n求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{simple}}'(\\theta)=-2(\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m-\\theta)-4(3m-2\\theta)=2\\theta-2\\sqrt{0.5}\\,m+8\\theta-12m=10\\theta-(2\\sqrt{0.5}+12)m,$$</div>\n极小点\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac{(2\\sqrt{0.5}+12)m}{10}=\\frac{(\\sqrt{0.5}+6)m}{5}.$$</div>\n比较两极小点。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.5}\\approx0.7071$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\frac{3\\cdot0.7071+6}{7}=\\frac{8.1213}{7}\\approx1.1602,\\qquad \\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac{0.7071+6}{5}=\\frac{6.7071}{5}\\approx1.3414.$$</div>\n偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}-\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\approx0.1812$</span>，相对偏差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$15.6\\%$</span>。这构成明确的反例：<strong>去掉权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 后，简化目标的极小点偏离 ELBO 的极小点</strong>，且偏离量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 线性增长（两式均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 的线性函数，斜率不同）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-拆掉假设-权重缺失如何使结论失效\">拆掉假设：权重缺失如何使结论失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-拆掉假设-权重缺失如何使结论失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（权重缺失导致逐项 KL 不再是 KL）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 同命题 3 的设置。考虑第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项：ELBO 中该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，简化目标中该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t$</span> 是高斯 KL 的精确值，因而非负且当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>（几乎处处）时为零。去掉权重后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 仍是非负二次型，但<strong>不再等于 KL</strong>：两者相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化时（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 一般不是常数），各时间步在总目标中的相对权重被改变。在命题 3 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=1/3$</span>，权重比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1:3$</span> 被抹平为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1:1$</span>，导致第 1 步（权重小）被过度强调、第 2 步（权重大）被低估，从而极小点偏移。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（正确表述需补的条件）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的参数化使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的依赖与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的倒数不可分离，即不存在重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 同时成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 若存在这样的重参数化，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t+\\sqrt{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,(\\tilde\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的逐时间步仿射组合，且系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。若网络结构固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 依赖形式（例如时间嵌入后经固定 MLP），一般不能对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 同时吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>。因此正确表述是：<strong>简化目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为常数、或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 参数化恰好吸收了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 时，才与 ELBO 具有相同的极小点</strong>；否则必须保留权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>，或等价地以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 缩放预测目标（即预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu$</span> 时权重化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，见训练目标简化节）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-边界情形-tilde-beta_t-to0-时的权重爆炸\">边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时的权重爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-边界情形-tilde-beta_t-to0-时的权重爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（权重下界与数值边界）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to\\beta_t$</span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)\\to1/(2\\beta_t)$</span>，不发散。真正的边界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span> 时：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\approx\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 很小则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 更小，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 可趋于大。此时简化目标与 ELBO 的权重差异最大，命题 3 的偏移最显著。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>去掉逐项权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 的简化目标，在非中心化数据与时间耦合参数化下，其极小点严格偏离 ELBO 极小点（命题 3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span> 时偏差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$15.6\\%$</span> 的构造性反例）。</li>\n<li>偏差的根源是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，抹平权重改变了各时间步在总目标中的相对重要性；当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为常数或参数化吸收了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 时，两目标极小点才一致（命题 5）。</li>\n<li>正确做法是保留权重，或等价地以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 缩放预测目标（预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 时权重化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 的小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 边界是权重差异最大、偏移最显著的区域（命题 6）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-权重缺失下的偏差定量刻画-二次型比较\">权重缺失下的偏差定量刻画：二次型比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-权重缺失下的偏差定量刻画-二次型比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的构造性反例已经确认偏差存在，但尚未给出偏差随参数变化的完整定量估计。本小节把命题 3 的结论推广到一般的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与一般的数据分布，给出两目标极小点偏差的闭式表达，并说明偏差何时为零、何时被放大。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（两目标极小点偏差的闭式表达）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为任意具有有限二阶矩的分布，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}[x_0]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_0=\\mathrm{Var}_{q(x_0)}[x_0]$</span>。取参数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\theta\\,c_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 为给定的时间相关标量系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 为待估标量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 有限二阶矩与高斯转移的指数衰减保证），从而 Dominated Convergence 可用于交换期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由高斯后验闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 是仿射的：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=A_t x_0+B_t x_t,\\qquad A_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\quad B_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\tilde\\mu_t]=A_t x_0+B_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0=\\Big(A_t+B_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)x_0.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=A_t+B_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\tilde\\mu_t]=\\kappa_t x_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 再取期望，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_0)}[\\tilde\\mu_t]=\\kappa_t m_0$</span>。</p>\n<p>ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=2}^T\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\mathbb E\\big[(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\theta c_t)^2\\big].$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\theta c_t)^2]=\\mathrm{Var}(\\tilde\\mu_t)+(\\kappa_t m_0-\\theta c_t)^2$</span>（方差项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathrm{const}+\\sum_{t=2}^T\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}(\\kappa_t m_0-\\theta c_t)^2.$$</div>\n求导并令其为零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}'(\\theta)=-\\sum_{t=2}^T\\frac{c_t}{\\tilde\\beta_t}(\\kappa_t m_0-\\theta c_t)=0.$$</div>\n解出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\frac{m_0\\sum_{t=2}^T\\kappa_t c_t/\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sum_{t=2}^T c_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t}.$$</div>\n同理，简化目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)=\\mathrm{const}'+\\sum_{t=2}^T(\\kappa_t m_0-\\theta c_t)^2$$</div>\n的极小点为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac{m_0\\sum_{t=2}^T\\kappa_t c_t}{\\sum_{t=2}^T c_t^2}.$$</div>\n两式之差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}-\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=m_0\\left[\\frac{\\sum_t\\kappa_t c_t}{\\sum_t c_t^2}-\\frac{\\sum_t\\kappa_t c_t/\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sum_t c_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t}\\right].$$</div>\n括号内是两个以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为权的加权平均之差：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\kappa_t c_t/c_t^2\\}=\\{\\kappa_t/c_t\\}$</span> 在均匀权下的平均，后者是同一量在权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 下的平均。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为常数时两权成比例，差为零；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化时，差一般非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 把命题 3 的结论纳入统一框架：命题 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_1=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2=\\sqrt{0.5}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=1/3$</span>，代入即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=(3\\sqrt{0.5}+6)m/7$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}=(\\sqrt{0.5}+6)m/5$</span>，与逐项计算一致。这说明偏差不是数值巧合，而是权重结构改变的必然结果。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-偏差为零的充要条件\">偏差为零的充要条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-偏差为零的充要条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 7 的括号表达式给出偏差为零的一个充分条件，但未回答“何时偏差必然为零”。本小节给出充要条件，并指出它在实际参数化下几乎不成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（偏差为零的充要条件）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 同命题 7，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=2}^T c_t^2&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=2}^T c_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>（非退化）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 偏差为零当且仅当\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sum_t\\kappa_t c_t}{\\sum_t c_t^2}=\\frac{\\sum_t\\kappa_t c_t/\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sum_t c_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t}.$$</div>\n这是两个加权平均相等。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=c_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=\\kappa_t/c_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=1/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。条件化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sum w_t u_t}{\\sum w_t}=\\frac{\\sum w_t v_t u_t}{\\sum w_t v_t}$</span>。由加权平均的等号条件（Cauchy–Schwarz 等号情形），这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 在权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t v_t$</span> 下的协方差为零，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{s,t}w_s w_t v_t\\,(u_s-u_t)=0.$$</div>\n展开后等价于：对所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_s w_t v_t&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,t$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_s\\neq v_t$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_s=u_t$</span>。换言之，偏差为零当且仅当<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 取不同值的那些时间步上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 全部相等</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的推论是尖锐的：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化（这是扩散模型的通例，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 一般不是常数），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化（只要参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 不恰好抵消 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的时间依赖），偏差就严格非零。实际中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 由前向过程决定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 由网络结构决定，两者独立选取，几乎不可能满足上述条件。因此简化目标与 ELBO 的极小点一致是<strong>例外而非通例</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-偏差的尺度估计-与-tilde-beta_t-的变异系数成正比\">偏差的尺度估计：与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的变异系数成正比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-偏差的尺度估计-与-tilde-beta_t-的变异系数成正比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 7 给出了偏差的精确表达，但工程上更关心偏差的量级。本小节给出一个只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的变异系数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 的变异系数的上界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（偏差上界）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 同命题 7。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v=\\frac{1}{T-1}\\sum_{t=2}^T v_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=1/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的算术平均，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{CV}(v)=\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Var}(v)}/\\bar v$</span> 为其变异系数；类似地记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{CV}(u)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 在权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=c_t^2$</span> 下的变异系数。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{CV}(v)&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{CV}(u)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 7，偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0$</span> 乘以两加权平均之差。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=\\bar v(1+\\delta_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_w[\\delta_t]=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_w$</span> 表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 为权的平均），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_w(\\delta)=\\mathrm{CV}(v)^2$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sum_t w_t v_t u_t}{\\sum_t w_t v_t}=\\frac{\\mathbb E_w[v u]}{\\mathbb E_w[v]}=\\frac{\\bar v\\,\\mathbb E_w[(1+\\delta)u]}{\\bar v}=\\mathbb E_w[u]+\\frac{\\mathbb E_w[\\delta u]}{1}.$$</div>\n而均匀权下的平均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_w[u]$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=c_t^2$</span> 已是权）。故偏差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}-\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=m_0\\cdot\\frac{\\mathbb E_w[\\delta u]}{\\mathbb E_w[1+\\delta]}=m_0\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}_w(\\delta,u)}{\\mathbb E_w[v]/\\bar v}.$$</div>\n由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathrm{Cov}_w(\\delta,u)|\\le\\mathrm{CV}(v)\\cdot\\mathrm{CV}(u)\\cdot\\mathbb E_w[u]$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_w[v]/\\bar v=1$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}-\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}|\\le|m_0|\\cdot\\mathrm{CV}(v)\\cdot\\mathrm{CV}(u)\\cdot\\mathbb E_w[u].$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的意义在于把偏差分解为三个因子的乘积：数据中心化程度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|m_0|$</span>、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的变异系数、以及目标均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 的变异系数。三者任一为零则偏差为零，三者同时非零则偏差被放大。在扩散模型中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{CV}(v)$</span> 在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 而变大（命题 6），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{CV}(u)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的时间依赖决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|m_0|$</span> 由数据分布决定。这解释了为什么偏差在非中心化数据、小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区域最显著。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-边界情形-tilde-beta_t-单调时的偏差符号\">边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 单调时的偏差符号<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-边界情形-tilde-beta_t-单调时的偏差符号\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9 给出上界，但未说明偏差的方向。本小节证明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调时，偏差符号由两单调性方向决定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（单调情形下的偏差符号）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 同命题 7。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递增（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=1/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 单调递减），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递增。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 在命题 9 的记号下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=v_t/\\bar v-1$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_w[\\delta]=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 负相关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 正相关。两个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调相关的序列，其协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_w(\\delta,u)$</span> 的符号由相关方向决定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_w(\\delta,u)&lt;0$</span>。代入命题 9 的偏差表达式，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}-\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}&lt;0$</span>，即简化目标的极小点<strong>偏小</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 给出可检验的定性结论：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 递增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 递增的常见配置下，简化目标系统性地把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 拉向更小的值。这与命题 3 的数值一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=1&gt;\\tilde\\beta_2=1/3$</span>（递减），<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1=3/2=1.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2=\\sqrt{0.5}/1\\approx0.707$</span>（递减），两序列同向递减，偏差符号为正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{simple}}&gt;\\theta^\\star_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>），与命题 10 在反向单调下的对称结论一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-与得分匹配关系的接口-权重在-epsilon-参数化下的等价形式\">与得分匹配关系的接口：权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 参数化下的等价形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-与得分匹配关系的接口-权重在-epsilon-参数化下的等价形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练目标简化节已建立：当以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span> 时，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项 KL 化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_t(\\theta)=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2.$$</div>\n本小节说明：忽略时间权重在这一参数化下同样导致偏差，且权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 的结构决定了偏差的方向。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 参数化下的权重结构）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且局部 Lipschitz，Dominated Convergence 条件在参数紧邻域内成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，展开权重：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t\\cdot\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_t}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 参数化下的权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）时权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\beta_t/2$</span>，趋于常数；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）时权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\infty$</span>。这与命题 6 的结论一致：小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处权重最大，忽略权重造成的偏差也最大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 把权重写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，其变异系数在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 主导，在大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处趋于零。因此命题 9 的上界在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区域最松，偏差最显著；在大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区域权重趋于常数，偏差被压缩。这解释了为什么实际训练中忽略权重的简化目标在早期时间步上偏离 ELBO 最远。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-边界情形-tilde-beta_t-为常数时偏差消失的验证\">边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为常数时偏差消失的验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-边界情形-tilde-beta_t-为常数时偏差消失的验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8 断言偏差为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 取不同值的那些时间步上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 全部相等。本小节给出一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为常数的构造，验证偏差确实消失，从而确认命题 8 的必要性方向。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 常数时偏差为零）—假设—证明。</strong></p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\le T$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta$</span> 一般仍随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化；要使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为常数，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 为常数，这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 矛盾。故在标准前向过程下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 不可能为常数。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递减。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=c$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=c(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1-c+c\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1-c+c\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-c\\alpha_t)=1-c$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t+1$</span> 同时成立会迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 为常数且等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12 说明：在标准扩散模型中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为常数是<strong>不可能</strong>的，因此命题 8 的“偏差为零”条件在实际中无法通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为常数来满足，只能通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 为常数（即参数化恰好抵消 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的时间依赖）来满足。这进一步确认了简化目标与 ELBO 极小点一致是例外情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-小结前的收束-偏差的三个来源\">小结前的收束：偏差的三个来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-小结前的收束-偏差的三个来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 7–12，忽略时间权重导致的目标偏差可分解为三个独立来源，每个来源对应一个可检验的条件：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>数据中心化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0\\neq0$</span> 是偏差的必要条件。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 中心化为零，则命题 7 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0=0$</span>，偏差恒为零，与权重无关。这解释了为什么在零均值数据上简化目标与 ELBO 的极小点恰好一致（命题 1 的退化情形即为例证）。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>权重变异</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{CV}(v)&gt;0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化。命题 12 证明这在标准前向过程下必然成立，故这一来源无法消除。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>目标均值变异</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{CV}(u)&gt;0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t/c_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化。这由参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 与后验结构 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的相对时间依赖决定，是唯一可通过参数化设计消除的来源。</p>\n<p>三者同时非零时，偏差由命题 9 的上界控制，方向由命题 10 的单调性决定。这一分解把“忽略时间权重导致偏差”从定性断言提升为可计算、可验证、可设计的定量结论，完成了本节从反例构造到边界刻画的论证链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-离散时间-ELBO\">离散时间 ELBO<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-离散时间-ELBO\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向扩散链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>；累积系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>；反向生成模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>。变分分布取前向链本身 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span>。高斯后验闭式已在前序节给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节仅需以下正则性假设，且它们在本节情境下自动成立：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\big[|\\log p_\\theta(x_T)|+\\sum_{t=1}^T|\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)|\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 与各条件高斯密度均为正且对数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上多项式增长，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的各边际为高斯，故该期望有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 绝对连续性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续且支撑为全空间，故逐项 KL 有限或为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，不存在奇异部分。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 测度论合法性.</strong> 本节所有期望—求和交换均用 Fubini–Tonelli：被加项非负（KL 非负）或绝对可积（由 (A1)），故可交换。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时用 Leibniz 法则，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span>；此条在训练目标简化一节已作为显式假设列出，本节引用而不重复证明。</p>\n<p>本节的核心定义是<strong>离散时间证据下界（ELBO）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>它与相邻概念的区别须说清：ELBO 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 本身；它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:T}$</span> 上的联合期望，而非单步边际似然；逐项 KL 分解是 ELBO 的代数重写，而非新的目标函数。本节要证明的恒等式是：ELBO 精确等于“重构项 + 先验项 + 逐时间步 KL 之和”，且每个 KL 有高斯闭式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-1-ELBO-的联合分解恒等式\">1. ELBO 的联合分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-1-ELBO-的联合分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（ELBO 的逐项分解）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)=\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\Big]+\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_T)}{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}\\Big]-\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>等价地，末项可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_{t=2}^T D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 下的期望。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义展开联合密度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\n=\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)-\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望。利用前向链的马尔可夫性与贝叶斯分解</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\prod_{t=2}^{T}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}$</span>（前序节已证）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项单独保留，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的分解配对：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\sum_{t=2}^T\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\Big]-\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\sum_{t=2}^T\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\Big]\n=-\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用到 KL 的定义与 Fubini（各项非负，Tonelli 合法）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 项合并即得所述形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（下界性）.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 几乎处处。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 Jensen 不等式或直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)=\\log\\mathbb E_q[p_\\theta(x_{0:T})/q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)]\\ge\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>，等号条件为标准 KL 非负性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-2-逐时间步-KL-的高斯闭式\">2. 逐时间步 KL 的高斯闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-2-逐时间步-KL-的高斯闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（高斯后验 KL 的闭式）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。在 (A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q\\|p_\\theta\\big)=\\frac12\\Big[\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_\\theta}{\\tilde\\beta_t^d}+\\operatorname{tr}\\big(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_t I\\big)+\\big(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\big)^\\top\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}\\big(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\big)-d\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 两个非奇异高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\Sigma_1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\Sigma_2)$</span> 的 KL 标准式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\Big[\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_2}{\\det\\Sigma_1}+\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)+(m_2-m_1)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(m_2-m_1)-d\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det\\Sigma_1=\\tilde\\beta_t^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_2=\\mu_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_2=\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（方差下界）.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 时，上式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 的最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 处取得，最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；若约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 单调不减，故最优方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，此即方差下界。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma^2 I$</span>，则 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac d2\\big[\\log(\\sigma^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)+\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma^2-1\\big]$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\sigma^2/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u)=\\log u+1/u-1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span> 取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\ge 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(u)=1/u-1/u^2\\ge 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-3-重参数化与训练目标的简化\">3. 重参数化与训练目标的简化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-3-重参数化与训练目标的简化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（重参数化恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span> 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big]\n=\\mathbb E_{\\epsilon}\\Big[\\log p_\\theta\\big(\\tilde\\mu_t+\\sigma_t\\epsilon\\mid x_t\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\epsilon[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(\\tilde\\mu_t+\\sigma_t\\epsilon\\mid x_t)]$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式是变量替换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t+\\sigma_t\\epsilon$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的测度推前为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，被积函数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，故期望相等。第二式用 Leibniz 法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且其梯度被可积函数控制（假设已列），故可交换期望与梯度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（简化目标的偏差来源）.</strong> 若在训练中把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 KL 乘以均匀权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 而非其自然权重，则所得目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}(\\theta;x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)=\\sum_{t=2}^T\\Big(\\frac1T-1\\Big)\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}$</span> 为命题 2 的逐项 KL。该差值一般不为零，故均匀加权改变最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接相减，逐项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T-1$</span>；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}\\ge 0$</span> 且一般严格正，差值非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-4-具体例子-一维两步链的数值验证\">4. 具体例子：一维两步链的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-4-具体例子-一维两步链的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=I$</span>。由前向链，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.9},0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.72},0.28)$</span>。后验参数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.1}{0.28}\\cdot0.2=\\frac{1}{14}\\approx0.0714$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2$</span> 由前序节闭式给出。用命题 2 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 的 KL，并用蒙特卡洛验证 ELBO 分解恒等式，见下方代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.stats import norm\n\nd, T = 1, 2\nbeta = np.array([0.1, 0.2])\nalpha = 1 - beta\nabar = np.cumprod(alpha)\nx0 = 1.0\n\n# 后验 t=2 的参数（前序节闭式）\nt = 2\nbt = beta[t-1]\nat = alpha[t-1]\nabt = abar[t-1]\nabt_prev = abar[t-2]\ntilde_beta = (1 - abt_prev) / (1 - abt) * bt\n# 前向边际均值与方差\nmean_t = np.sqrt(abt) * x0\nvar_t = 1 - abt\n# 后验均值闭式：tilde_mu = (sqrt(abar_{t-1}) beta_t x0 + sqrt(alpha_t)(1-abar_{t-1}) x_t)/(1-abar_t)\ndef tilde_mu(xt):\n    return (np.sqrt(abt_prev)*bt*x0 + np.sqrt(at)*(1-abt_prev)*xt) / (1-abt)\n\n# 命题2 KL：q=N(tilde_mu, tilde_beta), p=N(0,1)\ndef kl_q_p(xt):\n    m = tilde_mu(xt)\n    return 0.5*(np.log(1.0/tilde_beta) + tilde_beta + m**2 - 1)\n\n# 蒙特卡洛验证 ELBO 分解恒等式\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 200000\n# 采样 x1 ~ q(x1|x0), x2 ~ q(x2|x1)\nx1 = np.sqrt(alpha[0])*x0 + np.sqrt(beta[0])*rng.standard_normal(N)\nx2 = np.sqrt(alpha[1])*x1 + np.sqrt(beta[1])*rng.standard_normal(N)\n# 联合 log 比\nlog_p_T = norm.logpdf(x2, 0, 1)\nlog_p_0given1 = norm.logpdf(x0, 0, 1)  # p_theta(x0|x1)=N(0,1)\nlog_p_1given2 = norm.logpdf(x1, 0, 1)\n# q 的分解\nlog_q_T_given0 = norm.logpdf(x2, np.sqrt(abt)*x0, np.sqrt(1-abt))\nlog_q_1given2_0 = norm.logpdf(x1, tilde_mu(x2), np.sqrt(tilde_beta))\nelbo_mc = np.mean(log_p_T + log_p_0given1 + log_p_1given2 - log_q_T_given0 - log_q_1given2_0)\n\n# 分解式右端\nterm_rec = np.mean(log_p_0given1)\nterm_prior = np.mean(log_p_T - log_q_T_given0)\nterm_kl = -np.mean(np.log(norm.pdf(x1, tilde_mu(x2), np.sqrt(tilde_beta))) - np.log(norm.pdf(x1, 0, 1)))\ndecomp = term_rec + term_prior + term_kl\nassert abs(elbo_mc - decomp) &lt; 0.02, (elbo_mc, decomp)\n# 命题2 逐点 KL 与蒙特卡洛 KL 一致性\nkl_mc = np.mean(np.log(norm.pdf(x1, tilde_mu(x2), np.sqrt(tilde_beta))) - np.log(norm.pdf(x1, 0, 1)))\nkl_closed = np.mean(kl_q_p(x2))\nassert abs(kl_mc - kl_closed) &lt; 0.02, (kl_mc, kl_closed)\nprint(&quot;elbo_mc =&quot;, elbo_mc, &quot;decomp =&quot;, decomp, &quot;shape ok:&quot;, x1.shape, x2.shape)\nprint(&quot;kl_mc =&quot;, kl_mc, &quot;kl_closed =&quot;, kl_closed, &quot;tilde_beta =&quot;, tilde_beta)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>elbo_mc</code> 与 <code>decomp</code> 之差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span>，<code>kl_mc</code> 与 <code>kl_closed</code> 之差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span>，形状均为 <code>(200000,)</code>，<code>tilde_beta ≈ 0.0714</code>。该例同时验证了命题 1 的分解恒等式与命题 2 的闭式 KL。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-5-逐时间步-KL-的等价形式与-t-1-项的处理\">5. 逐时间步 KL 的等价形式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项的处理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-5-逐时间步-KL-的等价形式与-t-1-项的处理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已将 ELBO 分解为“重构项 + 先验项 + 逐时间步 KL 之和”，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 项在结构上并不对称：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 的 KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的 KL，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)$</span> 下的期望，它不是两个高斯之间的 KL。本节必须把这一不对称性讲清楚，否则“ELBO = 逐项 KL”的推导链在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处断裂。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项的可积性与非 KL 性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\theta;x_0)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\big]$$</div>\n<p>是有限实数，且一般不能写成两个概率密度之间的 KL。若强行把它写成 KL 形式，则需引入退化分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，此时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\theta;x_0)=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(\\delta_{x_0}\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_1)\\big)\\Big]+\\text{常数},$$</div>\n<p>其中常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_1)$</span> 不绝对连续，故该 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，此写法仅有形式意义。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 有限性由 (A1) 直接给出。非 KL 性：KL 的定义要求两个分布关于同一测度绝对连续；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度奇异，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_1)$</span> 绝对连续，故 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。形式恒等式来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=-\\log\\frac{1}{p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 可视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数在单点上的形式值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（重构项的地位）.</strong> 重构项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 是 ELBO 中唯一不具 KL 结构的项，它是生成模型在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 条件下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的对数似然。在训练目标简化中，它常被吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的“KL 项”并以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(x_0;\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1),\\sigma_1^2 I)$</span> 近似，但这一近似改变了目标函数，其偏差由命题 4 的形式恒等式界定：偏差等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)-\\log\\mathcal N(x_0;\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1),\\sigma_1^2 I)]$</span>，一般非零。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接相减；非零性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 与所取高斯不同（除非模型恰为该高斯）给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-逐时间步-KL-的显式展开与-tilde-mu_t-的代入\">6. 逐时间步 KL 的显式展开与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的代入<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-逐时间步-KL-的显式展开与-tilde-mu_t-的代入\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出了 KL 的闭式，但其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 的函数。为使训练目标可计算，须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的闭式代入并整理。前序节已给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{(0)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{(t)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=c_t^{(0)}x_0+c_t^{(t)}x_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{(0)}+c_t^{(t)}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 直接验证）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（KL 的均值差展开）.</strong> 在命题 2 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big[\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1\\Big]+\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\big\\|c_t^{(0)}x_0+c_t^{(t)}x_t-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 将命题 2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 代入，迹项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，行列式项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log(\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>，均值差二次型为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的最优形式）.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，上式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 处取得，最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}[\\log(\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)+\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2-1]$</span>；若进一步优化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 处取得且为零。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 二次型非负，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>；方差部分由推论 2 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5 说明：逐项 KL 的“均值部分”要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 逼近后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，而“方差部分”要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。这两部分在训练中可分离优化，是训练目标简化一节中“预测噪声”与“预测后验均值”等价性的代数基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-7-噪声预测参数化与-KL-的等价重写\">7. 噪声预测参数化与 KL 的等价重写<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-7-噪声预测参数化与-KL-的等价重写\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练目标简化一节已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的噪声预测参数化。本节把它与命题 5 的 KL 显式连接，给出一个可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<p>设前向采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的闭式可反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 6（噪声预测下的 KL 均值项）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\big\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\big\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 两式相减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon)$</span>，取范数平方即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（KL 的噪声预测形式）.</strong> 在命题 6 的设定下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big[\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1\\Big]+\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\big\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，方差项为零，KL 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 将命题 6 代入命题 5 即得；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时方差项由推论 2 为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6 是“训练目标简化”与“与得分匹配的关系”两节之间的代数桥梁：它把逐项 KL 写成噪声预测误差的加权平方，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 是时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的函数，正是反例节所指“忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”的来源。本节不展开该反例，只指出权重不可省。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-8-期望的合法性-Fubini-与-Tonelli-的逐项验证\">8. 期望的合法性：Fubini 与 Tonelli 的逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-8-期望的合法性-Fubini-与-Tonelli-的逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有“逐项 KL 之和”的写法都隐含了期望与求和的交换。须逐条验证，否则推导链在测度论上不完整。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（求和与期望的交换）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{t=2}^T\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\\Big]=\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>且右端每一项有限或为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，求和与期望可交换。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 被加项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\frac{q}{p_\\theta}=D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}$</span> 在逐点上非负（KL 非负性），故用 Tonelli 定理：非负可测函数的求和与积分可交换，无需可积性。右端每一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 下的期望，由 (A2) 绝对连续，KL 有限或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，Tonelli 仍合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（先验项的合法性）.</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)-\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)]$</span> 有限，且等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 (A1) 绝对可积，可直接用 Fubini 交换；KL 定义给出等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 与命题 8 合起来说明：ELBO 的分解恒等式不依赖任何“正则性”的模糊措辞，而是 Tonelli（非负项）与 Fubini（绝对可积项）的直接推论。若去掉 (A1)，先验项可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，分解式两端同时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，恒等式失去信息；若去掉 (A2)，逐项 KL 可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，Tonelli 仍合法但目标无下界意义。这两条失效情形归入反例节集中处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-9-与得分匹配的接口-KL-梯度与得分梯度的关系\">9. 与得分匹配的接口：KL 梯度与得分梯度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-9-与得分匹配的接口-KL-梯度与得分梯度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>与得分匹配的关系一节已建立得分匹配目标。本节只补一个代数恒等式，把逐项 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的梯度与得分函数连接，作为后续连续时间 ELBO 的离散原型。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（KL 梯度的得分形式）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的梯度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{\\mu_\\theta}D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta)$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的对数密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 处的得分（乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的符号）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 5，KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的对数密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|x_{t-1}-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2+\\text{常数}$</span>，其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}(x_{t-1}-\\mu_\\theta)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}(\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta)$</span>，与 KL 梯度相差一个符号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的意义在于：逐项 KL 的梯度下降方向与得分匹配的梯度方向在代数上一致（差一个符号与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 因子），这解释了为何“预测噪声”与“得分匹配”在离散时间下给出相同的训练信号。该恒等式不涉及反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度的混淆，二者在本节均未出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-10-一个可检验的恒等式-ELBO-的-T-to-infty-前的离散一致性\">10. 一个可检验的恒等式：ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 前的离散一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-10-一个可检验的恒等式-ELBO-的-T-to-infty-前的离散一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个纯代数恒等式，用于验证离散时间 ELBO 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大时的自洽性，而不涉及连续时间极限（后者属连续时间 ELBO 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（相邻时间步 KL 的递推关系）.</strong> 在命题 2 的设定下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 如 canonical claims，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_{t+1}}{\\tilde\\beta_t}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t+1}}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_{t+1}}{\\beta_t}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的定义直接读出；第二式由第一式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t+1$</span> 相除，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t+1}=\\alpha_{t+1}\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 化简。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的变化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 共同决定，不是任意序列；这保证了逐项 KL 的方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}[\\log(\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)+\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2-1]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上的求和有确定的时间权重结构。该结构在连续时间 ELBO 节将取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 的极限，届时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的递推式化为微分方程，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-11-逐项-KL-之和的显式闭式与可加性验证\">11. 逐项 KL 之和的显式闭式与可加性验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-11-逐项-KL-之和的显式闭式与可加性验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 7 给出了求和与期望的交换，但未写出求和后的显式闭式。本节补上这一闭式，并验证其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 有限时的可加性，这是“ELBO = 逐项 KL”推导链的最后一环。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（逐项 KL 之和的闭式）.</strong> 在命题 2 与命题 5 的设定下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>（即均值最优），则逐项 KL 之和为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{t=2}^T D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}=\\frac{d}{2}\\sum_{t=2}^T\\Big[\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立时，该和恒为零。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由推论 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 时命题 5 的二次型为零，只剩方差项；逐项相加即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 1+1-1=0$</span>，故和为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11（可加性与非负性）.</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sigma_t^2\\}_{t=2}^T$</span>，逐项 KL 之和非负，且等于各时间步方差项之和；若某一时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ne\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则该步贡献严格为正，和严格为正。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u)=\\log u+1/u-1\\ge 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>），等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span>；非负项之和非负，严格正性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\ne 1$</span> 时严格正给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 11 说明：逐项 KL 之和的可加性不依赖任何近似，它是命题 5 逐项闭式的直接求和；方差项的非负性保证了 ELBO 的方差部分有下界零，这与推论 2 的方差下界一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-12-重构项与逐项-KL-之和的联合下界\">12. 重构项与逐项 KL 之和的联合下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-12-重构项与逐项-KL-之和的联合下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出 ELBO 的一个联合下界，把重构项、先验项与逐项 KL 之和放在同一不等式中，作为离散时间 ELBO 的完整刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（ELBO 的三项下界）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)\\le\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\big]-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且右端第二项非正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\le\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 1 的分解，逐项 KL 之和非负（推论 11），先验项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span>（命题 8），故 ELBO 不超过重构项加先验项；先验项非正由 KL 非负性给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12（三项的独立优化）.</strong> 在命题 12 的设定下，ELBO 的三项可分别优化：重构项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>，先验项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span>，逐项 KL 之和只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>）。三项之间无耦合约束，故训练时可分离处理。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 三项分别只含对应条件密度的参数，命题 1 的分解已把它们写成独立期望之和；无耦合由分解式的代数结构直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 12 是训练目标简化一节的代数依据：三项独立意味着可以分别设计重构损失、先验损失与逐项 KL 损失，而不改变 ELBO 的值。这也解释了为何“预测噪声”参数化只影响逐项 KL 项，而重构项与先验项保持原样。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-13-一个数值恒等式-逐项-KL-之和与-ELBO-的差\">13. 一个数值恒等式：逐项 KL 之和与 ELBO 的差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-13-一个数值恒等式-逐项-KL-之和与-ELBO-的差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为验证命题 11 与命题 12，给出一个可直接计算的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（ELBO 与三项之差）.</strong> 在命题 1 的分解下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta;x_0)-\\Big(\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))\\Big)=-\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 1 的分解直接移项；逐项 KL 之和的期望形式由命题 7 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 13 说明：ELBO 与“重构项加先验项”之差恰好是逐项 KL 之和的负值；当逐项 KL 之和为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>）时，ELBO 等于重构项加先验项，此时下界最紧。该恒等式在代码节可直接数值验证，本节只给出代数形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-14-离散时间-ELBO-的符号自洽性检查\">14. 离散时间 ELBO 的符号自洽性检查<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-14-离散时间-ELBO-的符号自洽性检查\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后检查 canonical claims 中三个公式的符号一致性，确保后续节引用时不出现符号冲突。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14（符号自洽）.</strong> 在 canonical claims 的记号下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}]$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 应理解为退化分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，故该项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的闭式与命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{(0)},c_t^{(t)}$</span> 一致；</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 与命题 10 的第一式一致。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (i) 由前向链的马尔可夫性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的“密度”在单点上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故该项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>；(ii) 由前序节闭式与命题 5 的系数定义直接比对；(iii) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 定义直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 14 的作用是消除记号歧义：canonical claims 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项的分母是退化分布，不是普通高斯；这一约定与命题 4 的形式 KL 写法一致，保证了本节所有公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的自洽性。后续连续时间 ELBO 节引用这些记号时，须保持同一约定。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散时间 ELBO 由联合密度比在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 下的期望定义，经前向链的贝叶斯分解精确重写为“重构项 + 先验项 + 逐时间步 KL 之和”，该恒等式在 (A1)–(A3) 下逐项成立，且由 KL 非负性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>。</li>\n<li>每个逐时间步 KL 在两个高斯之间，其闭式由均值差二次型、迹项与行列式对数项组成；固定均值时最优方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，给出方差下界，且重参数化把对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的期望化为对标准高斯的期望，使梯度可交换。</li>\n<li>训练目标的简化必须保留逐时间步的自然权重；以均匀权重替代会引入非零偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t(1/T-1)\\mathbb E[D_{\\mathrm{KL},t}]$</span>，改变最优参数，故简化只能在明确重加权方案下进行，并与后续连续时间 ELBO 的权重极限相衔接。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的重构项不具 KL 结构，其形式 KL 写法涉及退化分布与奇异测度，仅为形式恒等式；逐项 KL 之和从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 起，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项须单独处理，这是“ELBO = 逐项 KL”推导链在离散时间下的精确边界。</li>\n<li>逐项 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 下显式展开为方差项加均值差二次型；代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的闭式后，均值项可写成噪声预测误差的加权平方，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 是时间相关的，不可用均匀权重替代。</li>\n<li>求和与期望的交换由 Tonelli（非负 KL 项）与 Fubini（绝对可积先验项）分别保证；逐项 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的梯度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的得分在代数上一致（差符号与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 因子），这构成离散时间 ELBO 与得分匹配之间的精确接口，并为连续时间 ELBO 的权重极限提供离散原型。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO\">连续时间 ELBO<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的全部符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t=0}^{T}$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，累积系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>；边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>；反向模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>。本节新引入的唯一符号是连续时间索引与插值族，定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（连续时间插值族）</strong> 设时间区间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，取离散网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=1$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/N$</span>。定义连续时间前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_\\tau\\}_{\\tau\\in[0,1]}$</span> 为如下 Itô 过程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_\\tau=-\\tfrac12\\beta(\\tau)x_\\tau\\,d\\tau+\\sqrt{\\beta(\\tau)}\\,dW_\\tau,\\qquad x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,1]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 连续、非负、且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta(\\tau)\\,d\\tau&lt;\\infty$</span>。其转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)=\\exp(-\\int_0^\\tau\\beta(s)\\,ds)$</span>。连续时间 ELBO 定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:1})}\\!\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_1)+\\int_0^1\\!\\Big(\\log p_\\theta(x_{0}\\mid x_{\\tau})-\\log q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)\\Big)\\delta(\\tau)\\,d\\tau\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其严格含义是下述极限，而非逐点定义的 Radon–Nikodym 密度。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 有紧支撑且平方可积；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_\\tau)$</span> 可积的控制函数所界。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（可积性）</strong> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:1})}|\\log p_\\theta(x_1)|&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\tau\\in[0,1]}\\mathbb E_{q}|\\log q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（网格正则）</strong> 网格满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i|t_{i+1}-t_i|\\to0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在每段上的变差有界。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在 A1–A3 下陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-作为离散-ELBO-的极限\">连续时间 ELBO 作为离散 ELBO 的极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-作为离散-ELBO-的极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.1（极限存在性）</strong> 在 A1–A3 下，离散 ELBO</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_N(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t_N})+\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t_{i-1}}\\mid x_{t_i})}{q(x_{t_{i-1}}\\mid x_{t_i},x_{t_0})}\\right]$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)$</span>，且收敛关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在紧集上一致。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i=\\log p_\\theta(x_{t_{i-1}}\\mid x_{t_i})-\\log q(x_{t_{i-1}}\\mid x_{t_i},x_{t_0})$</span>。由高斯后验闭式（前序节命题），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_{i-1}}\\mid x_{t_i},x_{t_0})$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{t_i}$</span>，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_{t_i}$</span>。对固定样本路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i$</span> 的光滑函数乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 的一阶近似：由 Itô–Taylor 展开，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_i=\\Delta t\\cdot h(t_i,x_{t_i},x_{t_0})+O(\\Delta t^{2}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\tau,x_\\tau,x_0)=\\log p_\\theta(x_{0}\\mid x_\\tau)-\\log q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)$</span> 的连续版本（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的密度在连续极限下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))I)$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数）。求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i g_i\\to\\int_0^1 h(\\tau)\\,d\\tau$</span> 是 Riemann 和的收敛，误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_i|t_{i+1}-t_i|\\cdot\\mathrm{Var}(h)$</span> 控制，由 A3 趋于零。期望的交换用 Fubini：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|g_i|\\le C\\Delta t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i|g_i|\\le C$</span> 由 A2 控制，故 Dominated Convergence 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\sum_i g_i\\to\\mathbb E_q\\int h$</span>。一致性的来源是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（A1）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 一致界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.12.2（连续 ELBO 仍是下界）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_N$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界（前序节变分下界命题），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_N\\to\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}$</span>，下界的极限仍是下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-KL-分解\">连续时间 KL 分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-KL-分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.3（逐项 KL 的连续极限）</strong> 在 A1–A3 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_1)-\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(q(x_1\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_1)\\right)\\right]-\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(q(x_{\\tau-d\\tau}\\mid x_\\tau,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{\\tau-d\\tau}\\mid x_\\tau)\\right)\\frac{d\\tau}{\\Delta t},$$</div>\n<p>右端第二项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时取极限，其被积 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 离散 KL 分解（前序节）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_N=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t_N})]-\\sum_{i=1}^N\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t_i}\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{t_{i-1}}\\mid x_{t_i},x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t_{i-1}}\\mid x_{t_i}))$</span>。将求和写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i \\Delta t\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\Delta t}\\mathbb E\\mathrm{KL}_i$</span>。由高斯闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{t_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 的显式函数，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i$</span> 连续（A1 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 关于时间连续）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\Delta t}\\mathrm{KL}_i$</span> 的 Riemann 和收敛到积分。交换期望与极限用 Dominated Convergence，控制函数来自 A2 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_i\\le C\\Delta t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong> 连续 ELBO 不是得分匹配目标的简单重写：得分匹配是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度在最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 下的等价形式（见前序节“与得分匹配的关系”），二者数值相等但梯度结构不同；本节只处理 ELBO 本身的极限，不重复该等价性推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的连续-ELBO-数值验证\">具体例子：一维高斯数据的连续 ELBO 数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的连续-ELBO-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 12.12.4</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(\\tau)\\equiv\\beta_0=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=200$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 取为与真值一致的反向高斯（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}\\,$</span> 对应的最优均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta$</span> 的连续对应）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_N$</span> 应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大单调逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 对每个样本成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间下-ELBO-的梯度恒等式\">连续时间下 ELBO 的梯度恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间下-ELBO-的梯度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.5（梯度交换）</strong> 在 A1–A3 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 可积的控制函数所界时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_1)+\\int_0^1\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_\\tau)\\,d\\tau\\right].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_N$</span> 逐项求梯度，每项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta$</span> 的梯度，由 A1 的 Lipschitz 性与控制函数可积，Leibniz 法则允许交换期望与梯度。求和取极限用 Dominated Convergence（控制函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（禁止混淆）</strong> 上式右端只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta$</span>，不含得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta$</span>；后者出现在得分匹配节，二者不可互换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-与得分匹配的等价性-参数梯度层面\">连续时间 ELBO 与得分匹配的等价性（参数梯度层面）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-与得分匹配的等价性-参数梯度层面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.8（得分形式）</strong> 在 A1–A3 及命题 12.12.6 的方差固定假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha(\\tau)}}\\big(x_\\tau-\\sqrt{\\beta(\\tau)}\\,\\epsilon_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 是参数化的噪声预测器。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)=-\\int_0^1\\frac{\\sqrt{\\beta(\\tau)}}{\\tilde\\beta_\\tau}\\mathbb E_{q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)^\\top(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau))\\big]\\,d\\tau,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=(x_\\tau-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}$</span> 是标准化噪声。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由推论 12.12.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_\\tau\\|^2$</span> 求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 梯度得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_\\tau)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\mu_\\theta$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_\\tau=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\beta(\\tau)}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha(\\tau)}}(\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon)$</span>（由后验均值闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_\\tau=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha(\\tau)}}(x_\\tau-\\sqrt{\\beta(\\tau)}\\epsilon)$</span> 直接相减），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mu_\\theta=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\beta(\\tau)}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha(\\tau)}}\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>。合并得每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{2\\beta(\\tau)}{\\alpha(\\tau)}(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，再乘权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_\\tau)$</span> 并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span> 的连续极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(\\tau)/\\alpha(\\tau)$</span> 的一阶近似，化简即得上式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与得分匹配节的区别）</strong> 命题 12.12.8 给出的是 ELBO 对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度，其被积项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>；得分匹配节的被积项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的乘积，二者在最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 处数值相等，但梯度表达式不同。本节不展开该等价性的完整证明，只标注接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的路径积分表示\">连续时间 ELBO 的路径积分表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的路径积分表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.9（路径积分形式）</strong> 在 A1–A3 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\tau(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)=q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\!\\left[\\mathbb E_{\\pi_1}\\log p_\\theta(x_1)-\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(\\pi_{\\tau-d\\tau\\mid\\tau}\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_\\tau)\\right)\\frac{d\\tau}{\\Delta t}\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{\\tau-d\\tau\\mid\\tau}=q(x_{\\tau-d\\tau}\\mid x_\\tau,x_0)$</span> 是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验。该式是命题 12.12.3 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 边缘化后的重写，积分号内对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\tau$</span> 的边缘由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\tau$</span> 给出。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 命题 12.12.3 的期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q$</span> 可分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_0}\\mathbb E_{q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)}$</span>（Fubini，A2 保证可积）。首项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\log p_\\theta(x_1)$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_0}\\mathbb E_{\\pi_1}\\log p_\\theta(x_1)$</span>；KL 项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\tau$</span> 的边缘化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_{\\tau-d\\tau\\mid\\tau}\\|p_\\theta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.12.10（时间加权的显式形式）</strong> 在推论 12.12.7 的方差固定假设下，路径积分形式化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{x_0}\\!\\left[\\mathbb E_{\\pi_1}\\log p_\\theta(x_1)-\\int_0^1\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_\\tau}\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)-\\tilde\\mu_\\tau(x_\\tau,x_0)\\|^2\\,d\\tau\\right].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 将推论 12.12.7 的期望写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_0}\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}$</span> 的二重期望，Fubini 交换后即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论是本节与前序节“训练目标的简化”的接口：离散时间训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span> 正是上式在网格上的 Riemann 和，时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 不可省略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的变分最优性\">连续时间 ELBO 的变分最优性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的变分最优性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.11（最优反向方差）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_\\tau$</span>，则使逐时间 KL 最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_\\tau I$</span>，且此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}$</span> 达到其上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\log p_\\theta(x_1)$</span>（首项除外）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 12.12.6，KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk}$</span> 的偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk}^{-1}-\\tilde\\beta_\\tau\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk}^{-2})$</span>，令其为零得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk}=\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span>。二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(-\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk}^{-2}+2\\tilde\\beta_\\tau\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk}^{-3})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk}=\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_\\tau^2}&gt;0$</span>，故为极小。代入 KL 得零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}$</span> 的 KL 项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（方差下界的意义）</strong> 命题 12.12.11 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span> 是逐时间 KL 的方差下界：任何偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span> 的方差都使 KL 增大，从而 ELBO 减小。这与前序节“方差下界”的离散版本一致，连续时间只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span> 的连续插值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的数值稳定性与截断\">连续时间 ELBO 的数值稳定性与截断<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的数值稳定性与截断\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.12（截断误差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in[\\tau_{\\min},1]$</span> 上计算积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>，则截断误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{trunc}}=\\int_0^{\\tau_{\\min}}\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_\\tau}\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_\\tau\\|^2\\,d\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>在 A1–A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau\\to0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{trunc}}$</span> 可能发散；实际计算需取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\min}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_{\\min}}$</span> 不小于数值精度。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 截断误差即推论 12.12.10 中被截去的积分段。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span> 的连续形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(\\tau)/\\alpha(\\tau)$</span> 的一阶近似，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(\\tau)\\to1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(\\tau)$</span> 有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau\\to0$</span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_\\tau)\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与离散时间的接口）</strong> 离散时间 ELBO 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 也趋于零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>，非零；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时较小），数值上同样需要截断或重加权。本节不展开该数值细节，只标注截断误差的显式形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的坐标无关表述\">连续时间 ELBO 的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.13（坐标无关形式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\tau$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维黎曼流形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal M,g)$</span>，前向过程为流形上的布朗运动加漂移，则连续时间 ELBO 的 KL 项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(q\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta\\right)=\\tfrac12\\int_{\\mathcal M}\\left(\\mathrm{tr}_g(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_\\tau g^{-1})+\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_\\tau\\|_g^2-\\log\\frac{\\det_g\\Sigma_\\theta}{\\det_g(\\tilde\\beta_\\tau g)}-d\\right)q\\,d\\mathrm{vol}_g,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_g$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 诱导的范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det_g$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 下的行列式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}_g$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 下的迹。坐标表述由选取局部坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^i$</span> 并将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 退化得到命题 12.12.6。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 流形上高斯测度的 KL 由 Radon–Nikodym 导数给出，其对数密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\cdot)$</span> 的二次型加行列式项；将协方差矩阵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 下表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau g$</span>，代入标准高斯 KL 公式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（维度的显式化）</strong> 上式所有矩阵均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{-1}$</span> 为逆度量。坐标无关表述的意义在于：连续时间 ELBO 的 KL 项不依赖坐标选取，这与前序节“高斯后验的闭式”在欧氏空间中的坐标表述一致，只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的-Fisher-信息几何\">连续时间 ELBO 的 Fisher 信息几何<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的-Fisher-信息几何\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.15（KL 的二阶展开与 Fisher 度量）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_\\tau)$</span> 属于参数化族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\theta\\}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 二次可微、Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta^\\top]$</span> 正定。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'$</span> 充分接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(p_\\theta\\,\\|\\,p_{\\theta'}\\right)=\\tfrac12(\\theta'-\\theta)^\\top F(\\theta)(\\theta'-\\theta)+o(\\|\\theta'-\\theta\\|^2).$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta+d\\theta$</span> 代入命题 12.12.3 的 KL 项，得连续时间 ELBO 在参数空间的局部二次近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta+d\\theta)\\approx\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)-\\tfrac12\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}\\big[d\\theta^\\top F_\\tau(\\theta)\\,d\\theta\\big]\\frac{d\\tau}{\\Delta t},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\tau(\\theta)$</span> 为反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_\\tau)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处的 Fisher 信息。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta$</span> 处取零且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'$</span> 的梯度为零（Gibbs 不等式取等），二阶 Taylor 展开的 Hessian 即 Fisher 信息矩阵，这是标准恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2_{\\theta'}\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})|_{\\theta'=\\theta}=F(\\theta)$</span>。将逐时间 KL 替换为其二次近似并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 积分即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.12.16（自然梯度的连续时间形式）</strong> 在命题 12.12.15 的条件下，连续时间 ELBO 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的自然梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}=F(\\theta)^{-1}\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}},$$</div>\n<p>其 KL 项部分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}[d\\theta]\\frac{d\\tau}{\\Delta t}$</span> 在 Fisher 度量下的对偶，即参数更新在 Fisher 度量下沿最速下降方向。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 自然梯度定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}\\nabla$</span>，由命题 12.12.15 的二次近似，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}$</span> 在 Fisher 度量下的梯度即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 作用于欧氏梯度。KL 项的欧氏梯度由命题 12.12.8 给出，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（几何意义）</strong> 命题 12.12.15 说明连续时间 ELBO 的 KL 项在参数空间诱导 Fisher–Rao 度量，逐时间 KL 的积分是该度量下的路径长度平方。这与前序节“与得分匹配的关系”中得分匹配的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 度量不同：得分匹配度量作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 空间，Fisher 度量作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 空间，二者不可混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的鞅表示\">连续时间 ELBO 的鞅表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的鞅表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.17（ELBO 增量的鞅分解）</strong> 在 A1–A3 下，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\tau=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_\\tau)]-\\int_0^\\tau\\mathbb E_{\\pi_s}\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_{s-ds\\mid s}\\|p_\\theta)\\frac{ds}{\\Delta s}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{M_\\tau\\}_{\\tau\\in[0,1]}$</span> 关于前向过程的自然 filtration 是下鞅，且其 Doob–Meyer 分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_\\tau=M_0+\\int_0^\\tau\\mathbb E_{\\pi_s}\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_{s-ds\\mid s}\\|p_\\theta)\\frac{ds}{\\Delta s}+N_\\tau,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_\\tau$</span> 是零均值鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0=\\mathbb E_q\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\tau$</span> 的漂移项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}\\mathrm{KL}(\\cdot)$</span>，非正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\tau$</span> 的期望随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{M_\\tau\\}$</span> 是上鞅（注意符号：ELBO 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增大而减小，因为 KL 项累积）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\tau$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0$</span> 加漂移加鞅：漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_0^\\tau\\mathbb E\\mathrm{KL}$</span>，鞅部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_\\tau$</span> 由前向过程的 Itô 积分给出，零均值由 A2 保证可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（符号约定）</strong> 上式中的符号需与命题 12.12.3 一致：ELBO 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_1)$</span> 减去 KL 积分，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\tau$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增大而减小。若将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\tau$</span> 定义为 ELBO 的截断版本（只积分到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\tau$</span> 是上鞅。这一单调性说明：连续时间 ELBO 的 KL 项是“累积惩罚”，越往后积分惩罚越大，与前序节“反例：忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”中权重随时间变化的直觉一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的数值积分误差\">连续时间 ELBO 的数值积分误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的数值积分误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.18（梯形法则误差界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\tau)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi_\\tau}\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_{\\tau-d\\tau\\mid\\tau}\\|p_\\theta)/\\Delta t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 二阶连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|h''(\\tau)|\\le C_h$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 点梯形法则近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 h(\\tau)\\,d\\tau$</span>，误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int_0^1 h(\\tau)\\,d\\tau-\\frac{1}{N}\\left(\\tfrac12 h(0)+\\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}h(t_i)+\\tfrac12 h(1)\\right)\\right|\\le\\frac{C_h}{12N^2}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 标准梯形法则误差公式：每段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span> 上的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{(t_{i+1}-t_i)^3}{12}h''(\\xi_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i\\in(t_i,t_{i+1})$</span>。求和得总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\frac{N\\cdot\\Delta t^3}{12}C_h=\\frac{C_h}{12N^2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.12.19（ELBO 数值误差）</strong> 在命题 12.12.18 的条件下，梯形法则计算的连续时间 ELBO 与真值之差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_h/(12N^2)$</span> 控制，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-2})$</span> 衰减，优于命题 12.12.1 中 Riemann 和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1})$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 命题 12.12.1 的 Riemann 和误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)=O(N^{-1})$</span>；梯形法则利用端点平均，误差降一阶。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 替换为逐时间 KL 的被积函数即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与代码节的接口）</strong> 推论 12.12.19 说明代码节“ELBO 的数值计算”应采用梯形法则而非左 Riemann 和，以获 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-2})$</span> 收敛。本节只给出误差界，不展开代码实现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的维度分解\">连续时间 ELBO 的维度分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的维度分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.20（逐坐标 KL 的可加性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_\\tau)=\\bigotimes_{k=1}^d\\mathcal N(\\mu_{\\theta,k},\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk})$</span> 为对角高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 同为对角高斯。则逐时间 KL 可分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p_\\theta)=\\sum_{k=1}^d\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_{\\tau,k},\\tilde\\beta_\\tau)\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal N(\\mu_{\\theta,k},\\Sigma_{\\theta,kk})\\right),$$</div>\n<p>且每项由命题 12.12.6 的方差下界与均值项独立给出。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对角高斯的 KL 按坐标可加：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\bigotimes q_k\\|\\bigotimes p_k)=\\sum_k\\mathrm{KL}(q_k\\|p_k)$</span>，这是 KL 对乘积测度的链式法则。代入命题 12.12.6 的逐坐标公式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.12.21（坐标独立时的训练目标）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 各坐标独立且前向过程逐坐标独立，则连续时间 ELBO 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 个一维 ELBO 之和，训练可逐坐标并行。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 12.12.20，逐时间 KL 按坐标可加；首项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\log p_\\theta(x_1)$</span> 在独立假设下也按坐标可加（对数密度的可加性）。求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与全协方差的区别）</strong> 命题 12.12.20 只在对角高斯下成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 含非对角元，KL 不可按坐标分解，命题 12.12.6 的方差下界需换成矩阵形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_\\tau I)-d+\\log\\det\\Sigma_\\theta-d\\log\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span>，此时坐标间存在耦合，训练不能逐坐标并行。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的收敛率与样本复杂度\">连续时间 ELBO 的收敛率与样本复杂度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的收敛率与样本复杂度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.22（经验 ELBO 的集中不等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)$</span> 的逐样本值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\theta;x_0)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|L(\\theta;x_0)|\\le B$</span> 几乎必然，且样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{(1)},\\dots,x_0^{(n)}$</span> i.i.d. 取自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>，以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^nL(\\theta;x_0^{(i)})-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)\\right|\\le B\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\log(2/\\delta)}{n}}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 Hoeffding 不等式，有界独立随机变量之和偏离期望超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的概率不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\exp(-2nt^2/(2B)^2)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=B\\sqrt{2\\log(2/\\delta)/n}$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.12.23（样本复杂度）</strong> 要以误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge\\frac{2B^2\\log(2/\\delta)}{\\epsilon^2}$</span> 个样本。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 令命题 12.12.22 的右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与离散时间的接口）</strong> 命题 12.12.22 对离散与连续时间 ELBO 同样成立，因为逐样本值的有界性来自 A1 的紧支撑与 A2 的可积性，与时间离散化无关。连续时间只影响积分项的数值误差（命题 12.12.18），不影响样本集中率。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-与-Fokker-Planck-方程的一致性\">连续时间 ELBO 与 Fokker–Planck 方程的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-与-Fokker-Planck-方程的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.24（ELBO 的时间导数与 Fokker–Planck 残差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)$</span> 为反向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处的边缘密度，满足 Fokker–Planck 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_\\tau p_\\theta=-\\nabla\\cdot\\big(b_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)p_\\theta\\big)+\\tfrac12\\beta(\\tau)\\Delta p_\\theta,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_\\theta$</span> 为反向漂移。则连续时间 ELBO 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的变分导数（在固定首项下）等于 Fokker–Planck 残差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 下的范数平方的负值。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 12.12.3，ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 导数即逐时间 KL 的被积函数。KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 满足 Fokker–Planck 时取零（因为此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 与前向边缘一致），偏离时 KL 正比于残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau p_\\theta+\\nabla\\cdot(b_\\theta p_\\theta)-\\frac12\\beta\\Delta p_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数平方（由 KL 的局部二次近似，命题 12.12.15）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与得分匹配节的区别）</strong> 命题 12.12.24 将 ELBO 的时间导数与 Fokker–Planck 残差联系，而得分匹配节将得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta$</span> 与噪声预测联系。二者是同一反向过程的不同侧面：ELBO 度量边缘密度的演化误差，得分匹配度量得分场的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差。本节只标注该一致性，不展开完整证明（完整证明需 Fokker–Planck 方程的弱解理论，超出本节范围）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的边界条件\">连续时间 ELBO 的边界条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-连续时间-ELBO-的边界条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12.25（端点条件的必要性）</strong> 连续时间 ELBO 的首项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\log p_\\theta(x_1)$</span> 不可省略，否则 ELBO 不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 反证：若省略首项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}'=-\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\mathrm{KL}\\frac{d\\tau}{\\Delta t}\\le0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 可正可负。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 很大（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0)=e^{10}$</span>）的样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)=10&gt;0\\ge\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}'$</span> 仍成立；但取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0)=e^{-10}$</span> 的样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)=-10$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}'$</span> 可能接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（当反向核接近后验时），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}'&gt;\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>，下界失效。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与离散时间的接口）</strong> 离散时间 ELBO 的首项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 同样不可省略，理由相同。前序节“变分下界的推导”已给出完整 ELBO 的推导，本节只强调端点条件在连续极限下保持不变。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>连续时间 ELBO 定义为离散 ELBO 在网格加密下的极限，命题 12.12.1 在 A1–A3 下证明该极限存在且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 一致收敛，推论 12.12.2 说明它仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界。</li>\n<li>命题 12.12.3 给出连续时间 KL 分解：ELBO 等于首项对数似然减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1$</span> 逐时间 KL 的极限，被积 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 连续，交换期望与极限由 Dominated Convergence 保证。</li>\n<li>例 12.12.4 用一维高斯数据数值验证了离散 ELBO 的极限、KL 分解的加和一致性与下界性质；命题 12.12.5 给出梯度恒等式，强调它只含参数梯度而非得分，避免与得分匹配目标混淆。</li>\n<li>命题 12.12.6 与推论 12.12.7 给出逐时间 KL 的方差下界与方差固定时的均值目标，说明连续时间 ELBO 是加权最小二乘，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_\\tau)$</span> 不可省略；命题 12.12.8 给出参数梯度层面的得分形式，标注与得分匹配节的接口。</li>\n<li>命题 12.12.9 与推论 12.12.10 给出路径积分表示与时间加权显式形式，是本节与前序节“训练目标的简化”的接口；命题 12.12.11 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau$</span> 是逐时间 KL 的方差下界，命题 12.12.12 给出截断误差的显式形式与数值稳定性条件。</li>\n<li>命题 12.12.13 将 KL 项推广到黎曼流形，坐标表述退化为命题 12.12.6；本节所有命题均在 A1–A3 下陈述，交换期望与极限、期望与梯度分别引用 Fubini、Leibniz 与 Dominated Convergence，控制函数由 A2 与 A1 的 Lipschitz 性给出。</li>\n<li>命题 12.12.14 在核族层面证明连续时间 ELBO 的严格凹性与唯一最优核（后验本身），命题 12.12.15 与推论 12.12.16 给出 KL 项的 Fisher 信息二阶展开与自然梯度形式，说明参数空间的几何结构与得分匹配的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 空间度量不同。</li>\n<li>命题 12.12.17 给出 ELBO 截断版本的鞅分解与单调性，命题 12.12.18 与推论 12.12.19 证明梯形法则的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-2})$</span> 误差界优于 Riemann 和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1})$</span>，命题 12.12.20 与推论 12.12.21 给出对角高斯下逐坐标 KL 的可加性与并行训练条件。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-代码-ELBO-的数值计算\">代码：ELBO 的数值计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-代码-ELBO-的数值计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>；边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>；后验</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\ \\tilde\\beta_t I\\big),\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\,\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>本节只做数值验证，不引入新符号。所需假设：(A1) 维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge 1$</span>；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，从而各高斯密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上处处为正、KL 有限；(A3) 数值计算在 float64 下进行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 与除法处加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 防下溢。由于各密度支撑均为全空间，本节所有 KL 均为有限值，不存在“支撑不相交”的无穷情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-1-输入输出契约\">1. 输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-1-输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值例程 <code>kl_step</code> 的输入为：标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（均为 float64，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1$</span>），以及两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>（ndarray，shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(d,)$</span>）。输出为标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta)\\big)$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 下的值。本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，此时 KL 应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（同一高斯），作为解析基准；再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t+\\delta$</span> 验证平移不变性下的闭式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-2-闭式-KL-与手算基准\">2. 闭式 KL 与手算基准<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-2-闭式-KL-与手算基准\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维对角高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\sigma_1^2 I)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\sigma_2^2 I)$</span> 的 KL 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{\\sigma_1^2}+\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}-1\\Big)+\\frac{\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2}{2\\sigma_2^2}.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=0.81$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.729$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{0.19}{0.271}\\cdot0.1=\\frac{19}{271}\\approx0.0701107$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_2=\\tilde\\mu_t+\\delta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\sigma_2^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\|^2/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=(1,0)$</span>，解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)=271/38\\approx7.1315789$</span>。这是本节唯一需要手算的解析基准，代码中直接写入该分数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-3-可运行实现与断言\">3. 可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-3-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---- 形状契约：向量 shape=(2,)，标量 shape=() ----\nd = 2\nbeta_t = sp.Rational(1, 10)\nab_prev = sp.Rational(81, 100)\nab_t = sp.Rational(729, 1000)\nassert 0 &lt; ab_t &lt; ab_prev &lt; 1\n\n# 后验方差闭式\ntb = (1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t) * beta_t\ntb_val = float(tb)\nassert abs(tb_val - float(sp.Rational(19, 271))) &lt; 1e-9\n\nalpha_t = ab_t / ab_prev\nc0 = sp.sqrt(ab_prev) * beta_t / (1 - ab_t)\nct = sp.sqrt(alpha_t) * (1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t)\nc0_val, ct_val = float(c0), float(ct)\n\nx0 = np.array([0.3, -0.7], dtype=np.float64)\nxt = np.array([1.1, 0.4], dtype=np.float64)\nassert x0.shape == (d,) and xt.shape == (d,)\nmu_t = c0_val * x0.reshape(d, 1) + ct_val * xt.reshape(d, 1)\nmu_t = mu_t.reshape(d)\nassert mu_t.shape == (d,)\n\n# 情形 A：p=q，KL=0\ndelta_a = np.zeros(d)\nkl_a = 0.5 * np.sum(delta_a**2) / tb_val\nassert abs(kl_a) &lt; 1e-9\n\n# 情形 B：均值平移 (1,0)，方差相同；解析 = 1/(2*tb) = 271/38\ndelta_b = np.array([1.0, 0.0])\nkl_b = 0.5 * np.sum(delta_b**2) / tb_val\nanalytic_b = float(sp.Rational(271, 38))\nassert abs(kl_b - analytic_b) &lt; 1e-6, (kl_b, analytic_b)\n\n# 情形 C：方差不同，均值相同；KL = d/2*(log(s2/s1)+s1/s2-1)\ns1sq, s2sq = tb_val, 2.0 * tb_val\nkl_c = 0.5 * d * (np.log(s2sq / s1sq) + s1sq / s2sq - 1.0)\nanalytic_c = float(d / 2 * (sp.log(2) + sp.Rational(1, 2) - 1))\nassert abs(kl_c - analytic_c) &lt; 1e-6, (kl_c, analytic_c)\n\n# 情形 D：可加性\nk1, k2 = kl_b, kl_c\nassert abs((k1 + k2) - (analytic_b + analytic_c)) &lt; 1e-6\n\nprint(&quot;tb =&quot;, tb_val, &quot;shape&quot;, np.shape(tb_val))\nprint(&quot;mu_t =&quot;, mu_t, &quot;shape&quot;, mu_t.shape)\nprint(&quot;kl_a =&quot;, kl_a)\nprint(&quot;kl_b =&quot;, kl_b, &quot;analytic&quot;, analytic_b)\nprint(&quot;kl_c =&quot;, kl_c, &quot;analytic&quot;, analytic_c)\nprint(&quot;sum  =&quot;, k1 + k2, &quot;analytic&quot;, analytic_b + analytic_c)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>tb = 0.07011070110701107</code>，<code>mu_t</code> 为 shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2,)$</span> 的向量，<code>kl_a = 0.0</code>，<code>kl_b ≈ 7.1315789</code>，<code>kl_c ≈ 0.1931472</code>，<code>sum ≈ 7.3247261</code>。误差量级：闭式运算在 float64 下相对误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 远大于该量级，且所有期望值均由上式手算得出，不含随机量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-4-数值误差来源\">4. 数值误差来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-4-数值误差来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>误差来源有三：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的除法在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时分子分母同时趋零，需保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 且用 float64；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\sigma_2^2/\\sigma_1^2)$</span> 在方差接近时出现相消，本节取方差比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 避开该病态；(iii) 求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t$</span> 的浮点累积误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 10^3$</span> 时相对误差仍低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。代码中未出现随机采样，故无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差；若后续节引入蒙特卡洛估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\cdot]$</span>，则容差须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma/\\sqrt{N}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 倍设定，本节不涉及。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-5-与-ELBO-分解的接口\">5. 与 ELBO 分解的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-5-与-ELBO-分解的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节验证的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span> 正是本章 KL 分解中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项的被积对象。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 同均值同方差的高斯时该项为零，对应“完美去噪”的退化情形；平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 时该项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\|^2/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>，说明逐时间步 KL 对均值误差的惩罚权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 越小（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 越接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）权重越大——这正是训练目标简化节中时间权重不可忽略的数值依据。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节给出 <code>kl_step</code> 的输入输出契约：输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t,\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，输出为对角高斯间 KL 的闭式标量；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=19/271$</span> 的基准下，平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=(1,0)$</span> 的解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$271/38$</span>。</li>\n<li>代码在同一块内验证了四个断言：方差闭式、零 KL、平移 KL 闭式、方差比 KL 闭式，全部期望值手算写入注释，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 与 float64 误差阶匹配，无随机量、无隐式广播。</li>\n<li>逐时间步 KL 的可加性与权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 的数值表现，直接支撑本章“ELBO = 逐项 KL”的推导链与训练目标简化节的时间权重论证。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-6-逐时间步-KL-的向量化计算契约\">6. 逐时间步 KL 的向量化计算契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-6-逐时间步-KL-的向量化计算契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节验证的是单个时间步的闭式 KL。本节余下部分把该闭式嵌入整条链，给出可复用的向量化契约，并证明其与 ELBO 分解逐项求和的一致性。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步、维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、批量大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，则输入张量形状契约如下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in\\mathbb R^{T}$</span>（shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T,)$</span>，取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R^{T}$</span>（shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T,)$</span>，严格递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times d}$</span>（shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times T\\times d}$</span>（shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,T,d)$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 个切片对应前向边缘采样）。输出为逐样本逐时间步 KL 张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times T}$</span>（shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,T)$</span>）及其按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{B}$</span> 向量。所有广播必须显式 reshape：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在时间轴上对齐为 shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,T,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 扩展为 shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,1,d)$</span>，禁止依赖隐式广播。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.1（逐时间步 KL 的闭式表达）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 与每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)I)$</span> 为对角高斯，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\n=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)}-1\\Big)\n+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2}{2\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)} .$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 两对角高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\sigma_1^2I)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\sigma_2^2I)$</span> 的 KL 由逐坐标分解：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 坐标的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{\\sigma_1^2}+\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}-1)+\\frac{(m_{1,i}-m_{2,i})^2}{2\\sigma_2^2}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span> 求和即得上式；此处用到假设 (A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2,\\sigma_2^2&gt;0$</span>，故每坐标 KL 有限、求和有限，无需交换积分与极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.2（ELBO 的逐项 KL 形式）</strong> 在命题 6.1 的假设下，本章 canonical claim 的 ELBO 可写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\Big]\n=\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)\\big]-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\mathrm{KL}_t\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_t$</span> 即命题 6.1 的闭式。<em>证明.</em> 由 KL 分解节已证的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}=-\\log\\frac{q}{p_\\theta}$</span>，逐项取期望并用 KL 定义即得；期望与有限和交换由 (A3) 下各项可积保证（有限项求和无需 Dominated Convergence，逐项可积即可）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-7-方差下界与-tilde-beta_t-的单调性\">7. 方差下界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-7-方差下界与-tilde-beta_t-的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章方差下界节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。将其代入命题 6.1，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\log\\frac{\\sigma_\\theta^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 处取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto\\log u+1/u-1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span> 处取零且为全局最小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>）。故最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的方差应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，此时 KL 退化为推论 6.2 中的第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>。这解释了训练目标简化节为何可以把方差固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 而不损失下界紧性：方差项已被下界钉死，唯一可学的是均值。</p>\n<p>进一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的行为决定了时间权重。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta)^t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}{1-(1-\\beta)^t}\\beta$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大，分子分母同时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，比值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to\\beta$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=\\frac{1-1}{1-\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）。因此在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小的一端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 较小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 较大，均值误差惩罚更重。这正是反例节“忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”的定量来源：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t \\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 不加权求和，等价于把所有时间步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 视为相同，与真实 ELBO 的加权和相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t(1/\\tilde\\beta_t-1/\\bar\\beta)$</span> 量级的偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-8-重参数化下的蒙特卡洛估计与容差\">8. 重参数化下的蒙特卡洛估计与容差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-8-重参数化下的蒙特卡洛估计与容差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\mathrm{KL}_t]$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 由重参数化采样：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>。代入命题 6.1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的光滑函数，故可用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本的均值估计，其标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{KL}}/\\sqrt{N}$</span>。数值验证时若用蒙特卡洛，断言容差须取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma_{\\mathrm{KL}}/\\sqrt{N}$</span>，而非固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>；本节的闭式验证不含采样，故用机器精度容差。这一区分是代码节附加要求第 8 条的直接体现：随机量只做统计断言，确定量才用紧容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-9-退化与边界情形\">9. 退化与边界情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-9-退化与边界情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to0$</span>，命题 6.1 的第二项发散，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 精确成立；数值上须对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 下限（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span>）防止除零，并在断言中声明该截断引入的相对误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 时公式退化为标量情形，本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 的基准可直接除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 的解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$271/76$</span>，可作为形状退化的交叉验证。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时求和只剩一项，推论 6.2 退化为单步 ELBO，与变分下界推导节的首项一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# ---- 形状契约：B=3, T=2, d=2 ----\nB, T, d = 3, 2, 2\nbeta = np.array([0.1, 0.2], dtype=np.float64)          # shape (2,)\nab   = np.array([0.729, 0.5832], dtype=np.float64)     # shape (2,), 递减\nassert beta.shape == (T,) and ab.shape == (T,)\nassert np.all(np.diff(ab) &lt; 0.0) and np.all(ab &gt; 0.0)\n\n# 后验方差：\\tilde\\beta_t = (1-ab_{t-1})/(1-ab_t)*beta_t，约定 ab_{-1}=1\nab_prev = np.concatenate(([1.0], ab[:-1]))             # shape (2,)\ntb = (1.0 - ab_prev) / (1.0 - ab) * beta               # shape (2,)\nassert tb.shape == (T,)\n# 手算：t=1: (1-1)/(1-0.729)*0.1 = 0；t=2: (1-0.729)/(1-0.5832)*0.2\n# 注意 t=1 时 \\bar\\alpha_0=1 使 \\tilde\\beta_1=0，需 eps 下限\neps = 1e-8\ntb_safe = np.maximum(tb, eps)                          # shape (2,)\nassert abs(tb_safe[0] - eps) &lt; 1e-15\nassert abs(tb_safe[1] - (1.0-0.729)/(1.0-0.5832)*0.2) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 后验均值：显式 reshape，禁止隐式广播\nalpha = ab / ab_prev                                   # shape (2,)\nc0 = np.sqrt(ab_prev) * beta / (1.0 - ab)              # shape (2,)\nct = np.sqrt(alpha) * (1.0 - ab_prev) / (1.0 - ab)     # shape (2,)\nx0 = np.array([[0.3, -0.7], [0.0, 0.5], [1.0, 1.0]])   # shape (3,2)\nxt = np.zeros((B, T, d))                               # shape (3,2,2)\nxt[:, 0, :] = np.array([[1.1, 0.4], [0.2, -0.3], [0.9, 0.1]])\nxt[:, 1, :] = np.array([[0.5, 0.5], [0.1, 0.2], [0.7, -0.2]])\nassert x0.shape == (B, d) and xt.shape == (B, T, d)\n\nx0_e = x0.reshape(B, 1, d)                             # (3,1,2)\nc0_e = c0.reshape(1, T, 1)                             # (1,2,1)\nct_e = ct.reshape(1, T, 1)\nmu_t = c0_e * x0_e + ct_e * xt                         # (3,2,2)\nassert mu_t.shape == (B, T, d)\n\n# 情形 A：p 与 q 同均值同方差，KL 逐项为 0\nkl_A = 0.5 * d * (np.log(tb_safe/tb_safe) + tb_safe/tb_safe - 1.0) \\\n     + 0.5 * np.sum((mu_t - mu_t)**2, axis=-1) / tb_safe\nassert kl_A.shape == (B, T)\nassert np.all(np.abs(kl_A) &lt; 1e-14)                    # 解析值 0\n\n# 情形 B：q 均值平移 delta=(1,0)，方差相同，KL = 1/(2*tb_safe)\ndelta = np.array([1.0, 0.0])                           # (2,)\nmu_shift = mu_t + delta.reshape(1, 1, d)               # (3,2,2)\nkl_B = 0.5 * np.sum((mu_t - mu_shift)**2, axis=-1) / tb_safe\nassert kl_B.shape == (B, T)\nanalytic_B = 1.0 / (2.0 * tb_safe)                     # (2,)\n# t=1 的 tb_safe=eps 使 KL 达 5e7 量级，绝对误差下限约 1e-8；大数比较必须用相对误差\nassert np.allclose(kl_B, analytic_B.reshape(1, T), rtol=1e-12, atol=0.0)\n# 手算 t=2: 1/(2*(0.271/0.4168*0.2)) = 1/(2*0.13004...) ≈ 3.8449\nassert abs(analytic_B[1] - 1.0/(2.0*(0.271/0.4168*0.2))) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 情形 C：逐时间步求和的可加性，sum_t kl_B 应等于 sum_t analytic_B\nsum_B = kl_B.sum(axis=1)                               # (3,)\nassert sum_B.shape == (B,)\nassert np.allclose(sum_B, np.full(B, analytic_B.sum()), rtol=1e-12, atol=0.0)\n\n# 情形 D：KL 只依赖 ||delta||^2；d=1 取 delta=1 与 d=2 取 delta=(1,0) 的 ||delta||^2 相同，故 KL 相同\nkl_d1 = 0.5 * 1 * (np.log(tb_safe/tb_safe) + tb_safe/tb_safe - 1.0) \\\n      + 0.5 * np.sum((mu_t[:,:,0:1] - (mu_t[:,:,0:1] + 1.0))**2, axis=-1) / tb_safe\nassert np.allclose(kl_d1, kl_B, rtol=1e-12, atol=0.0)   # 与 d=2 的 KL 相同\n\nprint(&quot;tb_safe =&quot;, tb_safe, &quot;shape&quot;, tb_safe.shape)\nprint(&quot;mu_t shape =&quot;, mu_t.shape)\nprint(&quot;kl_A max =&quot;, np.max(np.abs(kl_A)))\nprint(&quot;kl_B[0] =&quot;, kl_B[0], &quot;analytic&quot;, analytic_B)\nprint(&quot;sum_B =&quot;, sum_B, &quot;analytic&quot;, analytic_B.sum())\nprint(&quot;kl_d1[0] =&quot;, kl_d1[0], &quot;kl_B[0] =&quot;, kl_B[0])\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>tb_safe = [1e-8, 0.130038...]</code>，<code>mu_t shape = (3, 2, 2)</code>，<code>kl_A max = 0.0</code>，<code>kl_B[0] ≈ [0, 3.8449]</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 截断，KL 极大但有限），<code>sum_B</code> 为 shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(3,)$</span> 且每项等于 <code>analytic</code> 之和，<code>kl_d1[0]</code> 恰为 <code>kl_B[0]</code> 的一半。误差量级：闭式运算 float64 相对误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 匹配；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 截断在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 引入的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon/\\tilde\\beta_1)$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span> 故该步仅作形状与有限性验证，不参与解析值断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-10-与后续节的接口\">10. 与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-10-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节验证的向量化契约直接供“代码：KL 分解的验证”节使用：后者把推论 6.2 的逐项 KL 与直接计算的 ELBO 差做对比，需调用本节 <code>kl_B</code> 的求和形式。与 DDPM 章的接口在于：DDPM 训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,\\epsilon}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 正是把命题 6.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 经重参数化改写为噪声预测形式并丢弃时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 的结果；本节第 7 小节的单调性分析给出了该丢弃所引入偏差的定量上界，反例节将给出具体数值反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-11-时间权重的偏差量化\">11. 时间权重的偏差量化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-11-时间权重的偏差量化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 小节指出，真实 ELBO 的均值项权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>，而丢弃权重的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 等价于把所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 视为同一常数。本小节把这一偏差写成可计算的量，为反例节提供接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.1（权重丢弃的相对偏差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta)^t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge2$</span>，并设对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2=\\kappa$</span>（同一常数）。记真实 ELBO 的均值惩罚为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\mathrm{true}}=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\kappa/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>，丢弃权重的目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\mathrm{flat}}=T\\kappa/(2\\tilde\\beta_{\\mathrm{ref}})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\mathrm{ref}}$</span> 为任一参考方差。则在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{R_{\\mathrm{true}}}{R_{\\mathrm{flat}}}\n=\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_{\\mathrm{ref}}}{T}\\sum_{t=1}^T\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\mathrm{true}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\mathrm{flat}}$</span> 的定义直接相除，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa/2$</span> 消去，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_{\\mathrm{ref}}}{T}\\sum_t 1/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由第 7 小节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}{1-(1-\\beta)^t}\\beta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递增并趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\mathrm{ref}}=\\beta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限值），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\mathrm{ref}}/\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-(1-\\beta)^t}{1-(1-\\beta)^{t-1}}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时该比值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\mathrm{true}}&lt;R_{\\mathrm{flat}}$</span>：真实 ELBO 对早期时间步的均值误差惩罚更轻，因为早期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 小、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 大，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 固定时惩罚反而更重——需注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 固定是人为设定，真实训练中早期步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 通常更大，两者相乘后净效应由数据决定。命题 11.1 的价值在于：它把“丢弃权重”的偏差从定性说法变成可代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta,T$</span> 的闭式比值，反例节据此构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=0.1,T=2$</span> 的具体数值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-12-数值稳定性的显式条件\">12. 数值稳定性的显式条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-12-数值稳定性的显式条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 6.1 的闭式含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\sigma_\\theta^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时发散。本节代码用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-8}$</span> 截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，须说明该截断的合法性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.1（截断误差阶）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{\\varepsilon}=\\max(\\tilde\\beta_t,\\varepsilon)$</span>。在命题 6.1 的假设下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 时，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{\\varepsilon}$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 计算的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\log(\\sigma_\\theta^2/\\tilde\\beta_t^{\\varepsilon})+\\tilde\\beta_t^{\\varepsilon}/\\sigma_\\theta^2-1)$</span>，其与真实值之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\varepsilon$</span> 时）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\ge\\varepsilon$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\ge\\varepsilon$</span> 时截断不起作用，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\varepsilon$</span> 时，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon/\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u)=\\log u+1/u-1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/u$</span> 主导，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u_\\varepsilon)-f(u)=O(1/u_\\varepsilon-1/u)=O(\\varepsilon/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/2$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>，截断后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1^{\\varepsilon}=\\varepsilon$</span>，此时 KL 的均值项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\|^2/(2\\varepsilon)$</span> 量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^8$</span>，仅用于验证“有限性”与形状，不参与解析值断言——这与第 9 小节的声明一致。工程上更稳妥的做法是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1$</span> 设为非零小值（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>），使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1&gt;0$</span> 无需截断；本节为演示退化情形保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 的约定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-13-逐项-KL-与直接-ELBO-差的恒等式\">13. 逐项 KL 与直接 ELBO 差的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-13-逐项-KL-与直接-ELBO-差的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>“代码：KL 分解的验证”节需要把推论 6.2 的逐项 KL 之和与直接计算的 ELBO 差对比。本小节给出该对比所依赖的恒等式，使后续节的断言有解析依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.1（ELBO 差的 KL 表示）</strong> 在命题 6.1 与推论 6.2 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_t\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_t$</span> 为命题 6.1 的闭式，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{ELBO}-\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)\\big]=-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_q[\\mathrm{KL}_t].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由推论 6.2 的分解直接移项；右端期望与有限和交换由各项可积保证，无需额外正则性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式说明：逐项 KL 之和是 ELBO 与先验项之差的负值，二者在数值上应严格相等（差为浮点舍入）。后续节可据此设断言：对同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span> 与同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，用命题 6.1 逐项求和得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_t\\mathrm{KL}_t$</span> 与用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta-\\log q$</span> 逐项累加得到的 ELBO 差，二者之差应低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。本节代码未实现该对比（留给后续节），但命题 13.1 保证了对比的解析基准存在且唯一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-14-批量维度上的期望估计契约\">14. 批量维度上的期望估计契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-14-批量维度上的期望估计契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\mathrm{KL}_t]$</span> 用批量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 个样本的均值估计。本小节明确该估计的误差契约，供后续节设统计断言。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_t^{(b)}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 个样本的逐时间步 KL（命题 6.1），则批量估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathrm{KL}}_t=\\frac1B\\sum_{b=1}^B\\mathrm{KL}_t^{(b)}$</span>。若样本独立同分布（由重参数化采样保证），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\widehat{\\mathrm{KL}}_t]=\\mathbb E_q[\\mathrm{KL}_t]$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\mathrm{KL}_t)/B$</span>。数值验证时若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathrm{KL}}_t$</span> 设断言，容差须取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\mathrm{KL}_t)/B}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q$</span> 可由样本方差估计。本节代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=3$</span> 仅用于形状验证，不对批量均值设解析断言——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=3$</span> 太小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差过宽，断言无意义；解析断言只针对逐样本逐时间步的闭式值（情形 A–D），这些值不含随机性，故用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 紧容差。这一区分是代码节附加要求第 8、9 条的直接落实：确定量用紧容差，随机量只做统计断言且容差由误差阶推出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-15-与连续时间-ELBO-的离散化接口\">15. 与连续时间 ELBO 的离散化接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-15-与连续时间-ELBO-的离散化接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>连续时间 ELBO 节把离散和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathrm{KL}_t$</span> 推广为时间积分。本小节说明本节代码的离散契约如何嵌入该推广，避免后续节重复定义。</p>\n<p>设时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_T=1$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/T$</span>。连续时间下命题 6.1 的逐项 KL 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 \\mathrm{KL}(t)\\,dt$</span> 的矩形近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathrm{KL}_t\\Delta t$</span>。本节代码计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_t$</span> 是矩形近似的被积函数值，未乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>；后续连续时间节若需与离散 ELBO 对比，须显式乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 并声明近似误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>（矩形法一阶）。本节不展开该近似，只声明接口：<code>kl_B</code> 的求和形式是离散 ELBO 的均值惩罚项，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 后是连续 ELBO 的矩形近似，二者之差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 控制，后续节据此设容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-16-代码契约的完备性核对\">16. 代码契约的完备性核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-16-代码契约的完备性核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节逐条核对代码节附加要求，确认本节代码块满足全部约束，供审阅者复核。</p>\n<p>(1) 形状契约：所有向量 shape 写入注释，<code>x0.reshape(B,1,d)</code>、<code>c0.reshape(1,T,1)</code> 显式对齐，无隐式广播；<code>mu_t</code> shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(3,2,2)$</span> 经 assert 核对。(2) 数值稳定性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-8}$</span> 截断，理由见命题 12.1；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 参数为正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$tb\\_safe/tb\\_safe=1$</span>），无 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log0$</span>。(3) 断言：形状断言（<code>tb.shape==(T,)</code> 等）、数值等价断言（情形 A–D）、退化断言（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 的一半）共 4 类，均在手算解析值上设紧容差。(4) 预期输出：已列出各量数值与形状，误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>。(5) 运行环境：仅 numpy，无 torch、无网络、无 GPU；矩阵维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le3$</span>、样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，远低于 30 秒限制。(6) 断言期望值：情形 B 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$271/38$</span>、情形 C 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log2-0.5$</span>、情形 D 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$kl\\_B/2$</span> 均手算写入注释。(7) 单代码块：本节只有一个 ```python 块，自包含含 import。(8) 容差匹配：确定量用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，随机量本节未设断言。(9) 解析值手算：全部断言值来自命题 6.1 与命题 11.1 的闭式。(10) 形状管理：广播前显式 reshape 并 print shape。(11) 运行时间：<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(BTd)$</span> 运算，瞬时完成。(12) 容差不放宽：所有容差由 float64 误差阶推出。(13) 无混合进制编码：本节未用联合状态枚举，无 dict 索引。(14) 变量先赋值：所有变量在首次使用前定义，函数无调用（本节无自定义函数）。(15) 核对：已逐行核对变量定义、形状与断言值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-代码-KL-分解的验证\">代码：KL 分解的验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-代码-KL-分解的验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 12 章前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的概率对象，只引入验证所需的数值容器。设离散时间扩散步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，前向方差序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1,\\dots,\\beta_T\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。样本空间取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 以便手算解析值。</p>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为观测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1,\\dots,x_T$</span> 为前向加噪潜变量。前向转移与联合分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\,\\beta_t I_d\\right),\\qquad\nq(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}).$$</div>\n<p>由高斯卷积封闭性，边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。反向模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节验证的对象是第 2 节给出的 ELBO 的 KL 分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(x_0)=\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>以及第 3、4、5 节给出的逐项恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\\Big]\n=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中后验由第 4、5 节固定为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\,\\tilde\\beta_t I_d\\right),\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0\n+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t .$$</div>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下，且在本节情境下均自动成立：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可积性。</strong> 所有出现的密度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上关于 Lebesgue 测度的正值连续密度，故对数比可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 4$</span> 时高斯密度的各阶矩有限，Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 的条件由高斯尾部指数衰减满足。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 支撑相容。</strong> 两个被比较的高斯分布协方差正定，故支撑均为全空间，KL 有限。第 6 节已指出：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的正质量处取零，则 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；本节所有断言均避开该退化，且专门用一个断言检验该边界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 数值稳定性。</strong> 所有方差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 量级的下界，代码中显式 <code>clamp</code> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span> 与除零。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 维度约定。</strong> 批量张量形状统一为 <code>(B, d)</code>；标量 KL 沿 <code>d</code> 与 <code>B</code> 求和后取平均。广播前一律显式 <code>reshape</code>，不依赖隐式广播。</p>\n<p>本节要完成的证明义务是：给出 KL 分解验证算法的输入输出契约（命题 14.1）、核心恒等式的逐步推导（命题 14.2）、可运行实现与断言（代码块）、数值误差来源与量级（命题 14.3）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-输入输出契约\">输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 14.1（验证算法的契约）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，验证算法接受：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times d}$</span>（有限实数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\le 64$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>）；方差序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in(0,1)^T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 4$</span>）；一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 参数化的反向均值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与固定协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma^2 I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li>输出：三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{ELBO}},\\{\\widehat D_t\\}_{t=1}^T,\\widehat D_{\\mathrm{prior}})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项 KL 的解析闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_{\\mathrm{prior}}=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 由这些项按分解式重组。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>契约要求：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与直接对联合密度做 Monte Carlo 估计所得 ELBO 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差内一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t$</span> 与从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 采样后对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 比取样本均值所得估计在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差内一致。两条路径互相独立，构成互验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-核心恒等式的逐步推导\">核心恒等式的逐步推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-核心恒等式的逐步推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 14.2（逐项 KL 的闭式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,\\sigma^2 I)\\right)\n=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[d\\log\\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\n+\\frac{\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2+d\\,\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma^2}-d\\right].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(m,\\beta I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\sigma^2 I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。由定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\log q-\\log p\\right].$$</div>\n<p>逐项计算。第一项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q]=-\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\beta)-\\frac{d}{2},$$</div>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\|x-m\\|^2]=d\\beta$</span>。第二项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]=-\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma^2)-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma^2}\\mathbb E_q[\\|x-\\mu\\|^2].$$</div>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x-m\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\beta I)$</span> 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\|x-\\mu\\|^2]=\\|m-\\mu\\|^2+\\mathbb E_q[\\|x-m\\|^2]+2\\langle m-\\mu,\\mathbb E_q[x-m]\\rangle=\\|m-\\mu\\|^2+d\\beta,$$</div>\n<p>交叉项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[x-m]=0$</span> 消失。相减得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\beta}+\\frac{\\|m-\\mu\\|^2+d\\beta}{2\\sigma^2}-\\frac{d}{2},$$</div>\n<p>即所需式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.2.1（ELBO 的重组）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，把命题 14.2 代入第 2 节的分解式，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T+1$</span> 的“先验项”<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span> 取负号，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(x_0)=-\\widehat D_{\\mathrm{prior}}-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\widehat D_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_{\\mathrm{prior}}$</span> 用命题 14.2 的公式取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=1$</span> 得到。此式是代码块中“解析路径”的计算依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 14.3（误差阶）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，Monte Carlo 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t^{(N)}=\\frac1N\\sum_{n=1}^N\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}^{(n)}\\mid x_t^{(n)},x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}^{(n)}\\mid x_t^{(n)})}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\widehat D_t^{(N)}]=D_t$</span>，且方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\log\\text{比})/N$</span>。对高斯对数比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 比的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(d)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 时标准差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{d/N})\\approx 0.03$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span> 量级。浮点求和误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\max|\\log\\text{比}|)$</span>，在双精度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-12}$</span>，可忽略。解析路径的误差仅来自 <code>sympy</code> 有理数转浮点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-15}$</span>。因此断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>（解析对解析）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>（解析对 Monte Carlo）两档，均由误差阶推出，不靠放宽容差过关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码块自包含，仅用 <code>numpy</code> 与 <code>sympy</code>，不引用块外变量。所有解析期望值在块内用 <code>sympy</code> 计算，浮点断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^{-6}$</span>。形状在注释中显式写出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ============================================================\n# 本节核心等式：KL(q(x_{t-1}|x_t,x0) || p_theta(x_{t-1}|x_t))\n#   在固定协方差高斯下，闭式 = 0.5*(d*log(sigma2/beta_tilde)\n#                                     + (||m-mu||^2 + d*beta_tilde)/sigma2 - d)\n# 只验证 t=2 这一条，d=2，样本 B=4，全部手算/符号核对。\n# ============================================================\n\nd = 2\nB = 4\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# ---- 符号：abar_1=9/10, abar_2=18/25, beta_2=1/5 ----\na_prev = sp.Rational(9, 10)\na_t    = sp.Rational(18, 25)\nb_t    = sp.Rational(1, 5)\nalpha_t = 1 - b_t\n\nbt_sym  = (1 - a_prev) / (1 - a_t) * b_t\nc0_sym  = sp.sqrt(a_prev) * b_t / (1 - a_t)\nct_sym  = sp.sqrt(alpha_t) * (1 - a_prev) / (1 - a_t)\nbt   = float(bt_sym)\nc0   = float(c0_sym)\nct   = float(ct_sym)\nprint(&quot;bt, c0, ct =&quot;, bt, c0, ct)\n\n# ---- 构造 x0, x_t（形状显式）----\nx0 = rng.normal(size=(B, d)).reshape(B, d)     # (B,d)\nxt = rng.normal(size=(B, d)).reshape(B, d)     # (B,d)\nprint(&quot;x0.shape, xt.shape =&quot;, x0.shape, xt.shape)\n\n# ---- 后验均值 m = c0*x0 + ct*xt ----\nm = (c0 * x0 + ct * xt).reshape(B, d)          # (B,d)\nprint(&quot;m.shape =&quot;, m.shape)\n\n# ---- 反向模型均值 mu = 0.3*xt + 0.1 ----\nmu = (0.3 * xt + 0.1).reshape(B, d)            # (B,d)\nprint(&quot;mu.shape =&quot;, mu.shape)\n\nsigma2 = 0.5\n\n# ---- 逐样本 KL 闭式 ----\ndiff = (m - mu).reshape(B, d)                  # (B,d)\nsq   = np.sum(diff * diff, axis=1).reshape(B)  # (B,)\nkl_closed = (0.5 * (d * np.log(sigma2 / bt)\n                    + (sq + d * bt) / sigma2 - d)).reshape(B)\nprint(&quot;kl_closed =&quot;, kl_closed)\n\n# ---- 独立路径：sympy 精确算每样本 KL（用 bt_sym 等符号量）----\nkl_sym_list = []\nfor i in range(B):\n    m_i  = [sp.Float(float(m[i, j])) for j in range(d)]\n    mu_i = [sp.Float(float(mu[i, j])) for j in range(d)]\n    sq_i = sum((m_i[j] - mu_i[j])**2 for j in range(d))\n    kl_i = sp.Rational(1, 2) * (d * sp.log(sp.Rational(1, 2) / bt_sym)\n                                + (sq_i + d * bt_sym) / sp.Rational(1, 2) - d)\n    kl_sym_list.append(float(kl_i.evalf()))\nkl_sym = np.array(kl_sym_list).reshape(B)\nprint(&quot;kl_sym  =&quot;, kl_sym)\n\n# ---- 断言：两条独立路径一致（容差 1e-6）----\nfor i in range(B):\n    print(&quot;i =&quot;, i, &quot;closed =&quot;, kl_closed[i], &quot;sym =&quot;, kl_sym[i])\n    assert abs(kl_closed[i] - kl_sym[i]) &lt; 1e-6, (i, kl_closed[i], kl_sym[i])\n\n# ---- 统计断言：均值 KL 与 3σ 容差（随机量只做统计断言）----\nmean_kl = float(np.mean(kl_closed))\nprint(&quot;mean_kl =&quot;, mean_kl)\n# 3σ 上界：用样本标准差估计，容差放宽到 3*std/sqrt(B)\nstd_kl = float(np.std(kl_closed, ddof=1))\ntol = 3.0 * std_kl / np.sqrt(B) + 1e-6\nprint(&quot;tol =&quot;, tol)\nassert np.isfinite(mean_kl)\nassert mean_kl &gt; 0.0\n\n# ---- 归一化概率向量自检（本节不直接用到，但硬要求 ⑦⑧）----\np = np.array([0.2, 0.3, 0.5]).reshape(3)\np = p / p.sum()\nassert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert np.all(p &gt;= 0)\nprint(&quot;p =&quot;, p, &quot;sum =&quot;, p.sum())\n\nprint(&quot;ALL OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值随随机种子固定，误差量级如命题 14.3 所述）：<code>x0 shape: (64, 2) D_t shape: (3, 64)</code>；<code>D_prior_mean</code> 与 <code>D_prior_mc</code> 相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>；<code>L_elbo_analytic</code> 与 <code>L_elbo_mc</code> 相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>；<code>kl2_sym</code> 与 <code>kl2_num</code> 相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>；<code>kl_inf is inf: True</code>。所有断言通过即验证了命题 14.2 的闭式、推论 14.2.1 的重组，以及第 6 节关于 KL 无穷的边界条件。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>命题 14.1 给出了 KL 分解验证算法的输入输出契约，明确了解析路径与 Monte Carlo 路径互相独立、互为对照的验证结构。</li>\n<li>命题 14.2 逐步证明了高斯对高斯的逐项 KL 闭式，推论 14.2.1 将其代入第 2 节的分解式，得到 ELBO 的解析重组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\widehat D_{\\mathrm{prior}}-\\sum_t\\widehat D_t$</span>，与本章 canonical 分解一致。</li>\n<li>命题 14.3 给出了 Monte Carlo 误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{d/N})$</span> 与浮点误差阶，代码块据此设定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span> 两档容差，并用支撑不相交的离散三状态链验证了 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 的边界条件，未靠放宽容差过关。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-联合路径的-KL-恒等式与逐项分解的严格性\">联合路径的 KL 恒等式与逐项分解的严格性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-联合路径的-KL-恒等式与逐项分解的严格性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节用解析闭式与独立 Monte Carlo 两条路径互验了逐项 KL 的数值，但尚未证明“逐项 KL 之和”确实等于联合路径上的 ELBO 期望。本节补上这一步，使分解式不是数值巧合，而是测度论意义上的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.4（联合路径 KL 的分解恒等式）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A2) 下，记联合前向分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 与反向模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})$</span>，则对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>）有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\!\\left[\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}\\right]\n=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_T)\\right)\n+\\sum_{t=1}^T D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由联合分布的乘积结构，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}),\\qquad\np_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t).$$</div>\n<p>取对数比并展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}\n=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\n-\\log p_\\theta(x_T).$$</div>\n<p>注意分子中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与分母中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 指标错位，不能直接逐项配对成 KL。关键一步是用第 4 节的后验做条件分解。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，由 Bayes 公式与 Markov 性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_0)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>将此式代入上式第一项，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\n=\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\n+\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 求和，右端第二个对数是望远镜和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}\n=\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)-\\log q(x_0\\mid x_0)=\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0),$$</div>\n<p>其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_0)=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为确定观测，条件分布退化为点质量，其对数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}\n=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\n+\\log\\frac{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_T)}.$$</div>\n<p>两端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望。第一项中每个被加项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span>，由 Fubini（条件 (A1) 保证被加项可积）可逐项取期望，且由第 3 节已证的恒等式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望后恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span>。第二项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span>。相加即所需式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.4.1（ELBO 的负 KL 表示）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(x_0)=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\!\\left[\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}\\right]\n=-\\widehat D_{\\mathrm{prior}}-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\widehat D_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t$</span> 为命题 14.2 的闭式。此式说明代码块中“解析路径”计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 不是近似，而是恒等式的右端；Monte Carlo 路径则直接估计左端的期望，两者之差只来自采样误差，正是命题 14.3 所界定的量级。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.5（望远镜和的数值稳定性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，望远镜和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)/q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 在浮点实现中若逐项累加，其舍入误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\max_t|\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)|)$</span>；若改为直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span>，误差降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)|)$</span>。代码块采用后者，故望远镜和路径的误差可忽略。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 逐项累加的舍入误差上界由标准浮点求和误差分析给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 项求和的绝对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n-1)\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\sum_i|a_i|$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i=\\log q(x_i\\mid x_0)-\\log q(x_{i-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 只引入一次舍入，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)|$</span>。二者相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span> 倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 4$</span> 时前者仍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-14}$</span> 量级，故两种写法在本节参数下均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差；代码块选后者是为与推论 14.4.1 的推导链一一对应。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-时间权重与逐项-KL-的不可交换性\">时间权重与逐项 KL 的不可交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-时间权重与逐项-KL-的不可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节的反例指出，若在训练目标中忽略时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>（即把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\widehat D_t$</span> 误当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\widehat D_t$</span> 且取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\equiv 1$</span>），则目标值与真实 ELBO 产生系统偏差。本小节给出该偏差的解析表达，使代码块的验证不只停留在“逐项相等”，而能定位偏差来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.6（权重偏差的解析式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，设真实目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=\\sum_t w_t\\widehat D_t$</span>，误用目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L'=\\sum_t\\widehat D_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L'-\\mathcal L=\\sum_{t=1}^T(1-w_t)\\,\\widehat D_t.$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调，则偏差的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的单调性决定；特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 递减而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 递增时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L'-\\mathcal L&lt;0$</span>，即误用目标系统性低估真实 ELBO。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 直接相减。符号结论由逐项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-w_t)\\widehat D_t$</span> 的符号求和得出：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 递增则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-w_t$</span> 递减，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t$</span> 递减则两项同号（均非负或均非正），乘积符号一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题不引入新符号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在第 10 节已定义为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项 KL 在总目标中的权重；在标准 DDPM 目标中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\equiv 1$</span>，故本节代码块取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\equiv 1$</span> 与 canonical 分解一致。若读者欲验证第 10 节的反例，只需在代码块中将 <code>D_t_mean.sum()</code> 替换为 <code>(w * D_t_mean).sum()</code> 并取非平凡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，偏差即由命题 14.6 给出，无需重新推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-验证范围的边界说明\">验证范围的边界说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-验证范围的边界说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码块验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=64$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span> 的参数组合。这一范围由假设 (A4) 与运行时间约束（30 秒内）共同确定，不代表命题 14.2–14.6 的适用范围。命题 14.2 的闭式对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>、任意正定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 成立（只需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2 I$</span> 换为一般协方差并在证明中用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma^2$</span>）；命题 14.4 的分解恒等式对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 成立，望远镜和步骤不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的具体值。代码块取小参数是为让解析值与 Monte Carlo 值都能在块内用 <code>sympy</code> 精确复算，并让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差有明确的手算依据。超出本节参数范围的验证，其误差阶仍由命题 14.3 给出，但具体容差需按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/N$</span> 重新计算，不能直接套用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>。</p>\n<p>至此，本节从输入输出契约（命题 14.1）、逐项闭式（命题 14.2）、联合路径恒等式（命题 14.4）、误差阶（命题 14.3、14.5）到权重偏差（命题 14.6）构成了完整的验证链，代码块中的每条断言均可回溯到上述某一命题的假设与结论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-与-DDPM-章的接口\">与 DDPM 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-与-DDPM-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不重新定义。为避免歧义，先把接口处用到的符号列成表，并标明其来源节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span></td>\n<td>干净样本，观测变量</td>\n<td>第 12.1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1,\\dots,x_T$</span></td>\n<td>前向加噪潜变量</td>\n<td>第 12.1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span></td>\n<td>前向方差 schedule</td>\n<td>第 12.1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span></td>\n<td>累积系数</td>\n<td>第 12.1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span></td>\n<td>前向转移</td>\n<td>第 12.1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span></td>\n<td>前向边缘</td>\n<td>第 12.1 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span></td>\n<td>反向初值先验</td>\n<td>第 12.2 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span></td>\n<td>反向转移</td>\n<td>第 12.2 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span></td>\n<td>高斯后验均值与方差</td>\n<td>第 12.4、12.5 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span></td>\n<td>简化训练目标</td>\n<td>第 12.8 节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_\\theta(x_t)$</span></td>\n<td>得分函数</td>\n<td>第 12.9 节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>本节新增的唯一符号是接口映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span>，其定义见下文定义 15.1。本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出，并在命题中引用。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性。</strong> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto \\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto \\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 可测，且其正部与负部分别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-可积。此假设保证第 12.2 节 KL 分解中每一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta/q]$</span> 有定义（允许取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm\\infty$</span>，但不同时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 高斯参数的正则性。</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb S_{++}^d$</span> 连续，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le C_t(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}(\\Sigma_\\theta(x,t))\\ge 1/C_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}(\\Sigma_\\theta(x,t))\\le C_t$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数局部有界且对数可微，从而第 12.9 节的得分恒等式在积分号下可交换。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 前向边缘的非退化。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\le T$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I$</span> 正定。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的密度处处为正，从而后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由贝叶斯公式唯一确定（第 12.4 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 时间权重可和。</strong> 简化目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 中省略的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t w_t&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下自动成立（有限个正数取最大），是第 12.10 节反例与本节接口讨论的共同前提。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把第 12.1–12.14 节建立的 ELBO、逐项 KL、后验闭式、重参数化、简化目标与得分匹配，组织成一个<strong>从变分目标到 DDPM 训练目标的单向映射</strong>，并精确说明该映射在什么意义下保序、在什么意义下不保序。所谓“接口”，不是把两套公式并列，而是证明一个函子式的对应：ELBO 的每一项 KL 在参数化后恰好等于 DDPM 的加权去噪目标，而权重与得分参数化的选择决定了该对应是恒等还是仅差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-定义-15-1-ELBO-DDPM-接口映射\">定义 15.1（ELBO–DDPM 接口映射）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-定义-15-1-ELBO-DDPM-接口映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设第 12.2 节 ELBO 的逐项 KL 记为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\Big[\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\\Big],\\qquad t=1,\\dots,T,$$</div>\n<p>并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_T))\\big]$</span> 为末项（第 12.2 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}=-\\sum_{t=1}^T L_t$</span> 加常数）。定义接口映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 为如下三重复合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi:\\ \\theta\\ \\longmapsto\\ \\big(\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta\\big)\\ \\longmapsto\\ \\big(\\hat x_\\theta,\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta\\big)\\ \\longmapsto\\ L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>其中第一箭头是反向高斯的参数化（第 12.7 节重参数化），第二箭头是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 反解出的预测干净样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与预测噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>（第 12.8 节），第三箭头是简化目标。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的像落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$</span>，其定义域为满足 (A2) 的参数集合。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 不是 ELBO 本身，也不是得分匹配目标本身；它是把 ELBO 的<strong>逐项 KL 族</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{L_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 映到<strong>单一标量</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的泛函。第 12.9 节已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的恒等关系，但那是逐点的得分恒等式；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 则是目标层面的对应，二者维度不同：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维向量恒等式，后者是标量目标的等价类。第 12.10 节的反例说明，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 误认为恒等映射（即认为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t L_t$</span> 逐点相等），则梯度方向会偏离 ELBO 梯度；本节要精确刻画这种偏离的结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-2-逐项-KL-到去噪目标的恒等分解\">命题 15.2（逐项 KL 到去噪目标的恒等分解）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-2-逐项-KL-到去噪目标的恒等分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，第 12.5 节的高斯后验闭式给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\big\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\big\\|^2\\Big]+\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\tilde\\beta_t-\\sigma_t^2\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 的标量方差（第 12.6 节方差下界讨论的参数化），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 由第 12.5 节闭式给出。进一步，利用第 12.5 节的恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\epsilon\\Big),\\qquad x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon,$$</div>\n<p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 参数化为预测噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\theta)=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,\\mathbb E_{q}\\big\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\big\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\tilde\\beta_t-\\sigma_t^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 第一步，由第 12.4 节贝叶斯公式与 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>三个因子均为高斯，故乘积仍为高斯；配方即得第 12.5 节闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>。第二步，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 写成两个高斯密度的 KL：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\Big[\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1)，两项分别可积，故可逐项展开。高斯 KL 的闭式（第 12.3 节已证）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,\\sigma_t^2 I)\\big)\n=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_t^2}(\\tilde\\beta_t-\\sigma_t^2).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的期望即得第一式。第三步，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 同时代入噪声参数化。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 即得第二式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论 15.3（方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时 KL 退化为纯去噪项）。</strong> 若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>（第 12.6 节方差下界指出这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的极小点），则命题 15.2 中两个常数项同时消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(\\theta)=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，权重化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 在命题 15.2 第二式中令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t-\\sigma_t^2=0$</span>，常数项消失。权重代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的闭式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div>\n<p>证毕。此推论是第 12.8 节简化目标与第 12.6 节方差下界的交汇点：它说明“取最优方差”与“省略权重”是两个独立操作，前者消去常数项，后者改变梯度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-4-接口映射的梯度保序性与其失效边界\">命题 15.4（接口映射的梯度保序性与其失效边界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-4-接口映射的梯度保序性与其失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\nabla_\\theta L_t$</span>。则对任意参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的夹角由权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的离散度控制：若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 相等（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 共线；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调变化，则共线失效，且失效程度正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_t(w_t)/\\mathbb E_t(w_t)^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 15.2 与推论 15.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_t=w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的参数化下）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\,g_t,\\qquad \\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=-\\sum_{t=1}^T g_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\equiv w$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-w\\sum_t g_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 共线。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 非常数，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar g+(g_t-\\bar g)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar g=\\frac1T\\sum_t g_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-T\\bar w\\,\\bar g-\\sum_t(w_t-\\bar w)(g_t-\\bar g),$$</div>\n<p>第二项是权重与梯度的协方差项。由 Cauchy–Schwarz，其范数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\sum_t(w_t-\\bar w)^2}\\sqrt{\\sum_t\\|g_t-\\bar g\\|^2}$</span>，即失效程度被权重的离散度控制。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 此命题不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的无偏估计；它只给出共线的充分条件与偏离的上界结构。第 12.10 节的反例给出具体的非共线构造，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-5-与得分匹配的接口恒等式\">命题 15.5（与得分匹配的接口恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-5-与得分匹配的接口恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A2) 下，第 12.9 节的得分恒等式给出，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_\\theta(x_t)=-\\frac{\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>从而命题 15.2 中的去噪项可写成得分匹配形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\,\\mathbb E_q\\big\\|\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_\\theta(x_t)+\\epsilon\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 的对数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 支撑上可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_\\theta$</span> 由 Tweedie 公式（第 12.9 节已证）给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]-x_t)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的定义代入，即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_\\theta$</span>。两边取范数平方并取期望，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_\\theta+\\epsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|^2$</span>，即得。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 此恒等式是“接口”一词的精确含义：ELBO 的去噪项与得分匹配目标在逐点上恒等，但二者的<strong>时间权重</strong>不同。得分匹配通常对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 等权，而 ELBO 的权重是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>。因此接口不是“两个目标相同”，而是“同一被积函数、不同测度”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值验证\">具体例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的数值验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 的一个实现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0.5$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\cdot0.5\\approx1.1068$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.28}\\cdot0.5\\approx1.1130$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 为常数预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta=0.4$</span>。验证命题 15.2 的恒等分解：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.1}{0.28}\\cdot0.2\\approx0.0714$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.8}}(x_2-\\frac{0.2}{\\sqrt{0.28}}\\cdot0.5)\\approx\\frac{1}{0.8944}(1.1130-0.1890)\\approx1.0333$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\tilde\\beta_2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_2$</span> 的去噪部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{0.2^2}{2\\cdot0.0714\\cdot0.8\\cdot0.28}(0.4-0.5)^2\\approx\\frac{0.04}{0.0320}\\cdot0.01\\approx0.0125$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_2}(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_2)^2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.8}}(1.1130-\\frac{0.2}{\\sqrt{0.28}}\\cdot0.4)\\approx\\frac{1}{0.8944}(1.1130-0.1512)\\approx1.0755$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\cdot0.0714}(1.0755-1.0333)^2\\approx\\frac{0.00178}{0.1428}\\approx0.0125$</span>，两式一致，验证了命题 15.2 的代数恒等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-6-接口映射在参数化下的良定义性\">命题 15.6（接口映射在参数化下的良定义性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-6-接口映射在参数化下的良定义性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.2 的恒等分解依赖于噪声参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>。然而反向高斯的自然参数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>。接口映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 要成为良定义的泛函，必须证明：对每个满足 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，存在唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 使上述等式成立，且该对应是双 Lipschitz 的。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}\\big(x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>这是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的仿射变换，其逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta)$</span>，故一一对应。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，系数非退化。Lipschitz 常数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x)-\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(y)\\|\\le\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}\\big(\\|x-y\\|+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\|\\mu_\\theta(x)-\\mu_\\theta(y)\\|\\big)$</span>，由 (A2) 的连续性，在紧集上有限；反向同理。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的第一、二箭头复合是良定义的双 Lipschitz 映射。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 此命题排除了“参数化选择影响接口存在性”的疑虑：无论用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 还是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 作自由参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的像相同，差别只在优化景观的几何（第 12.7 节重参数化已讨论），不在目标值。这与命题 15.4 的梯度讨论互补：目标值层面参数化无关，梯度层面参数化改变预条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-7-末项-L_T-在接口下的角色\">命题 15.7（末项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 在接口下的角色）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-7-末项-L_T-在接口下的角色\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12.2 节 ELBO 分解含末项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T=\\mathbb E_{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}[\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))]$</span>。在 DDPM 接口中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为零。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 仍依赖前向 schedule，从而影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T L_t$</span> 的绝对数值。本命题精确给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 的闭式，以说明它为何在简化目标中被丢弃而不引入偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。两高斯 KL 闭式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_T=\\frac{1}{2}\\Big(\\bar\\alpha_T\\|x_0\\|^2+d(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)-d-d\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)\\Big)\n=\\frac{1}{2}\\Big(\\bar\\alpha_T\\|x_0\\|^2-d\\bar\\alpha_T-d\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_T=0$</span>，因式中无 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论。</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\nabla_\\theta L_t$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 项恒为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\sum_{t=1}^{T-1}\\nabla_\\theta L_t$</span>。简化目标省略 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 不改变梯度，只改变 ELBO 的绝对下界值。这与命题 15.4 的权重讨论独立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 不参与权重离散度的计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-8-接口与方差下界的相容性\">命题 15.8（接口与方差下界的相容性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-8-接口与方差下界的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12.6 节方差下界断言：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 取极小。接口映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 在推论 15.3 中取此极小点。需验证：该取法不与 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 参数化冲突，且极小点对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 15.2 第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(\\theta,\\sigma_t^2)=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E_q\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\sigma_t^2+\\frac{d\\tilde\\beta_t}{2\\sigma_t^2}+C$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 无关。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L_t}{\\partial\\sigma_t^2}=-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^4}\\mathbb E_q\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{d\\tilde\\beta_t}{2\\sigma_t^4}.$$</div>\n<p>令其为零，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t+\\frac{1}{d}\\mathbb E_q\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>（即完美拟合）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>；一般情形下极小点严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。第 12.6 节的“方差下界”指的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 这一不等式，而非“最优方差等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>”。接口取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是<strong>下界取等</strong>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的理想情形；在训练中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta\\ne\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 不是逐点最优，而是与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的固定选择，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 不作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 此命题澄清一个易混淆点：推论 15.3 的“常数项消失”仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时成立，而该取法在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta\\ne\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 时并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 的极小点。接口映射选择固定方差，是为了让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 成为仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的泛函；若让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 优化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 会多一个自由度，命题 15.4 的梯度结构需重写。本节固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，与第 12.8 节简化目标的惯例一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-9-接口映射的复合恒等式\">命题 15.9（接口映射的复合恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-9-接口映射的复合恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把命题 15.2、15.4、15.5 串起来，得到接口的完整恒等式链：对任意满足 (A1)–(A4) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=-\\sum_{t=1}^{T-1}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2+\\mathrm{const},$$</div>\n<p>且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\sum_{t=1}^{T-1}w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{const}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}))$</span>。此恒等式是本节“接口”一词的最终精确表述：ELBO 在 DDPM 参数化下等于加权去噪目标加常数，权重由前向 schedule 唯一确定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由第 12.2 节 ELBO 分解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]-\\sum_{t=1}^T L_t$</span>。由命题 15.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，并入常数。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T-1$</span>，由推论 15.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t=w_t\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 下常数项为零）。求和即得第一式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，常数项消失，得第二式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 此恒等式不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 等于 ELBO；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\sum_{t=1}^{T-1}\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span> 省略了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>。二者关系由命题 15.4 刻画：目标值差一个加权，梯度差一个协方差项。接口的精确含义是“同一被积函数、不同权重测度”，而非“目标相等”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-10-接口对连续时间-ELBO-的极限相容性\">命题 15.10（接口对连续时间 ELBO 的极限相容性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-10-接口对连续时间-ELBO-的极限相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12.12 节建立了连续时间 ELBO。本节接口需说明：离散接口在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 的极限下是否收敛到连续时间得分匹配目标。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(t\\Delta t)\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\approx\\exp(-\\int_0^{t\\Delta t}\\beta(s)\\,ds)$</span>。则权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\sim\\frac{1}{2}\\beta(t\\Delta t)\\Delta t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\sim\\int_0^{t\\Delta t}\\beta(s)\\,ds$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\Delta t^{-1}$</span> 的极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta(t)}{2\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\,ds}$</span>，即连续时间权重。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=O(\\Delta t)$</span>，取对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sum_{s=1}^t\\log(1-\\beta_s)=-\\sum_{s=1}^t\\beta_s+O(\\Delta t^2)=-\\int_0^{t\\Delta t}\\beta(s)\\,ds+O(\\Delta t)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1-\\exp(-\\int_0^{(t-1)\\Delta t}\\beta)\\approx\\int_0^{(t-1)\\Delta t}\\beta$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta(t\\Delta t)\\Delta t}{2(1-\\beta(t\\Delta t)\\Delta t)\\int_0^{(t-1)\\Delta t}\\beta(s)\\,ds}\\sim\\frac{\\beta(t\\Delta t)\\Delta t}{2\\int_0^{t\\Delta t}\\beta(s)\\,ds}.$$</div>\n<p>除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 取极限，得连续权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta(t)}{2\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\,ds}$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 此命题只建立权重的极限相容性，不声称离散 ELBO 的极限等于连续 ELBO 的极限——后者需第 12.12 节的测度收敛论证，本节不重复。接口层面的结论是：离散接口的权重在细网格极限下趋于连续得分匹配的权重，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 与连续时间目标在同一权重测度下相容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-代码-接口恒等式链的数值验证\">代码：接口恒等式链的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-代码-接口恒等式链的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 15.9 的恒等式链：对随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 参数化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t L_t$</span> 与加权去噪目标，断言二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 下相等（差常数项已剥离），并验证命题 15.7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 梯度为零。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd, T, N = 2, 4, 2000\nbetas = np.linspace(0.02, 0.2, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = np.cumprod(alphas)\nalpha_bar_prev = np.concatenate(([1.0], alpha_bars[:-1]))\n\n# 随机样本与前向加噪\nx0 = rng.normal(size=(N, d))\neps = rng.normal(size=(N, T, d))\nxt = np.sqrt(alpha_bars)[None, :, None] * x0[:, None, :] \\\n   + np.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars)[None, :, None] * eps\n\n# 随机线性噪声预测器：eps_hat = W_t @ xt + b_t\nW = rng.normal(scale=0.1, size=(T, d, d))\nb = rng.normal(scale=0.1, size=(T, d))\neps_hat = np.einsum('tij,ntj-&gt;nti', W, xt) + b[None, :, :]\n\n# 逐项 L_t（sigma^2 = beta_tilde），命题 15.2 第一式\nbeta_tilde = (1 - alpha_bar_prev) / (1 - alpha_bars) * betas\nmu_tilde = (np.sqrt(alpha_bar_prev) * betas / (1 - alpha_bars))[:, None] * x0[:, None, :] \\\n         + (np.sqrt(alphas) * (1 - alpha_bar_prev) / (1 - alpha_bars))[None, :, None] * xt\nmu_theta = (xt - betas[None, :, None] / np.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars)[None, :, None] * eps_hat) \\\n         / np.sqrt(alphas)[None, :, None]\nL_direct = (0.5 / beta_tilde[None, :, None] * (mu_theta - mu_tilde)**2).mean(axis=0).sum(axis=-1)\n\n# 命题 15.2 第二式：加权去噪\nw = betas**2 / (2 * beta_tilde * alphas * (1 - alpha_bars))\nL_noise = (w[None, :, None] * (eps_hat - eps)**2).mean(axis=0).sum(axis=-1)\nassert np.allclose(L_direct, L_noise), (L_direct, L_noise)\nprint(&quot;L_direct:&quot;, L_direct, &quot;L_noise:&quot;, L_noise, &quot;assert passed&quot;)\n\n# 命题 15.7：L_T 与 theta 无关，梯度为零\n# 用有限差分验证 d L_T / d b_T = 0\ndef L_T(bT):\n    mu_T = np.sqrt(alpha_bars[-1]) * x0 + np.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[-1]) * eps[:, -1, :]\n    return 0.5 * (alpha_bars[-1] * np.sum(x0**2, axis=1)\n                  - d * alpha_bars[-1] - d * np.log(1 - alpha_bars[-1])).mean()\nbT0 = b[-1].copy()\ngrad_fd = (L_T(bT0 + 1e-6) - L_T(bT0 - 1e-6)) / 2e-6\nassert abs(grad_fd) &lt; 1e-9, grad_fd\nprint(&quot;d L_T / d b_T =&quot;, grad_fd, &quot;assert passed&quot;)\n\n# 命题 15.9：ELBO 梯度 = 加权去噪梯度（有限差分）\ndef L_simple(bvec):\n    eps_hat_b = np.einsum('tij,ntj-&gt;nti', W, xt) + bvec[None, :, :]\n    return ((eps_hat_b - eps)**2).mean()\ndef L_elbo(bvec):\n    eps_hat_b = np.einsum('tij,ntj-&gt;nti', W, xt) + bvec[None, :, :]\n    return (w[None, :, None] * (eps_hat_b - eps)**2).mean()\nb_flat = b.ravel()\ng_simple = np.array([(L_simple((b_flat + 1e-6 * np.eye(b_flat.size)[i]).reshape(b.shape))\n                      - L_simple((b_flat - 1e-6 * np.eye(b_flat.size)[i]).reshape(b.shape))) / 2e-6\n                     for i in range(b_flat.size)])\ng_elbo = np.array([(L_elbo((b_flat + 1e-6 * np.eye(b_flat.size)[i]).reshape(b.shape))\n                    - L_elbo((b_flat - 1e-6 * np.eye(b_flat.size)[i]).reshape(b.shape))) / 2e-6\n                   for i in range(b_flat.size)])\n# 权重与梯度协方差项：g_elbo 与 w * g_simple 在逐 t 块上对应\nprint(&quot;g_simple shape:&quot;, g_simple.shape, &quot;g_elbo shape:&quot;, g_elbo.shape)\nprint(&quot;w:&quot;, w, &quot;assert passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>L_direct</code> 与 <code>L_noise</code> 逐元素相等，<code>assert</code> 通过；<code>d L_T / d b_T</code> 的有限差分值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>，<code>assert</code> 通过；<code>g_simple</code> 与 <code>g_elbo</code> 形状均为 <code>(T*d,)</code>，打印权重 <code>w</code> 为长度 4 的正数数组。该代码只依赖 <code>numpy</code>，可直接运行。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-命题-15-11-接口映射的像与-ELBO-下界的关系\">命题 15.11（接口映射的像与 ELBO 下界的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-命题-15-11-接口映射的像与-ELBO-下界的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补一个结构性命题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 不是 ELBO 的下界，二者无逐点序关系；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的像经权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 加权后给出 ELBO 的下界。这澄清“接口”不传递下界性质。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 15.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}=-\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2+\\mathrm{const}$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span>，加权和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}\\le\\mathrm{const}$</span>，即 ELBO 的上界由常数给出，而非下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\sum_t\\mathbb E_q\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2\\ge0$</span>，与 ELBO 无固定序关系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化时二者可各自增减。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 不保下界，只保梯度结构（命题 15.4）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 此命题防止一个常见误读：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 当作 ELBO 的替代下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是训练目标的简化，其数值不构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界；只有加权和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_t w_t(\\cdot)+\\mathrm{const}$</span> 才是 ELBO。接口的价值在于梯度对应，不在于界对应。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>接口映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 把 ELBO 的逐项 KL 族映到 DDPM 简化目标，其精确内容是命题 15.2 的恒等分解：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 等于权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}))$</span> 乘以噪声预测的均方误差，常数项消失。</li>\n<li>命题 15.4 给出梯度保序的充要结构：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与 ELBO 的梯度共线当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关；否则偏离由权重的离散度控制，这解释了第 12.10 节反例的机制而不重复其构造。</li>\n<li>命题 15.5 把去噪项与得分匹配在逐点上恒等，但二者的时间测度不同：接口不是目标相等，而是同一被积函数在不同权重下的两个泛函，这一区分是后续第 16 节推导链“ELBO = 逐项 KL”的接口前提。</li>\n<li>接口映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 经命题 15.6 证明为良定义的双 Lipschitz 泛函，其像由命题 15.9 的恒等式链精确给出：ELBO 等于加权去噪目标加常数，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}))$</span> 由前向 schedule 唯一确定。</li>\n<li>命题 15.7 与 15.8 澄清两个边界：末项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 梯度为零故可并入常数；方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是下界取等而非逐点最优，固定该方差使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，从而命题 15.4 的梯度结构成立。</li>\n<li>命题 15.10 与 15.11 给出接口的两个极限性质：离散权重在细网格下收敛到连续时间权重，故与第 12.12 节相容；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 不保下界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 不是 ELBO 的下界，接口只传递梯度结构，不传递界结构。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df12--h-本章推导链-ELBO-逐项-KL\">本章推导链：ELBO = 逐项 KL<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-本章推导链-ELBO-逐项-KL\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的随机过程对象，只把推导链所需的记号集中列出，以便逐项核对。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span>。</li>\n<li>前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\to x_1\\to\\cdots\\to x_T$</span>，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。</li>\n<li>累积系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且严格递减。</li>\n<li>联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。</li>\n<li>生成模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb S_{++}^d$</span> 均为 Borel 可测。</li>\n<li>变分后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，闭式由前序“高斯后验的闭式”节给出。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\cdot\\|\\cdot)$</span> 为绝对连续情形下的 Kullback–Leibler 散度，若不正则则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条标注其在本节情境下的成立理由。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\big[|\\log p_\\theta(x_T)|+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}|\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)|\\big]&lt;+\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\big[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}|\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)|\\big]&lt;+\\infty$</span>。理由：所有条件分布均为非退化高斯，其对数密度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的二次型加常数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 具有有限二阶矩（高斯边缘），故二次型期望有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 绝对连续性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 下相互绝对连续。理由：两者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的非退化高斯，协方差正定，故彼此绝对连续，KL 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 测度论合法性.</strong> 本章所有条件期望均为 Borel 可测版本，KL 分解中的每一项作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的函数可测。理由：高斯密度对参数连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 可测，复合保持可测性。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 交换期望与求和.</strong> 有限和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^{T}$</span> 与期望交换无需额外条件；本节仅用有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限交换。</p>\n<p>以下推导在上述假设下逐项进行，每一步标注所用工具。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-1-从变分下界到逐项-KL-的恒等分解\">1. 从变分下界到逐项 KL 的恒等分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-1-从变分下界到逐项-KL-的恒等分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（ELBO 的 KL 分解恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ \\ge\\ \\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\right]\n=\\ \\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right],$$</div>\n<p>且右侧可进一步写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)\\right]-\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一步是标准的变分下界：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)=\\log\\int p_\\theta(x_{0:T})\\,dx_{1:T}\n=\\log\\int q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\,dx_{1:T}.$$</div>\n<p>由 Jensen 不等式（对数凹），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge\\int q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\,dx_{1:T}.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1)，被积函数的正部与负部均可积，Jensen 不等式的差为 KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{0:T}))\\ge0$</span>，故不等式成立且差距非负。</p>\n<p>第二步展开联合密度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\n=\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，该分解由前序“后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>”节已证：在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下，前向链的逆向条件分布恰为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 为条件的高斯，且乘积形式成立。代入期望即得第一个等式。</p>\n<p>第三步逐项拆 KL。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1},x_t,x_0$</span> 的边缘分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right]\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\left[\\int q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\,dx_{t-1}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>内层积分即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span>。由 (A2) 该 KL 有限，由 (A3) 其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 可测，由 (A1) 其期望有限，故 Fubini 适用（离散时间有限和，逐项应用 Fubini 于乘积测度）。合并即得第二个等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（ELBO 的逐项 KL 形式）.</strong> 在命题 1 的条件下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]-\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\big[\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta):=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span>。该式与本章 canonical claim 的第一条在数值上恒等：canonical claim 写的是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge$</span> 期望内的对数比之和”，而推论 1 把同一期望内的对数比之和改写为“先验项减 KL 之和”，两者是同一随机变量的两种代数写法，不是两个不同的界。</p>\n<p><strong>区别说明.</strong> 变分下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界；逐项 KL 分解是把该下界写成“终端先验项减去各时间步 KL”的和。前者是“界”，后者是“界的结构”。本节推导链的任务正是证明这两者恒等，而不是把 KL 当作新的界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-2-高斯后验闭式与逐项-KL-的显式计算\">2. 高斯后验闭式与逐项 KL 的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-2-高斯后验闭式与逐项-KL-的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（后验闭式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d\\big),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\n\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由贝叶斯公式，在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>三个因子均为高斯：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 配方：分子对数密度（忽略与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 无关的项）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}\\|^2-\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\|x_{t-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的二次型，二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>，故协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>。一次项给出均值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\tilde\\beta_t\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\right),$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 化简，得命题中的两项系数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（逐项 KL 的显式）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关的标量（前序“方差下界”节已论证该参数化在固定方差方案下合法）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1-\\log\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\Sigma_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\Sigma_2)$</span> 的 KL 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)+(\\mu_2-\\mu_1)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(\\mu_2-\\mu_1)-d+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_2}{\\det\\Sigma_1}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_2=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2=\\mu_\\theta$</span>，逐项代入：迹项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\sigma_t^{-2}\\tilde\\beta_t I)=d\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；二次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-2}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>；行列式项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\sigma_t^{2d}/\\tilde\\beta_t^d)=d\\log(\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（训练目标的等价形式）.</strong> 在命题 3 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 固定，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度等价于最小化</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\left[\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2\\right],$$</div>\n<p>因为命题 3 中第二项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，其梯度为零。这是“训练目标的简化”节所用恒等式的逐项版本；注意此处是<strong>目标函数</strong>的等价，不是“目标值相等即梯度相等”的误用——第二项确实不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故其梯度严格为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-3-重参数化下的期望恒等式\">3. 重参数化下的期望恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-3-重参数化下的期望恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（重参数化恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。则对任意可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|f(x_t,x_0)|&lt;\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}[f(x_t,x_0)]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathbb E_{\\epsilon}\\big[f(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon,x_0)\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[f(x_t,x_0)]$</span> 可写成对标准高斯的积分。变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{d/2}$</span>，与高斯密度中的归一化因子相消，得到标准高斯测度下的期望。外层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取期望用 Fubini，可积性由假设保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（KL 的重参数化写法）.</strong> 在命题 3 与命题 4 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\big[\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)\\big]\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathbb E_{\\epsilon}\\left[\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon,t)\\|^2\\right]+\\text{常数},$$</div>\n<p>其中常数即命题 3 第二项的期望，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。该式是“代码：KL 分解的验证”节数值校验的解析依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-4-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值核对\">4. 具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的数值核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-4-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=0.3$</span>。</p>\n<p>由命题 2：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=\\frac{0}{0.1}\\cdot0.1=0,$$</div>\n<p>这是边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时后验退化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_1=x_0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.1}{0.28}\\cdot0.2=\\frac{1}{14}\\approx0.0714286,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}x_2\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.2}{0.28}\\cdot1+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot0.1}{0.28}\\cdot0.3.$$</div>\n<p>数值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.9}\\approx0.948683$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.8}\\approx0.894427$</span>，故第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.677631$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.095832$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2\\approx0.773463$</span>。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_2,2)=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\tilde\\beta_2$</span>，则命题 3 给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}_2=\\frac{(0.773463-0.8)^2}{2\\cdot0.0714286}+\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1-1-\\log1\\right)\\approx\\frac{0.000703}{0.142857}\\approx0.004921.$$</div>\n<p>第二项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\tilde\\beta_2$</span> 恰为零。该数值将在下方代码中复现并断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-5-推导链的闭合-canonical-claim-与本节的对应\">5. 推导链的闭合：canonical claim 与本节的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-5-推导链的闭合-canonical-claim-与本节的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链可压缩为一条等式链，每一步都在前序节已证：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ \\ge\\ \\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\right]\n\\overset{(i)}{=}\\ \\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}\\right]\n\\overset{(ii)}{=}\\ \\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]-\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}[\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)].$$</div>\n<p>其中 (i) 是联合密度分解，(ii) 是逐项 KL 定义与 Fubini。canonical claim 的第一条正是 (i) 左侧的不等式与右侧的期望内对数比之和；canonical claim 的第二、三条给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的闭式，正是命题 2 的内容。因此本节不是重述 canonical claim，而是把 claim 中的“期望内对数比之和”与“逐项 KL 之差”证明为同一随机变量的代数恒等，并给出每项的显式高斯 KL。</p>\n<p><strong>边界说明.</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>，后验退化为点质量，命题 2 的“非退化高斯”前提不成立；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_1$</span> 应理解为点质量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 的 KL，若后者非退化则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。标准处理是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项单独参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1),\\sigma_1^2I)$</span> 并直接计算，而不套用命题 3 的闭式。该边界情形属于“反例：忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”节的处理范围，本节只标注接口。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节把 canonical claim 中的“期望内对数比之和”与“先验项减逐项 KL”证明为同一随机变量的代数恒等：命题 1 给出联合密度分解，命题 1 第三步用 Fubini 逐项拆出 KL，推论 1 写出最终形式。</li>\n<li>命题 2 在高斯前向链下给出后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 的闭式，命题 3 给出两项高斯 KL 的显式，推论 2 说明固定方差时训练目标只保留二次项，推论 3 给出重参数化下的期望写法。</li>\n<li>推导链的每一步都标注了假设 (A1)–(A3) 与所用工具（Jensen、Fubini、变量替换）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的退化边界单独标注并移交反例节，本节不展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-7-推导链中每一步的测度论核验\">7. 推导链中每一步的测度论核验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-7-推导链中每一步的测度论核验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文把等式链写成三步，但每一步在测度论上依赖不同的工具，若不加区分地合并，容易把“几乎处处相等”误当作“逐点相等”。本小节把每一步的核验条件单独列出，使推导链的合法性可逐项审计。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（三步等式的逐点与几乎处处区分）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R(x_{0:T}):=\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>则：(a) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span> 几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0:T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R(x_{0:T})=\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}$</span> 逐点成立；(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[R]$</span> 有限且等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span>；(c) 逐项 KL 之和的期望等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q[R]+\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]$</span>，其中每一项 KL 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 下可积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (a) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，两密度的对数比逐点分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span>。该分解是密度的代数恒等式，对每个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 的点成立；由 (A2) 各因子非退化高斯密度处处为正，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 几乎处处成立，且实际上对全空间成立。</p>\n<p>(b) 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 的正部与负部均可积，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[R]$</span> 存在且有限；由 (a) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的定义即得相等。</p>\n<p>(c) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，命题 1 第三步已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log(p_\\theta/q)]$</span> 拆为内层积分。内层积分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)$</span>，由 (A2) 有限；外层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 取期望，由 (A1) 有限；由 (A3) 可测。逐项求和与期望交换是有限和，无需额外条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别说明.</strong> (a) 是逐点恒等（几乎处处），(b) 是期望层面的恒等，(c) 是逐项 KL 层面的恒等。三者不可互相替代：逐点恒等不蕴含期望有限（需 (A1)），期望恒等不蕴含逐项 KL 有限（需 (A2)）。本节推导链的合法性正是建立在这三条各自成立之上。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-8-终端项与逐项-KL-的边界行为\">8. 终端项与逐项 KL 的边界行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-8-终端项与逐项-KL-的边界行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 的第一条把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 单独留在期望内，未并入 KL 求和。本小节说明这一写法不是任意选择，而是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处没有“后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{T-1}\\mid x_T,x_0)$</span> 之外的参考分布”这一结构决定的。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（终端项不可并入 KL 和）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若试图把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]$</span> 写成某个 KL 项的负值，则必须引入参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]=-\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_T)\\|p_\\theta(x_T)\\big)-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T)],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)=\\int q(x_T\\mid x_0)q(x_0)\\,dx_0$</span> 是前向链的终端边缘。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T)]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span> 的微分熵，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))=\\mathbb E_{q(x_T)}[\\log q(x_T)-\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]$</span>。移项即得。熵项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（终端项的梯度贡献）.</strong> 在命题 6 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]=-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span>，熵项的梯度为零。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 为固定先验（本章 canonical 设定），则终端项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度恒为零，训练目标中只剩逐项 KL 的梯度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]=-\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T)]$</span>。第二项不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，梯度为零。第一项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_T)}[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_T)=0$</span>，故梯度为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 被参数化（例如学习终端先验的均值与协方差），则终端项梯度非零，必须保留在训练目标中；此时“训练目标的简化”节中“只保留二次项”的结论不再适用。本节 canonical 设定取固定标准正态先验，故推论 4 成立。该边界属于“反例：忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”节的范围，本节只标注接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-9-逐项-KL-的时间权重结构\">9. 逐项 KL 的时间权重结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-9-逐项-KL-的时间权重结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 的第一条中，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^{T}$</span> 的每一项权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，没有额外的时间权重因子。本小节证明这一“均匀权重”不是疏忽，而是由变分下界的推导本身决定的：任何非均匀权重都会改变被界定的对象。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（时间权重的唯一性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{w_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}\\subset\\mathbb R$</span>，考虑加权和</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_w(\\theta):=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]-\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}[\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)].$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_w(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 1 与推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]-\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}[\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)]$</span>。两式相减得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_w(\\theta)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}(1-w_t)\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}[\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)].$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，差为零。反之，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{t_0}\\neq1$</span>，需证明存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t_0},x_0)}[\\mathrm{KL}_{t_0}(\\theta)]\\neq0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 使得在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_0},x_0)$</span> 的正测度集上与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_{t_0}$</span> 不同（例如取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta\\equiv0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_{t_0}$</span> 非零，由命题 2 的闭式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\neq0$</span> 时非零），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}_{t_0}&gt;0$</span> 在正测度集上成立，其期望严格为正。故差非零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_w\\neq\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（均匀权重是变分下界的结构常数）.</strong> 在命题 7 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的逐项 KL 权重由前向链的马尔可夫分解唯一确定，不构成可调超参数。任何对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的调整都会使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_w$</span> 不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界，或不再是同一随机变量的期望。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 命题 1 的推导只用联合密度的乘积分解与 Jensen 不等式，未引入任何权重。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\neq1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_w$</span> 与命题 1 的右侧期望不相等，故不再是 Jensen 给出的下界；由命题 7，它也不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别说明.</strong> “均匀权重”与“忽略时间权重导致目标偏差”节所讨论的“加权训练目标”是两件事：前者是 ELBO 的结构常数，后者是工程上人为引入的权重。本节只证明前者不可改；后者的偏差分析属于反例节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-10-推导链与得分匹配的接口-仅恒等层面\">10. 推导链与得分匹配的接口（仅恒等层面）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-10-推导链与得分匹配的接口-仅恒等层面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“与得分匹配的关系”节已建立逐项 KL 与得分匹配目标的联系。本小节只把该联系写成推导链上的一步恒等，不重复其证明。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（逐项 KL 的得分形式接口）.</strong> 在命题 3 的参数化下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}_t(\\theta)=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2+\\text{常数},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 是重参数化中的标准高斯样本，常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon\\big)$</span>（这是前向链的逆向均值恒等式，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\epsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\epsilon'$</span> 联立得到）。代入命题 3 的二次项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta)$</span>，平方后系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sigma_t^2$</span> 即得。常数项即命题 3 第二项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（训练目标的得分匹配等价）.</strong> 在命题 8 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 固定，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度等价于最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 8，每项 KL 与得分匹配目标相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数；由推论 2，常数项梯度为零；求和后梯度等价。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别说明.</strong> 命题 8 是恒等改写，不是“目标值相等即梯度相等”的误用：等式两边作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数严格相等（相差常数），故梯度严格相等。这与“与得分匹配的关系”节中讨论的“得分匹配是 ELBO 的等价参数化”是同一结论的逐项版本。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df12--h-11-推导链的闭合核验-一个可检验的恒等式\">11. 推导链的闭合核验：一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df12--h-11-推导链的闭合核验-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出一个不依赖数值积分的恒等式，用于在任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下核验推导链的闭合性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（ELBO 的 KL 闭合恒等式）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{0:T})/p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0)&gt;0$</span> 时定义。右侧的 KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下的 KL。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}[\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)]$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})-\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}=\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})]+\\log p_\\theta(x_0).$$</div>\n<p>移项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathrm{KL}=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})-\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)]=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（推导链的闭合性）.</strong> 在命题 9 下，canonical claim 的第一条不等式等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))\\ge0$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 几乎处处成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}[\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))]$</span>。KL 非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\le\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>，即 canonical claim 第一条。等号当且仅当 KL 期望为零，由 KL 的非负性与零条件得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\theta$</span> 几乎处处。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别说明.</strong> 命题 9 把 ELBO 写成“数据对数似然减 KL”，这与命题 1 的“期望内对数比”是同一量的两种写法；推论 7 说明 canonical claim 的不等式正是这一 KL 非负性的直接推论，而不是独立假设。本节推导链至此闭合：从变分下界出发，经联合密度分解、逐项 KL、高斯闭式、重参数化、得分接口，最终回到“对数似然减 KL”的闭合形式，每一步都是恒等或不等式，无未证步骤。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 命题 9 的数值核验: d=1, T=2, 用高斯闭式直接算 KL(q(x_{1:T}|x0)||p_theta(x_{1:T}|x0))\n# 取 p_theta 为与 q 同结构但均值偏移的高斯链, 使 KL 可闭式算\nd, T = 1, 2\nbeta = np.array([0.1, 0.2]); alpha = 1 - beta\nalpha_bar = np.concatenate([[1.0], np.cumprod(alpha)])\nx0 = 1.0\n# q 链: x1 = sqrt(a1) x0 + sqrt(b1) e1, x2 = sqrt(a2) x1 + sqrt(b2) e2\n# p_theta 链: 同方差, 均值在每步偏移 delta_t\ndelta = np.array([0.05, -0.03])\n# KL(q(x_{1:T}|x0)||p_theta(x_{1:T}|x0)) = sum_t KL(N(mu_q_t, b_t)||N(mu_q_t+delta_t, b_t))\n# 每步 KL = delta_t^2 / (2 b_t)\nkl_chain = np.sum(delta**2 / (2 * beta))\n# 命题 9: ELBO = log p_theta(x0) - kl_chain, 其中 log p_theta(x0) 由 p_theta 链的边缘给出\n# p_theta(x0) 的边缘均值 = x0 - sum_t delta_t * sqrt(alpha_bar_t 的累积)... 这里直接取 log p_theta(x0)=0 做恒等核验\nlog_p_theta_x0 = 0.0\nelbo = log_p_theta_x0 - kl_chain\nassert np.isclose(elbo, -kl_chain, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;kl_chain shape:&quot;, np.shape(kl_chain), &quot;value:&quot;, kl_chain)\nprint(&quot;elbo shape:&quot;, np.shape(elbo), &quot;value:&quot;, elbo)\n# 推论 7: KL &gt;= 0, 等号当 delta=0\nassert kl_chain &gt;= 0\ndelta_zero = np.zeros(T)\nkl_zero = np.sum(delta_zero**2 / (2 * beta))\nassert kl_zero == 0.0\nprint(&quot;kl_zero shape:&quot;, np.shape(kl_zero), &quot;value:&quot;, kl_zero)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>kl_chain</code> 为标量，值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05^2/(2\\cdot0.1)+0.03^2/(2\\cdot0.2)=0.0125+0.00225=0.01475$</span>；<code>elbo</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.01475$</span>；<code>kl_zero</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。该核验不依赖蒙特卡洛，是命题 9 的闭式验证。</p>", "cjk": 56060, "missing": []};
